  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween08.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Uh-oh, I can’t believe you use shallow tricks!, Carry out your penalty and then come back. Meet Werewolf is your penalty. I think you don’t need explanation where it is?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween08.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Wow~ You came back without eaten by Werewolf! Then take your test again.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween08.ntk_1_1_1">
