    <VALUE Lang="th">--------------------------------------------------</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Besides that, there is Secret Pumpkin Graveyard. If you killed the Pumpkin there, they will drop the very good items (as legend said). In order to go to the map, hunt mobs in Pumpkin Graveyard to get Secret Graveyard's Pumpkin Trace item. Once you bring it to me, I can help you to go to the entrance.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">So, what are you waiting again, go~~</VALUE>
