  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_santa.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I have already prepared the gifts for the kids, but I cannot go because the evil Stray Sheep</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">took away the parts of my Rudolf Bike. Can you get those parts back from the evil Stray Sheep?</VALUE>
