  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_swordevent01.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Our Swordsman class is the strongest one. However there are so many new class has been appeared lately.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That makes our class became weak and weaker. But!! Do not disappointed because I want to let you know that our class is got stronger again ^__^</VALUE>
