  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_swordevent02.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Actually we are looking for the Hidden Information inside of the 3 Dungeons there but we cannot enter it for some reasons. Because of that, we would like to request some help from you!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
