    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Achievement Award</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_10_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Exemplary Award</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_10_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Specialty Award</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">School has informed me that there are assailants threatening the students with daggers in front of the main gate. Higher grade students would not have any problem but those who just got out there must be in trouble . Go help the fellow students.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Drunk Drunkard can also be a dangerous factor for students. I am worried that our students would follow such behavior. Get out there and eliminate them.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">All these repeated tasks may make you bored but I believe that purifying this corrupted world can be the true duty of the students. Get out through the school main gate to get to the city. There are many dogs gone mad and Cleaners without consciousness are out there so go eliminate them.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am worried about the new students who just came into the school. I believe that you are strong enough to dominate an assailant called Biranne Jr. so go eliminate him.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Great Job! Now, all the students will be able to move around more safely.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Recently, a SG school student has given me a design full of weird symbols. I studied it really hard but could not understand it. As a Scientist, you must be able to find out something about it, so take this to Suna Jo.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, you've got it decoded, great job! I will write you a recommendation. Show this to Suna and receive what you need.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You will be able to meet Technology Teacher of Phoenix School at Phoenix Hole</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Guess you already got enough explanation, just ride it first and if you need more explanation then come talk to me again.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You might be able to find out while carrying out the missions I give then you might also be able to improve your ability.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Would you like to give it a try?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Start Step 1</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_2_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Start Step 2</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_2_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Start Step 3</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_2_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Start Step 4</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_2_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Start Step 5</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It is not students' fault that as they become higher grades, they tend not to wear the uniforms anymore. Fighting, just wearing the uniforms has limit. Therefore, I would like to hand out uniforms with strong durability to help them…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell him you want one too</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've always wanted to take care of those used and old books unattended. If you gather enough of them I will give you the uniform. You didn't think you can just receive the uniform for free, did you?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You have gathered as much as I wanted. Great job. Here take this, keep up the good work.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">In order to use the taxi, go collect me 10 used books from the trash piles in the dorm then I will issue a Taxi Card.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You are a very realistic student. One of my old friend had mentioned about "Material Transform". Go find that friend for the details.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">아이런맨 슈트는 그야말로 현대 과학 기술의 정수가 모두 담겨진 걸작품이지. 아직 실험 단계라 출력이 완전하지 않다는 것은 명심해.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">아이런맨 슈트 교환권을 스페셜 슈트(5피스)로 교환한다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_25_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">아이런맨 슈트 교환권을 울트라 슈트(5피스)로 교환한다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_25_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Click shortcut icon of Extra Activity to confirm the goal and carry out the instructed task then you will be rewarded with Title which you can put above your name and the Activity Point. Complete enough activities to acquire activity points and go see "Extra Activity Teacher' and buy special item it.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Many number of students are performing investigation, research and given missions in Power Plant after its discovery. However, they have gotten competitive because there is a rumor saying that whoever dominates the area will be able to find a clue to get to the Another World.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Carrying out a very special mission is called Extra Activity. Extra Activity would be collecting particular item or eliminating particular monster and when you are done, you will be rewarded with the Title which is to put above your name and activity points. With enough activity points, you can buy very special items.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">A very special Power Plant has been discovered which is connected through the tunnel behind Saint HQ. Currently, teachers are dispatched to carry out special mission given after the discussion of the deans of each school. There are not enough information gathered yet but I hope a excellent student like yourself can borrow them hands.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Put your efforts into the given mission</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">From what I have heard so far, all the life forms such as the trees and plants are sick. In order to figure out what the host is, it requires help from many students. Please go there and find dispatched Extra Activity Teacher.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The energy generated from Power Plant to Research Complex?.. Hmm.. Why?... It would lead me somewhere..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Once, I had investigated all the places hit by the meteoric shower. But I could not find anything special. Oh! Saint HQ had covered up the meteoric shower. I didn't know why then but I think I can put the pieces together now.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Police in Root Hole wants to help you earn new power. Go meet him and ask for help.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Machinator in Prison wants to help you earn new power. Go meet him and ask for help.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_34_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Seung Hee Yoon in Head.B U-ground wants to help you earn new power. Go meet him and ask for help.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Student Director (Dispatched) in St.Power Plant wants to help you earn new power. Go meet him and ask for help.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's the time to break the limit. Good luck!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Urga in St. Research Cplx wants to help you earn new power. Go meet him and ask for help.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_38_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Student Director at Saint Power Plant is collecting participants who want to go to Lost City. Many students are applying for that. Why don't you go there and find him?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Great job!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you are worried about your journey again, come find me..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is it. In order to accept the Extreme's power and become more powerful, you have to rearrange your skills.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I see..the tunnel construction in Root Hole is almost complete.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now that the full scale investigation will be conducted, you came forward to volunteer?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please give me some time to think.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_41_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Good choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Although we don't know what kind of danger awaits, if it's you then I believe you can overcome it.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I will help you with the application form.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You should hurry to Root Hole, to the tunnel's construction site.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_43_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Are you talking about the storage room spare key?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Construction Supervisor who went to Middle Hole should have it. I tried to contact him but to no avail.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There might be some disturbances there…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You should look for him and ask for the key yourself.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I haven't seen you in a while…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">In order to check how many students have made it back, I need to record it otherwise I wouldn't be able to remember.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Get attendance checked</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It can be dangerous for newbies to use so please be careful. It would be nice to use your ability for something different.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I wasn't able to know what was going on outside of the school. Hard working students must be compensated for their efforts. Eliminate Blood Drinkers in front of school and collect the tokens.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Very well. I will compensate you with a small reward which can help you carrying out missions.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramafriend.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Only the one who summoned me can use the shop. Not everyone.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramafriend.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Item Trade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramaleader.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I don't have anything to say to the other classes other than Shaper.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramaleader.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Item Trade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramaleader.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I will try my best to not dissapoint them.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramaleader.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Item Trade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramaleader.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listen</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramaleader.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Curious about something?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramaleader.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Shaper</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramaleader.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Shapeshifting</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramaleader.ntk_2_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about fighting style</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramaleader.ntk_2_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about skill points</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramaleader.ntk_2_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramaleader.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">During the fall of the Shapeshifter community, some people managed to absorb their abilities. Thus, these skills that you currently possess, is the result of our research and training for several months. We are currently in the process of rebuilding and h</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramaleader.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Shaper class students can shapeshift into DEX, POW, and INT type characters. Based on the situations, they can shapeshift accordingly and this make it a very valuable skill. I highly recommend you to use this shapeshifting ability during PvPs.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramaleader.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Shaper class can use their shapeshifting abilities to fool enemies. For example, they can pretend to die when they are overwhelmed by enemies. And then strike the enemy from behind when the enemies think that they have won. Not so fair, you say? Well, som</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramaleader.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Shaper class will start from level 150. They will also have the related stats and skill points from that level. Please be mindful when allocating your stats and skill points.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramaworkmate.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Where would you like me to take you?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramaworkmate.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Bus</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_dramaworkmate.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Purchase Ticket</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Growl~ My body needs nutriments.. Kekeke</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask who he is</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Warn him about the danger</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm a researcher.. growl.. You would make a fine ingredients.. Kekeke.. Would like to do a research with me someday?.. Kekeke..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">No, thanks</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ok</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I will guide you to the squashy world. Kekeke..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Dangerous? Kekeke.. After all, it won't be too bad to be an offering. I do have to have some responsibility for what happened to those Priests.. Guess, this is the end of my humanity.. Now, you'd better get going. Kekeke..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_event01.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hey, may I help you?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_event01.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Astral Gravel(15D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_event02.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hey, may I help you?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_event02.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Astral Fragment(15D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">May I help you with anything?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Eliminate Labor Robot II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">A task requires courage</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Jealusy and Alienation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="th">[Limited a day] Creepy Screaming From Forbidden Tower</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_14">
    <VALUE Lang="th">[Limited a day] Alluring Venom</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_15">
    <VALUE Lang="th">[Limited a day] Horrible Mutants</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Power Plant</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Power Plant Status Report I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Power Plant Status Report II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Eliminate Tech Researcher (Elite) I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Eliminate Guard Robot I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Eliminate Labor Robot I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Eliminate Tech Researcher (Elite) II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Eliminate Guard Robot II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Fierce battles keep occurring in Lost Island.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">They are having a hard time recently as Mutant Citizens suddenly appears too much. So can you help them to overcome this situation?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I have been investigating this area for a few days and I found out this place was hit by meteoric shower. Plus, I have an intel saying that there is a meteorite outputing powerful energy had fell here but could not be able to find it. I still need more clues.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I found confidential documents about Research Complex and Power Plant. According to the documents, Dr. TK has constructed power plant to source the power for research complex. It may be a obvious info but please do convey it to 'Student Director (Dispatched)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I found confidential documents about Research Complex and Power Plant. According to the documents, Dr. TK has constructed power plant to source the power for research complex. It may be a obvious info but please do convey it to 'Student Counselor</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Creatures mutated by virus are getting out of hands. It would cause a catastrophe if they manage to get out from Power Plant. Please take care of them before they get out. It would make the research of teachers and students here whole lot easier.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Discovered very powerful human type creatures near Solar Power Facility. You must defeat them first in order to find a very important clue. I expect very strong resistance... I am worried because the student who went out to do this mission is not still back yet.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Long time ago, Dr. TK has forced an experiment on live bodies of the workers and people here soley for his ambition. Many people showed side effects but some had managed to escape and went back to their formal lives... Who is Nurse Trainee (Dispatched)??</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Creepy sound is coming from the top of the Forbidden Tower.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Due to the sound, many students can’t sleep well and suffer from nightmare.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Can you find what happens there?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Assassins dispatched to Lost City and Industry Complex have a passionate discussion about deadly venom which it put on enemy’s weapon.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I can’t understand why they are so obsessed about it, but can you collect venom samples for them?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ugh.. Surprised to see somebody who can beat me. Tell me what you want.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Talk to her</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What is there to talk about? I await your order.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her about Lucian and Liz</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What the.. I should teach him a lesson!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her to join Garansanoa</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Wrong.. This is the point where this world and the other world is linked.. If anybody stays here too long he or she will become the guardian.. Left with just one thought, protecting this door..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if she needs any help</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">In case you are able to acquire stronger power.. You must stop the Lucian's Ambition.. And, don't forget to tell it to our world also..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her, you promise</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I won't be able to remember the conversation we have made today when you come visit me next time.. Good bye..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What are you looking for?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Set as Starting Point</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listen to conversation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Liz' message</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="th">암흑의 목걸이에 대해 묻는다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="th">네 번째 파편을 보여준다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_14">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Message of Obinine</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_15">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Inform Obinine</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask who he is</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if he needs help</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Get Confirmation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if he needs help</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Urga's Message</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Meet Urga</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the condition of this place</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh.. You mean around here? Well, I've heard that there is an old man down at the South-east from here, saying he is guarding a warehouse or something. I once had gave him a Spiritual sphere but it didn't help him much. I think it would be a good idea for you to pay him a visit when you have chance.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">풋내기인줄 알았는데 제법이군. 자네 혹시 암흑의 목걸이에 대해 알고 있나? 강력한 암흑의 힘이 담긴 이 목걸이는 착용하는 이에게 무한한 힘을 제공하지. 하지만 이계가 뒤틀리는 과정에서 부서져 이 세상 어딘가에 그 파편들이 흩어져 버렸지. 만일 파편들을 모아 가져온다면 암흑의 목걸이를 제작해 주도록 하지. 자넨 그럴만한 자격이 충분하니까… 물론 그걸 찾기는 굉장히 어려울꺼야. 최근에 본사, 큐브랩스, 세인트연구단지, 연구단지 지하에서 파편을 보았다는 소문이 있긴 하지만 아직 확인되지는 않았지. …어쩌면 야생종들이 파편을 주워 다닐 수도 있겠군. 파편을 찾아보겠다면 본사 건물부터 시작하는게 좋을꺼야.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">제게 왜 그런 호의를 베푸시는 겁니까?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘암흑의 목걸이’는 주인을 선택한다고 알려져 있네. 자네가 그 목걸이의 주인이라면 어차피 자네에게 갈 운명인 것이지. 솔직히 자네가 그 목걸이 파편을 찾아오리라고는 생각하지 않아. 이만큼 전사 티가 풍기도록 성장한 것이 대견해서 해 준 말이니까 너무 신경쓰지는 않아도 돼.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">그렇다면 어떻게 파편으로 목걸이를 제작하시는 거죠?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">후훗. ‘암흑의 목걸이’가 왜 그토록 대단한 물건이겠나? 파편만 있으면 이계의 마나를 약간만 불어넣어도 저절로 원 상태로 돌아간다고 알려져 있어. 물론 이계의 뒤틀림 정도의 강한 힘이 작용하지 않으면 부서질 일도 거의 없겠지만 말일세. 이계의 사람이 아닌 자네는 결코 불가능한 일이지만 우리들은 누구나 가능한 일이지.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">파편을 찾으러 가겠다고 말한다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_13_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">이제 미완성된 암흑의 목걸이와 이계의 마나를 가지고 사제에게로 가서 암흑의 목걸이의 힘을 부활시키게나. 드디어 암흑의 목걸이의 부활된 힘을 보게 되겠군. 하지만 반드시 미완성된 암흑의 목걸이를 벗은 후 부탁을 해야 하네. 착용 상태에서는 이계의 마나의 힘이 작동되지 않으니….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We've had very high pride until that betrayal Lucian showed up. Obinine? You met Obinine? Awe.. I see.. I will go see him soon.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am a man who lives in the darkness. I envy someone like yourself who lives in this sunlight.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I have eliminated many of them but it is not easy eliminating the wild ones. I would like you to eliminate the animal which walks the earth and its tamer.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Your good deed will be compensated someday.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you go further south, you will be able to see a tower which beams the light to the sky. There will be a artificially made small stream to the south of that tower. Not like other animals, this one will not attack humans. It will be able to speak human language so go talk to him.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmm.. South?!..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Would you please go ask Urga that where did the man and women went exactly? Please, I have to know where they have went to.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There was a message from Priest. It seems like my friends are at the basement of the tower.. First go talk to Priest for details.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">As expected, he is moving as his ambition.. Gainun.. Please go tell Liz that I will go save him as soon as I make contact with others.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">May I ask what you're looking for?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Change Save Point</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange [Bread]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange [Pumpkin Neckwear [15D]]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_14">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Purplish Dragon Swrd. Box (15D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_15">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Purplish Lite Dragon Swrd. Box (15D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_16">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Purplish Slayer Dag. Box (15D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_17">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Purplish Ugrd. Iron Bow Box (15D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_18">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Purplish Spar Aly. Bow Box (15D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_19">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Purplish Spar Lite Aly. Bow Box (15D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_20">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Purplish Spirits Spear Box (15D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_21">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Purplish Dragon Wand Box (15D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_22">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Purplish Tough Glv. Box (15D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_23">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Purplish Lite Tough Glv. Box (15D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_24">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Purplish Hvy. Tough Glv. Box (15D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_25">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Request Level Compensation Quest</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_26">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Start "Advance Physics Teacher's Test"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_27">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Start "Advance Physics Teacher's Test"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_28">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Moon Lamps</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0_29">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Moon Bear Costumes</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">지도선생님들은 본관 1층의 중심에 있는 써클룸에들 계세요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">본관 1층에 들어가셔서 'M'키를 누르시면 써클룸을 찾아보실 수 있을거예요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Good luck!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next step, you need try talking with school helper.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Good luck!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you complete this quest, you can get 2 stats Point.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, do you have Dormant Moon Lamps?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Moon Lamps</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_16_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Moon Bear Leather Apparel Coupons</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You need to collect 5 tickets to exchange for Moon Bear Costumes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Do you have 15 tickets??</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Moon Bear Costumes</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">네트워크 연결상태 불량으로 인해 정보 검색은 할 수 없습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">진심으로 환영합니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">이번의 신입생들을 위해서는 특별히 선물을 준비했어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">키보드의 'H' 키를 누르시면 단축키 등의 도움말을 볼 수 있어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">아이템이나 스킬에 대해서는 본관 안에 있는 매점 판매원을 만나시면 더 자세한 설명을 들으실 수 있을거예요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">현재 서 계시는 곳은 학원 내의 옥외지역이고, 전투지역으로 분류되어 있어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품 매매 등의 거래나 초반 퀘스트 수행을 위해서는 본관 안으로 들어가셔야 하는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">키보드 'M' 키를 누르시면 볼 수 있는 전체지도의 '본관' 을 찾아 들어가시면 내부로 가실 수 있어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">본관에 들어가시면 왼편에서 찾을 수 있는 매점 판매원을 만나보세요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">신입생들을 위한 선물을 받도록 도와줄거예요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">본관으로 들어가는 현관의 위치를 모르시면 키보드의 'M' 키를 눌러 볼 수 있는 전체 지도를 이용해 주세요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">혹시 지금 화면 하단에 반짝이는 아이콘이 보이지 않으세요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">만약 보인다면 퀘스트가 진행중이라는 거예요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">'T' 키를 누르셔서 퀘스트 내용을 확인하시고 그대로 수행하셔야 해요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_8_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">구슬이 어떻게 만들어졌는지는 모르지만, 어느정도의 힘을 증명하는 것 같아요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">그래서 영령구슬을 가져가면 지도선생님들께서 등급에 맞는 스킬문서로 교환해 주시죠</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_9_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hah.. Hah..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if she is a friend of Garansanoa</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand over the Tear of Ganil</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Vigor of Warrior to Heart of Warrior</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask how to get to Another World</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand over the Magical Spirit Stone</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_1_0_14">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Heart of Warrior to Spirit of Warrior</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask what brought her down here</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask how to stop Lucian</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand over the orb</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Gainun</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her what happened with Gainun</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if she needs any help</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Garansanoa's message</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if she needs any help</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's wouldn't be that easy as it may seem.. Take good care of the relic called Vigor of Warrior which I gave you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is a Gate which is connected to our world.. But time is not right yet and no one can crossover now.. Anyways, there will be Gainun in front of that gate, guarding.. He has been tricked by Lucian and will attack as soon as he finds you so be carful.. I wish you can talk to him..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell Garansanoa that Lucian is after Adoniechus and also Gainun is guarding the Gate to Daramai..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">When will they be coming.. I don't think I can hold this place much longer by myself..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Adoniechus is getting unstable every second. Usually I would do it myself, if not for the wound but.. So what I am saying is that, would you please go get Tear of Ganil from Arc and Cannon Buster.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Let me make the Vigor of Warrior into a more powerful relic. Unleash the necklace from your neck. Tell me when you are ready.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_15_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her you are ready.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You will need the relic called Spirit of Warrior which every one of our friends wear.. Must be able to make you one too.. Go take the Magical Spirit Stone from Gainun. Remember, you must dominate him first.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Let me make the Heart of Warrior into a Spirit of Warrior. Unleash the necklace from your neck. Tell me when you are ready.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_17_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her you are ready.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What a brutal fate she has..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am Gransanoa's friend but would you plaese introduce yourself first?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Introduce yourself</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, you are from this world.. Sorry.. I guess I am a bit too edgy, going through so many different things.. I'm Liz.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if she is feeling alright</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well you blush me by worrying about me but don't worry! Thank You! Anyways, I guess you are strong since you have made it to here. You must have scared the traitor away.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her it was a piece of cake</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Whew.. It was easy, huh? In about one hour Lucian will appear again. Please eliminate him again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">After our party had been separated, Garansanoa, Gainun and me have came to this place. I knew it then.. There are two of very important things located here in this basement.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask why Lucian is hostile</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Isn't it obvious what the ambitious man would want? Power! Obsession for the things that could help enlarge the power! The eagerness to own the Adoniechus..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Adoniechus</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Adoniechus is the center of the world where all the powers gather and also where all the powers of the world was created. In the world where you came from it is call the absolute point.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Lucian carries 5 mysterious orbs on him all the time. If anybody is able to take those five orbs from Lucian, he or she will be able to make a relic and go against him.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_iss.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What's up?? I can't help you, anything</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Open Shop</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Mesil Potion</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange 16 Spiritual Spheres</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Show her the Design</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_14">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand over the Code Decoder</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_15">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Show her the Letter of Introduction</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_16">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her you need a Ring</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_17">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand over the Design you found</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_18">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her you need a Necklace</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_19">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand over the Design you found</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">listen a story</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_20">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask her about weapon remodeling</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_21">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand over the collected materials</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_22">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her you want a better ring.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_23">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand over the carving cord</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_24">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask her to make you a weapon</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_25">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand over the collected materials</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_26">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask her about the Oblivion Potion</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_27">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand over the ingredients of Oblivion Potion</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_28">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask her if she does not have any friend</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_29">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Tarsan's letter</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Mixing 'Ganil Powder' to 'Ganil Piece'</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_30">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hear her story</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_31">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her you want a reformed weapon</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_32">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her you want a weapon</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_33">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Theojelite Belt Compounding Scroll.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_34">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Achieving level 260 verification.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Mixing 'Bail Powder' to 'Bail Piece'</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Pass the research information.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listen Conversation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I do have basic parts.I am warning you in advance, don't ask for it for free.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I like a person who is precise about calculation.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask her where other parts are</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Those in the basement must be at where they were, right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Yes, I have heard that story.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Close acquaintance of mine saw unidentified assailants having the parts..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Solidified stone can teleport materials and I believe that it must have went missing when the sacred line collapsed.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Of course, we will need to study more for more accurate information.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask her if these are better parts.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What I have here is not powered parts.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I don't have things like Hybrid Module or Plasma Injector.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Huh? Did you say, what are those?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Do you wanna know? Go out there and search the unidentified assailants.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Maybe, I mean.. they might have those..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her to go make it by herself</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You are thinking too simply.If I was that genius, would I be here?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I need to find other department students to make it. Don't give me that look..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please go find the student of my department for me!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I will have to ask Student Director first.. Hope you don't mind.. Foundation has various labs, you've heard about the Zoological and Botanical Labs right? Also there is a not so famous engineering lab. SRC is a tool developed there.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask what SRC stands for</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">SRC stands for Saint Rising Craft.I've only heard about this but it actually is a tool used in the space but Dr. TK has took it over from the government. It is a confidential and I can say no more to a student like yourself.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask what kind of equipment are there</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">When I just came here, there were so many stuffs to be improved.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Lab has made the Skylock as a standard equipment but it just wasn't good enough for me.Therefore, Science Dept. has joined since the Wildcat development. The department head designed something called Spa..S... what was it called?..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if it is supposed to be called SRC only.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You've got it all wrong..Not only Hover is SRC.There are other vehicle types too..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oops.. I shouldn't have said that..Let's stop here. Student Director might get mad at me</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm Sun-A Jo, my class is Science</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I think I'm high class than you.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Why are you here?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I need some documents. If you go to Root Hole, please look for the documents from Pretty Veyah, Haring Braso</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is the reward for you as my appreciation. Please accept it</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Erm....You can help me, I heard about research document stolen by Spice Girl. Can you help me get back from them?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Reject</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_23_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Agree</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It is not easy to get back, god bless...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You get it back.... Thank you very much. This is a gift for you, Mesil Power.Please let me know if you want the power, i can help you.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Cannot get the power immedeately, you let me keep the Mesil Potion, i give you a book.After you read it, you will get the power.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_27_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange it for skill scroll Empo's Wisdom.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_27_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange "Wayne's Awakening" Skill Book</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_27_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange "Toal's Eyes" Skill Book</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_27_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange "Veina's Pace" Skill Book</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_27_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange "Daran's Breath" Skill Book</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_27_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange "Kumora's Leap" Skill Book</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Wow! A Spiritual Sphere with mysterious power. Let me exchange it to a skill scroll for you, so you can acquire the power of Mesil.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_28_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange it for skill scroll Empo's Wisdom.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_28_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange "Wayne's Awakening" Skill Book</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_28_0_3"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 土沃之眼（175級／劍道部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Toal's Eyes (Lv175, Class=130, Item=175/70)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Toal's Eyes (Lv175, Class=130, Item=175/70)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Toal's Eyes (Lv175, Class=130, Item=175/70)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Toal's Eyes (Lv175, Class=130, Item=175/70)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_28_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange "Veina's Pace" Skill Book</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_28_0_5"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 達拉安的氣息（175級／氣功部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Daran's Breath (Lv175, Class=520, Item=176/71)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Daran's Breath (Lv175, Class=520, Item=176/71)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Daran's Breath (Lv175, Class=520, Item=176/71)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Daran's Breath (Lv175, Class=520, Item=176/71)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_28_0_6"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 終極．庫莫拉之躍（107級／終極部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Kumora's Leap (Lv107, Class=48, Item=179/95)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Kumora's Leap (Lv107, Class=48, Item=179/95)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Kumora's Leap (Lv107, Class=48, Item=179/95)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Kumora's Leap (Lv107, Class=48, Item=179/95)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Always, I hate outside..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Of course, I hate to fight and running as like you.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Where have you been keeping yourself?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh.... Grocer request you come and visit me? If you really want to know the content, you need to get the Decoder. You can go Phoenix campus to get the Decoder from Shocker.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You get it back! That is great you have decoder. Please pass it to Grocer.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Grocer, this is the item......you.....need.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_32_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I want DEX type weapon</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_32_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I want POW type weapon</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_32_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I want INT type weapon</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_32_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Shaman Weapon Needed</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_32_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Prefer weapons for Scientists</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_32_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Prefer weapons for Assassin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_32_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask a weapon for Magic Trick</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Select item type.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Take the Cestus</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_33_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Take the Heavy Cestus</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_33_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Take the Vital Cestus</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Select item type.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_34_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Take the Sword</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_34_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Take the Blade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_34_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Take the Vital Sword</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Select item type.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Take the Bow</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_35_0_2">
