  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_49_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Receive Vital Bow</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's a secret. And, if I've explain it to you, you can't understand.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Because of, it's very high level.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Why are you come here?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Not satisfy current ability? Want to reset? You just need to collect some material and drink it.........It can help you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about situation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Material need Bone Powder,Fermentation Water,Cigarette Butt. Not sure it success or not</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_51_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Believe you can do it</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Erm, Can you help me collect?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_52_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Believe you can do it</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_53_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You collected already, then I wanna try to do it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_53_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Wait for While</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_54_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Item make success, still not perfect. But it still can use.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_54_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_55_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I don't think that is a problem, recently I heard people said in Leonine have a weird peopl look alike my friend. Can you help me check it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_55_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Help to search</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_56_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Heard it called Mr.No-Name. A weird guy.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_56_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_57_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It is great !</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_57_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_58_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I want to know more about Mr.No-Name, can you please help me get it? Please?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_58_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Don't Worry</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_59_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you very much ~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_59_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now, I don't know.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Also, I hope to know the reason.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell to 'sorry'</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_60_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Select item type.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_60_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Take Dual Spear</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_60_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Take Scythe</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_60_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Take Shuriken</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_61_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Select item type.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_61_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Take a Cube</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_61_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Take a Whip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_61_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Take a Magic Wand</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_62_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is not much left until the goal, please keep trying.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_62_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_63_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Congratulations. Please keep up the good work. As a reward, you can get the Theojelite belt scroll by helping Ryuin in Chaos Island.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_63_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">No problem!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">But, if you can help me, I'll help you, too.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now, I can't believe anyone?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Have you seen the things that fly around with whooshing sound? Huh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Do you know the name of it? Guess you know something too.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Smarter than the looks</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Wow, great!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Feels offended but ask her more</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Things are getting worse around here everyday…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Set Starting Point</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Find someone who can help</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">A Chance Discovery</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Unidentified Necklace</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Suspicious Relationship</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Sacrifice for other people</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Purification of Power Facility</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am in no better situation. It makes me shiver, you asking me a favor even though we do not know each other. But, if you do me a favor first then I might rethink this through..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">All of my co-workers are mutated. It is a very sad story. However, if the Toxicant they possess gets into school then it would cause catastrophy. So, please do defeat those researchers. If you come across a necklace while defeating them then please bring it to me.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hu Hu Hu.. As I thought.. I had expected it but I am happy to confirm it. Thanks!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I was born a twin and had a younger brother. We used to work together at this place. He was very talented. Maybe that is why he was chosen to be experimented. However, I came back to find my brother after that incident. Please find my brother!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Are you sure it is my brother? Well, it sure sounds like him. It will take much more time to recover his identity. Please take care of him as much as you can! Please!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I found the mutant supplying toxicant to them! Tech Researcher (Elite) has been giving secretion to others. It is the cause. Go get rid of him.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, the nature is…..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about this place</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Produce Virus</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Jealousy and Mischief</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Produce Aspirin I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Produce Aspirin II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_14">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Herb of World Tree</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_15">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Produce Aspirin III</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_16">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Collecting Parts I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_17">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Collecting Parts II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_18">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Fabricate Satellite Signal</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_19">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Report Satellite Signal Fabrication</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask for Healing Treatment</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_20">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Goods Trader</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Extract Virus Sample</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Virus Sample</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Extract Normal Blood Sample</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Normal Blood Sample</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Request of Nurse Trainee (Dispatched) I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Request of Nurse Trainee (Dispatched) II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Unknown Secret</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you so much for doing this!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I have found out that the Tech Reseacher (Elite) has more deadly virus than the Guard Dog. Please get their virus samples, I need them to make new antibiotics.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Extra Activity Teacher who I met while I was studying nursing was very mysterious man wrapped behind a veil. He was hiding many things and plus he knew the Power Researcher P...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">controller is ready. Get to the "Satellite Dish' which you can find it in minimap then it will automatically control the satellite signal for better communication.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">World Tree is legendary tree which can survive from the Evil Spirits and unpleasant mutants. There is a rumor that the scent of Herb of World Tree can call spirits.. Adding this herb into a medicine will maximize the effect of such medicine. Just bring me the ingredients then I will make it for you.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Yes, correct. This is the 'Herb of World Tree'. It has been really long since I have last seen it.. It feels weird..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Combine processed saliculic acid of World Tree and bark of willow with acetylsalicylic acid to make a very special medicine.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It is done! Please inform the Student Director (Dispatched)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am trying to connect this place and the schools to communicate by adjusting signal. But there is not enough parts to make the controller. Guard Robots must be using some electrical parts I need.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am trying to connect this place and the schools to communicate by adjusting signal. But there is not enough parts to make the controller. Labor Robots must be using some electrical parts I need.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Controller is ready. Get to the "Satellite Dish' which you can find it in minimap then it will automatically control the satellite signal for better communication.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh Great! Please keep this secret in case anyone asks about this!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is the new heaven of virus. Thanks to that the medical professions are living a very busy lives. The mutants have separate organ for poison and virus and they can belch whichever whenever they like. There is no cure or antidote yet. Please take care of yourself.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">People who were attacked by Guard Dogs are getting infected faster. It must be stopped. Please go extract the virus from Guard Dogs.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you! Let me make it up to you!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Virus sample of Guard Dog isn't the only thing needed to progress the research further and it is on temporary hold. If I just had a normal blood sample, everything must be whole lot easier.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I thought all the Guard Dogs had been mutated. I never thought to get normal blood! This is enough to help the research.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I know its rude of me to call you but you know, I cannot go anywhere. I have a very personal favor to ask…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I have seen a person who looks very similar to who I dated before I attended nursing school. If you see a tall and slim young man with glasses then please tell him about me.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I have been getting trained to become a nurse for past a few years. I don't know about this place. Oh! Yes, I was at the hospital for a while. It's true.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Agh…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Returned Obinine</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Sacrifice for Others</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the current status</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Message of Obinine</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Pendant Piece of Partisan</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Pendant Piece of Partisan</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Find someone who can help</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Notify Obinine</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Death of Betrayal</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Pendant Piece of Partisan</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh.. The pedant piece of Partisan representing honor.. It is really small..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Eww.. Head is heavy.. Who are you? Helping me wake up again? I am the member of Daramaian Partisan. Anyways, I appreciate your help!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am the member who assist the captain of our partisan. My captain and I was experimented by an old man. I don't remember anything after that. Ugh.. I cannot remember how that doctor looked like…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Before I was blacked out, I remember traveling with other members including captain Veno. During the harsh journey, we met with a very nice doctor. He had made a suggestion to us and that's all I remember..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you find captain Veno somewhere around here, don't forget to tell me about it. Even if you fail to find him please find me his traces left behind.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I see.. That's what happened.. Must had no choice..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You have a quite talented crew. My great captain Veno.. Wow!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Must.. have lost his power because of the mind controlling of that evil doc. Also, it is very sad that he would not be able to recognize me and our brothers.. It is really sad!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am looking for a person who can find all of our scattered partisan members and deliver this news. Please help me!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Betrayal of Lucian?! Umm.. I kind of expected it.. Then would you please do me a favor?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Lucian used to be a great warrior of our partisan. Enemies fell as the candle in the light in front of his sword. But he must have known that he was getting weaker as the time went by. Therefore, he was thinking about the unthinkable, taking over the absolute point for its power. He needs to wake up now. Please go teach him some sense and retrieve our pendant.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Who is the teacher up in Control Tower? Umm..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Set Starting Point</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listento mumbling</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Request of Nurse Trainee (Dispatched) II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Unknown Secret</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Suspicious Relationship</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I used to be a gold digger before I came to this place. As I have worked many years, I figured out how to make the money. Many people would look whats in front of them to make money. And it will lead you to someplace where you can no longer avoid. Riches say one needs to be prepared to make money. Must learn how to look further before..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">No way! I do not know that person. I used to be the researcher who went back and forth from Control Tower to Evironment Control Tower. When such incident happened, I escaped from basement of complex just before they made me an experiement object.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There was a woman who ran with me. She told me that she was a student. Please help me find her who saved my life.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Awe.. A brother of mine… I might have had one or.. I might not had one.. Ahg! Ahg! Ahg! I don't know..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">………………………………………………….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ruin.. upon those who run counter to nature!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask who she is.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Garansanoa's Message.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if she is feeling alright.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand over the cure.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask what is going on.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her the result</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask what happened in the past.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about basement</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">암흑의 목걸이의 부활을 의뢰한다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Heard there is a underground facility under the Environment Control Tower in the Central Park. Find the entrance around the tower to go in and find his friends. Be careful, because it is filled with dangerous creatures which were experimented like us.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">음... 이계마나와 미완성된 암흑의 목걸이... 모두 다 있군. 자 그럼 어디 힘을 부활시켜 볼까? 혹시 미완성된 암흑의 목걸이를 차고 있다면 어서 벗게나. 착용을 하고 있으면 힘을 부활시킬 수가 없으니...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">암흑의 목걸이의 힘을 부활시킨다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_11_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Obeying Daian..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Garansanoa.. The elder.. Respectable of.. Daian..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Cures are.. Paranovan's Orb.. Piece of Vicious Mind.. Memories are..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thanks…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Long time ago, Dr. TK has abducted some of us, the Daramaian Priests. After we were brought here, they have conducted experiments on us. The last thing I remember.. The horrifying screams of High Elders who have turned into weird creatures. I must revenge those researchers who have conducted experiment on us.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I can smell their pain from you. Thanks!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Daramai is a society of many tribes united together. Garansanoa is an elder of our Daian tribe. The people who he is looking for must be on a very important mission..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if she knows their whereabouts</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I was abducted and brought here while fighting a war against Lagia and I don't really know anything.. I am sorry.. If I find out anything then I will make sure to notify Garansanoa.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Customer is my King.. Hahaha</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Operate Item Compounder</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Item Compound</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Item Compound</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask him to make you basic item</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask who he is?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Huhu.. Can't tell you more. Just think of it as ingredients are needed to make something. Something useful might come out if items are put in the Item Compounder together. Well, even though definition of "Useful" can be different to each person.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Basic item.. I will teach you how to make Fermented Recovery Potion. Buy 1 bread from the Merchant and 1 Liquid Fermentation Potion from me and bring them to me.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">First show me the required items and then ask me to use the Compounder. Remember to bring the exact quantity of each item.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Huhuhu.. Who are you?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well, it has been a long time since I have last seen a human being.. Just tell me if you need anything.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell him, Garansanoa has sent you</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell him, you've taken care of the researchers</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Is it from the guy with a cloying manner wearing a black outfit? I remember, he gave me something to play at marbles but it didn't do any good. Hey, you should help me here. Please put down those Researchers. I really need a good night sleep!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Excellent!!. I hope I can have a good night sleep now. Let me give you this Marble which that guy in the black outfit gave me as a token of my appreciation. I hope you can make a good use of it.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Congrats for making this far!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about dispatched Extra Activity Teacher</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Key Member of Partisan</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Produce Aspirin I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Produce Aspirin III</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Returned Obinine</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_14">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Secret of Meteorite Monument I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_15">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Secret of Meteorite Monument I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_16">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Secret of Meteorite Monument II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_17">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Remove Dangerous Article</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_18">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Report Achieving Level 200</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_19">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Report Achieving Level 205</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Report Power Plant Status I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_20">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Report Achieving Level 210</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_21">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Report Achieving Level 215</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_22">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Report Achieving Level 220</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_23">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Student Director (Dispatched)'s Call</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_24">
    <VALUE Lang="th">St.Power Plant purification</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_25">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Talk with Student Director</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_26">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Volunteer for Second Group</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Dangerous Company</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Investigate Power Facility 1-2</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exterminate Guard Dog with Fluorescent Color</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Report Fluorescent Colored Guard Dog Extermination</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Message from Student Director (Dispatched)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Survivor Recon</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Report Survivor Recon</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Really?! It's just getting more suspicious. Power Plant Manager wasn't even here for a few recent years… looking for a CD.. Hmm.. If my guess is right then the high officials must have done something secretly.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Very well. There was a very suprising incident. One day, mutants had attacked us teachers in surprise while we were educated secretly. That when he helped us. Now is the time for us to help him.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am not sure who the nurse trainee (Dispatched) is but I heard that she had only studied the virus and the schizophrenia. Go ask her!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">As expected, he managed to produce the Aspirin with herb of World Tree which can only be acquired by someone with mighty power. It is our turn to help him.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Go see him once more. If he is ok then he must have came back to normal.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Glowing and sprkling monument is still left here all in one piece. If you have time would you please go check it out? You might will be able to find new informantion around there.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What? It’s not a meteorite? Cant' be?! If it is just a immitatin than how could it stay unchanged that long..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There was a script covered with stain over it? A few days ago, Nurse Trainee (Dispatched) found that the saliva of Guard Dog (Elite) help oxidation while she was studying virus samples. Use that saliva and remove the stain over that script written on the Meteorite Monument.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I did not know that the Saliva of Guard Dog (Elite) was a very dangerous chemical. It would be hard to believe but if that Saliva is vaporised then it even destroys the Ozone layer. Please defeat all Guard Dogs (Elite) infected with virus.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You did well! It feels great to watch you grow! Learning and training ourselves is the only way fulfill what we desire!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you cannot talk to dispatched Extra Activity Teacher then why don't you take over the control tower. Seems like there were unseen rivarly between the students from each school to find the clue of Another World. Therefore, the teachers dispatched here only allowed students who dominated this place to trade items, receive quests and talk to them. In order to train them hard.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm glad you are coming. I just want to help you earn new power. Help me purify Saint Power Plant and you'll get new sphere to learn the power.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We need to purify Saint Power Plant once again, please eliminate Tech Researcher around here.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's the perfect time to see you! I've been getting applications from students who want to go to Ground Zero. So far, we need more students. Can you support for the students dispatched first?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You will be the role model for the other students. Go now. I'll follow you soon.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..that this is one of the places hit by meteoric shower and was used as the energy source for the research complex. Umm.. Something must have been found in the meteorite.. Anyways, thanks!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You seem strong enough as the people said! This is the Saint Power Plant discovered a few days ago. Many teachers and the students are investigating this area but we need more help from strong students like you. Please help them.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Someon has seen a giant animal gushing out smoke from its body near the Power Facility 1-2. It is not sure if it was a human or a mutant but you will be able to find a clue by investgating this area.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Guard Dogs which used to guarding this place are glowing in weird fluorescent color. It must be an undiscovered virus. Anyways, they are listed in the dagerous creature list so please defeat them.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you! We now can investigate broader area.. When did Nurse Trainee (Dispatched) got here??...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am not sure whether the information of this place where the meteorite had fallen, unkown creatures and viruses can be useful to find clues but please tell 'Student Conselor' at Market Plaza about it.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There was a trace of a humna.. Umm.. It cannot be the dispatched teachers.. There might be a survivor, would please go take a look?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sps_nurse.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask me anything!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sps_nurse.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sps_nurse.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Get healed</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Growl..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Wave some food.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Garansanoa's request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Garansanoa's message</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if he needs any help</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell him the result</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Urga's Call</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Urga's Test</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well, unless it is a delicious salmon but… Yeahy!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Sorry</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am Urga. Please observe good manners next time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, you must mean what we have talked about last time. I saw a man and two woman wandering around the tower. They were headed south..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well my memories are really vague since it has been a very long time. I believe it was about time when my friends got violent.. Go towards Foundation Patrol Center from here, if there is a priest who has not lost the consciousness, she might know more .</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've tried to persuade my friends but they wouldn't listen..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please rest in piece..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm glad you are coming. I just want to help you earn new power. Pass my exam and you'll get new sphere to learn the power.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Eliminate Priest of Destruction in Cplx Basement or St.Research Cplx.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">... Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Talk to the Bus Driver</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Bus Driver's Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Spare Parts</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Bus Driver's 2nd Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if he needs help</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell him what happened</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Excuse me. Would you be so kind to help me acquire some spare parts from the Technical Teacher located near the college Crossroads so that I can get this bus moving again?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">"Have you ever been to SG Hole? If so then you must have met those inferior Green Mask (Uncle Potato). Because of their threats I am afraid to drive the bus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you can please defeat them and scare them away."</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thanks! Now I will be able to drive this bus around.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ha ha! Yes, you can commute on the school bus. It's better than travelling by foot!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oops! I'm sorry! I didn't know you were there!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've been very busy trying to find out what the hell is wrong with this wreck!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask What He is Doing</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! This bus is unoperational. I can't even get this thing to work. I really need to fix this bus so that the students can travel safely. It's dangerous to just walk around with all the chaos in the outskirts.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's too bad there aren't any spare parts available to fix this thing.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask the Driver more about Bus</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Based on my assessment of this wreckage, I can say that repairing this bus shouldn't be a major problem. The spare parts required to repair this vehicle, however, need to be acquired as soon as possible. I can't repair this bus unless I can get all the necessary spare parts.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you for bringing the spare parts I need. I can finally start repairing this wreck.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The students can use the bus to conveniently move from one area to another once I'm done fixing it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Bus Driver's 2nd Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please visit the Construction Supervisor located near the crossroads of the Sacred Gate Campus. I heard he has a favor to ask from me, but I can't visit him myself because of this bus problem.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The problem with the bus started a few days ago, and it's been getting worse since then. The bus won't even move at all now. It seems that the other buses in the area are having similar problems.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busteminal.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is the Bus Stopl.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Once have your Bus Ticket ready, you can use the Bus Service to move to another area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busteminal.ntk_1_0_1">
