  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_library_1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The top priority targets in this area are the Street Junkies. Please eliminate 22 Street Junkies.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_library_1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">A Broom? Well, it's pretty inconvenient for me to carry this broom around while I'm trying to finish everything I need to do.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Open the Locker</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The weather is getting cold and gloomy. I'm starting to feel aches and pains in my body.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Open the Locker</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker.ntk_1_2_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Locker Usage</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker.ntk_1_2_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Campus</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker.ntk_1_2_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return Broom</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker.ntk_1_2_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Borrow Broom</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Of course! Just use these lockers whenever you want. Try to stick to using just one locker space for yourself, alright? Store items that you want to keep and use later inside your locker. You'll need to spend some more money if you want to expand your locker space.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Open the Locker</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Sigh. How do I answer that question? As you probably know, there are 3 Campuses in the area, but there are rumors of a fourth campus. I've heard the teachers and the School Administration talking about the Force-- Force Fiel... Ah yes! The Force Field! I'm not one hundred percent sure, but I think there's something very important about that Force Field. Of all the campuses here, Leonair Campus is the probably the weirdest. I remember that I was just listening to some teachers talking when the sky suddenly change</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I really want to know more about what actually happened. If you guys find important information about that event, please don't forget to let me know, alright?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Open the Locker</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Broom? Oh! That Broom! I really have no idea what's so special about these brooms. Well, if you really think you'll need one, feel free to take it. Please bring it back as soon as you're done using it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">These are the Lockers of the Market Area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please feel free to use these Lockers to store your items and equipment.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Change Save Point</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Open the Locker</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_b.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Welcome to the School's Back Door Area!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">How can I help you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_b.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Access Lockers</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_b.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Outdoor Lockers</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_b.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Practice Yard</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_b.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_b.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">These Lockers are available for immediate use to students that wish to leave some of their items for safekeeping before venturing into the dangerous areas past these gates.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_b.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Open Lockers</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_b.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_b.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Practicing Yard outside provides easier access to the other campuses for students. There are Bus Stations outside if you want to move to another location outside the campus. Please have your Bus Tickets ready if you want to use the Bus Services.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_b.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask more about the Training Yard</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_b.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_b.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Danger lurks in the Practicing Yard area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Student! Remember that the Training Yard area is not a safe zone. Please be careful outside since there are several monsters patrolling that area!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please be discreet when traveling through the Training Yard. Good Luck!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_b.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_human.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Would you like to use your locker?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_human.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Open the Locker</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_locker_human.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">무엇을 도와드릴까요?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">신입 등록 기념용 빵 지급을 신청한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">신입 등록 기념용 빵 지급을 신청한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">신입 등록 기념용 빵 지급을 신청한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">도움이 되는 말을 듣는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">위치를 확인한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">치료를 부탁한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">시작 위치를 변경한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품 매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">이제 학생에게는 저의 도움이 필요하지 않을것 같아요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">다른 선생님들을 만나뵈어 주시겠어요?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">시작 위치를 변경한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품 매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">네트워크 연결상태 불량으로 인해 정보 검색은 할 수 없습니다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">진심으로 환영합니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">이번의 신입생들을 위해서는 특별히 선물을 준비했어요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">키보드의 'H' 키를 누르시면 단축키 등의 도움말을 볼 수 있어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">아이템이나 스킬에 대해서는 본관 안에 있는 매점 판매원을 만나시면 더 자세한 설명을 들으실 수 있을거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">현재 서 계시는 곳은 학원 내의 옥외지역이며, 전투지역으로 분류되어 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품 매매 등의 거래나 초반 퀘스트 수행을 위해서는 본관 안으로 들어가셔야 합니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">키보드 'M' 키를 누르시면 볼 수 있는 전체지도의 '본관' 을 찾아 들어가시면 내부로 가실 수 있습니다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">본관에 들어가시면 왼편에서 찾을 수 있는 매점 판매원을 만나보세요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">신입생들을 위한 선물을 받도록 도와줄거예요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">본관으로 들어가는 현관의 위치를 모르시면 키보드의 'M' 키를 눌러 볼 수 있는 전체 지도를 이용해 주세요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_0.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">본관 단말기입니다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">신입 등록 기념용 빵 지급을 신청한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">신입 등록 기념용 빵 지급을 신청한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">신입 등록 기념용 빵 지급을 신청한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">도움말을 본다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">위치를 확인한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">정보 검색을 한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">시작 위치 변경</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">네트워크 연결상태 불량으로 인해 정보 검색은 할 수 없습니다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">진심으로 환영합니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">이번의 신입생들을 위해서는 특별히 선물을 준비했습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">본관을 나서면 준비해 둔 빵을 많이 받으실 수 있으니 받고 확인해 주시기 바랍니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">현관의 위치를 모르시면 키보드의 'M' 키를 눌러 볼 수 있는 전체 지도를 이용해 현재 위치와 현관의 위치를 확인하십시오</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">그 외의 단축키는 'H' 키를 통해 알아볼 수 있으니 참고해 주시기 바랍니다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">키보드의 'H' 키를 누르시면 단축키 등의 도움말을 볼 수 있습니다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">현재 서 계시는 곳은 학원 내의 옥외지역으로 전투지역으로 분류되어 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품 매매 등의 기타 행위를 위해서는 본관 안으로 들어가셔야 합니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">키보드 'M' 키를 누르시면 볼 수 있는 전체지도의 '본관' 을 찾아 들어가시면 본관 내부로 가실 수 있습니다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_main_1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This Terminal controls the entrance and exit to the Main Entrance.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Automatic Confirmation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Register for Examination to pass through the Main Entrance</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Test the Terminal</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Skill Testing Program has been initiated!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The basic purpose of this program is to protect the students, and also serves as a temporary measure for determining when students develop their abilities beyond a certain level.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Good Luck, Students!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Terminal's force field is running properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Authentication is required to enter and exit through the school's Main Gate.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Register for Examination to pass through the Main Entrance</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Terminal is running properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">시험의 내용은 20분 내에 씨름부원 10명을 쓰러트려 능력을 인정받는 것이며, 시험 진행중 사망하거나 포기할 경우 재시도할 수 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">씨름부원의 정보는 다음과 같습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">체력 : 1200</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">공격력 : 65~105</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">방어력 : 35</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">약점 : 공격력이 강하지만 속도가 느리므로 공격 동작 사이에 밀어내기가 가능한 스킬을 써서 견제한다면 유리하게 이끌 수 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Let me check you for injuries.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Strange Person</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Strange Person's Identity</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Healing Treatment Situation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Nurse's Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Medicine</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the bad adults</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her what happened</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Change Save Point</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you very much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's fortunate that there's been a dramatic decrease in the number of sick patients I have to treat. It looks like this medicine should last me quite a while.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">자신보다 센 사람들한테는 먼저 덤비지 않는다거나, 주위에 뛰어다니는 사람들만 먼저 공격하거나, 무기를 들고 있는 사람한테만 덤빈다거나, 또 어떨때는 절대로 먼저 공격하지 않는 타입도 봤어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">아무래도 그 패턴만 미리 알고 있으면 더 쉽겠죠?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I never imagined that I'd be doing all of this on my own, but I don't have a choice since there aren't enough people to assist me in treating these patients.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Medicine can be acquired from the Nurse located at the Sacred Gate Ring.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Are you willing to get that medicine for me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's going to be difficult to get help from the hospitals in the neighboring cities because the tunnel is blocked.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Not only is the tunnel full of toxic gas, but all kinds of strange creatures have started living in the tunnel.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Traveling through the tunnel is going to be really difficult, even if you bring a gas mask. There's a Student from the Combat Section named Zhen, however, that claims to know another way of traveling through the tunnel.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">They are just a shameful adults.. You will be able to find Drunkards on the way to Rotary. They could not stop their old habits before the phenomenon. They are stealing rubbing alcohol and I cannot cure the students. I hope someone can stop them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Don't blame yourself! If they had a little piece of human in them then might have tried to cure them but they already are no longer human beings.. Well, anyways, I would be able to sleep at night now. Thank you!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">They started appearing not too long ago. There was only one at first, but then they started multiplying and spread all over the Campus area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Yeah, I don't look very well, but I can't help it because of the harsh conditions in this area. I don't have any choice: I have to take care of these medicines and sell them here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">여기까지 올 수 있었으니 기본적인 것들은 알고 있을테죠</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">그러니 두 가지만 더 알려드리도록 할까요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'석화'에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_5_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'착란'에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm so sorry, but I haven't fully recovered my memory yet. There's a risk of making your injuries worse if I treat them right now. There's no way to tell for sure whether my medical skills will help or harm you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Do you understand?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">몸을 돌처럼 단단하게 만들어서 거의 움직일 수 없게 된 상태죠</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">하지만 그만큼 방어력이 올라가 버립니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">어지러워지는 상태라고 설명할 수 있겠군요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">명중율과 공격력이 반감돼 버려서 공격이 어려워지는 경우인데, '스태미너' 가 적을 때에도 같은 상태가 됩니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We've just run out of medical supplies. What am I going to do? There are people that still need me to give them medical treatment.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I really appreciate that you're here to help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ren-Ren</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What's the matter?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">How are you able to talk to me?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What can I do to help?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품 매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I met the people that came out from Leonine Campus. I clearly recall that someone snuck up and attacked me by surprise after I entered Leonine Campus. What? Why is my corpse still here...?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It looks like… I-I've turned into a monster, just like them. I guess I was transported here right after I died.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's too late to do anything for me now. Just do your best to make sure that nobody else suffers what I had to go through... Hey, and don't hesitate to kill me if you see me again, and I'm transformed into something I don't want to be...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I vaguely remember feeling like… I was being cloned? I think there's a lot of clones of me. I don't know how many of my friends were attacked...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What's the matter?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">How are you able to talk to me?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What can I do to help?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Right, I was killed… I was investigating the park, and… I don't know what it was. Well, whoever or whatever it was, it came from Leonair Campus. All I know is that it killed me. I can't remember anything else…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm definitely dead, but I people can still hear me and I can hear them. I'm not very sure what's happening, but it feels like I'm slowly disappearing. I think this is where... I hate admitting this, but I might end up turning into a monster.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We need to search for people that can replace us, but first we must stop the things that are coming out from Leonair Campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Sob... Sob~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What's the matter?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">How are you able to talk to me?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What can I do to help?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I-I don't wanna die…!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's still much I need to finish!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I just don't wanna die like this!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Huh? Of course I'm not dead yet! I-I can still talk to you, and you can hear me, right? Right?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's no way I'm dead. I'm still here!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I-I'm still alive! I have to be!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I really don't know…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I-I c-can't remember anything now!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It doesn't matter, what I can remember…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I just want you to help me stay alive!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You can still hear me, right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I definitely can't die! Not now, not like this!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">설마 그 열쇠는...!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">틀림없군 ‘깨달음의 열쇠’야!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">어디서 구한 건지는 모르겠지만 대단한데!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">그 열쇠를 지니고 있다면 이 반지의 주인이 될 수 있다는 얘기지.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">자, 열쇠를 나에게 주고 반지를 받도록 해.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Change Save Point</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">반지를 받는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Looks like you already had it verified at the Administration Office. How was it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Mmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Is that the cassette? It doesn't look very good from here. Hmm, let me take a look.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Cassette</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Cassette's Condition</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Let me have the cassette. I don't think it'll be of any use to you if you hold onto it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Cassette</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This isn't a place that you can just freely enter.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_3_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Change Save Point</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
