  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_3_56">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Special ID Card</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_3_57">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about spore allergy</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_3_58">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Special ID card</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_3_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Leonair Campus Authentication</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_3_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I want to enter Leonair Campus.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_3_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I want to enter Leonair Campus.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_3_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Examination Result Confirmed.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Correct! This is the leaf I saw before. All the others have mutated, but this one is still the same.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You are not allowed to enter this area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Good!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now go inside Leonair Campus to understand the real situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What are these?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Bandages?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Considering how decayed this thing is, I'd say that these came from the corpses.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Even if we only have a little information, the experimental body of the plant will produce an accurate forecast.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We need to figure out how the dead people over there were reanimated.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Although I'm not an expert on this, I was still able to find many things that were definitely out of place. Figuring out what's going on isn't going to be easy at all.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Sacred Financial Group Research Center seems to have the capability to easily recover these things.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's it a good thing that they have someone who's a specialist on this at the Trading Hole. You need to bring it to him and request for it to be restored.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Sacred Financial Group Research Center</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_16_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ordinary people never seem to understand the things I usually talk about. I guess it's because I learned so much technical knowledge at the Research Center.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You need to take the special purpose elevators located on the 3rd floor to reach the underground floors.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You will also need a special ID Card to access the elevators.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Special ID Card</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_18_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It was restored successfully!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Even though it took you a long time, I really appreciate your efforts.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Have you seen its contents?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's better that you don't tell anyone else what you saw and learned for now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Order</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_19_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Order</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_19_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Order</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_19_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Order</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_19_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It seems that someone tampered with this tape.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's like that somebody else viewed the contents of this tape, but as long as it's still viewable, it should be fine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The School Administration Office normally holds the card for safekeeping, and only uses it on special occasions.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You need to get that card and have it duplicated.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Good! This looks like Leonair Campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The map and the authentication book both confirm the strange phenomenon in that place.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That means that you've felt the unbalanced energy corrupting the school.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Very Good!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">While I look for someone to replace me, you can go ahead and test your abilities in this area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You have to prove that you can handle the challenges that lie ahead by defeating 20 Sacred Gate Defenders in 40 minutes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You can come back to me after you accomplish this feat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Let me warn you that the electrical attack from these mobs can be lethal. Please be careful.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Whether you like it or not, you have to listen to what I have to ask.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's something growing inside Leonair campus. You have to venture inside for me and learn what it is.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Can you tell me what's going on inside? I need more information so that I can make a new Force Field to replace the old one.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You'll need to conduct a thorough observation of the grass and the plants growing on the campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please collect 5 Smallpox leaves for me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are ladders inside the campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Climb the ladders and pass by a drill ground to take samples of the plant, and then come back.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Special Agents of the Sacred Financial Group were organized to determine whether the all the recent abnormal phenomena originates from this place.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Sacred Financial Group</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">So you saw reanimated corpses wandering around campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It seems like the situation is worse than we anticipated. It's even more critical that we solve this problem as soon as we can.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Excuse me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Can you please help me investigate Leonair Campus, and see if the Student director is still alive?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I believe that you'll be able to do this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Great!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm going to assume that you're capable of accomplishing this task.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Alright, I'm putting my trust in you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please be careful!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">게다가 이런 구식 기록매체를 아직까지 쓰고 있다니...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">아무래도 전문가에게 보여야 겠는걸, 일단은 내가 보관하고 있도록 하지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This damage wasn't caused by humidity; these wounds were caused by prolonged exposure to heat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_34_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If these symptoms persist, your nerves might also be affected!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's hard for me to say whether that'll happen.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Some people have recently come, asking about that disease.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Verified information suggests that it might be influenced by the experimentation of the plant's body.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I believe that the influence from these plants could not have proliferated unless it was spread through the discharge pipe located at the 2nd floor of Leonair Campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We still need to reorganize with the present students' abilities to fully understand the situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_38_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please go to the Trading Hole and locate the Master of Taoist Rites. What he has to teach you will really help you become stronger.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It seems to me that you don't care about the school.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's impossible not to know about the four schools that were established by the Sacred Financial Group in this area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You're so annoying, and I'm so tired of standing here! Ugh! Anyway, meet the Construction Supervisor, ask him about his problem, and then come back here. The supervisor has been requesting help from the company for quite some time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_41_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_41_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Reject</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Isn't it obvious? We're aiding people with requests for help. Even if we don't receive any requests, we search and assist people in need. Whether it's a personal problem or national threat, we try to help out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask for More Details</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">So you don't know after all?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh well... There's nothing more for me to say about it…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you've got any more questions, then you'd better ask the teachers.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I was expecting that.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It won't be hard to do it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well then, see you later.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm sorry about that. If you won't help this time, then I won't mention it anymore. Still, wouldn't you want to go there and help him out?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You've defeated them! Thank you very much!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_46_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It is just too hard for me to investigate the phenomenon alone. I could get all the hands I need but this is sucha dangerous place and…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_47_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I would help you.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you but you are not just ready yet for Leonine school… If you really like to help me then please get some more training.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_48_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmmm, wow you've got the Bine Hands of mutatant man eating Poison Ivy! You must have gotten some training!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_49_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmmmph!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Who are you?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I just am glad to know that there are beings that haven't lost their minds at this dead land of Leonine school. It would be possible to find out what happened on the day of Phenomenon with their help… This is a very dangerous job but would you please go find out?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Umm.. So this "hard to Read' notebook contains the record of what happened here at Leonine on the day of Phenomenon. Great job! Thank you so much for this precious data.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_51_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">My current position will be compromised if I try to infiltrate the campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Take my advice, and never step inside that school. It'd be wise of you to stay here where it's safe.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
