  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_1_0_99">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Immediately</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">어머~ 아직도 등록이 제대로 안되셨나 봐요?여기, '외출신청서' 를 '교무실' 의 '학생주임' 께 제출하시면 등록이 마무리 될 수 있을거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Why did you register so late?It's similar to the paper before this. All you need to understand is how to arrange everything, and make sure that the style looks good. It's so easy, it's like you don't even need to know how to write.Long and messy documentation isn't really necessary in this world since everything can be solved with just a mouse click.So do I just write on the paper?No other orders?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's not enough to simply fill out the registration application form and bring it over, right?It can be finished pretty easily because of the Student Director. Otherwise, you'll need to redo it before you come here again.Anyway, this is all possible because now happens to be a critical time.Just present the Egress Application Form to the Student Director at the School Administration Office, and you'll be almost finished with registration.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What, you're still working on your registration?Sorry, but I just came directly ...We handle these cases one by one, but I'll need to make an exception in this situation.Perhaps coming directly would be better after all ... I suppose so...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's no way to go outside when things start getting weird and dangerous.The students are able to venture out because they've got a little bit of power, but the dangers outside are a nightmare for normal people like me.The monsters outside are dead. I only heard about it, but I guess it's true.Doesn't it seem kind of weird? I didn't believe it at first, but you'd agree after listening to them.Isn't it true that human beings have no concern for one another? Some of them don't even respond when you speak toThere'</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
