  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">OMG!!!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You haven't registered ?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Just hand in the Egresses Application Form to the Student Director and the registration process will be finished.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You haven't finished registering?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Last time I thought that this kind of paper process were just a formality</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">At this age where everything is done at a click of a button, don't you think this type of documenting process is a bit strange?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">But I am not sure whether I am allowed to just hand you the used paper like that</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Don't we need to go through some kind of procedures first?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We can't just bring the application form in right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Only the Student Director will help you handle it, if it's another person, you will definitely be required to redo the whole thing.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway this kind of unusual system isn't impossible</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">No matter what just hand in the "Egresses Application Form" to the Student Director and the whole registration process will be over.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Are you in the process of registration?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I apologize for having you come all the way yourself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Normally the person on duty will allocate everything but the current situation doesn't allow it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">however bringing it there personally will definitely make it more delicious.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ever since the mutation happened , we cannot simply go outdoors.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The students here have special abilities that enable them to go outdoors, which is impossible for a person like me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I heard that the strange people outside are actually all dead.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Strange isn't it? I didn't believe it at first but after listening carefully it definitely seems real.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">People with identical looks gathering together .... even if you talk to them it's as if they cannot hear you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Even though I did not see it for myself I still think it's rather strange.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Come, the application form must be handed in to the Student Director.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please take your test at the 1-1 classroom . Good luck!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
