  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What? Do you mean the healing scroll?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Health Care room only uses this type</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Health Care room is very busy isn't it? Why would they call you over...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You are a new student?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">hmm .. it must be tough</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Of all the time ..it has to be now...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">From what I know, the college is built to prevent this kind of thing</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Your level is lagging behind the other students by alot, you need to work harder.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please do accept this piece of bread to help you in your endeavours.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">In my own opinion , I think that the teachers of this college have no feelings.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">They even refuse to teach the new batch of students.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You are not really considered a new student so there is a possibility</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">but this is just outrageous</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Although I can't say I am taking over the teacher</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">But I want to help you</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please strive to reach level 5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I will give you rewards.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Good luck!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I knew you could do it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Here are the rewards.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Even though they are not really anything , but they will definitely be able to help you</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you need any further assistance I will try my best to help you. Good luck!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I should still be able to help you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Can you try your best to reach the next level?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I will give you rewards as usual.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Good luck!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Firstly there are ordinary items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Then there are those with modifiable items which are rare items.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">One of them is called a unique item, which is specially made of good quality items, but it is hard to find.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you do find it please take good care of it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">And... even though I have never seen it with my own eyes, I know of one more very rare item.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please look at Main Centre's item details to find out more.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">And then there's one more quest item which shouldn't be simply used, this item is one of which even I wouldn't want to handle . Please pay attention to it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You can only use it upon finishing the quest.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The 2004 Athens Olympic games results. Golds , 12 Silvers and 9 Bronzes. Altogether 30 plus 1. Tickets [30 pieces] : Gift exchange package Tickets [31 pieces] : Gift exchange package If you sell them to us you can get back reinbursements, If you do not like the gift you may sell it. Those who guess the correct number of 30 will be given the gift exchange package , which includes the haven't returned Gymnastic Gold. We will give the gift exchange package to a total of 31 people.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Combined Gifts</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_30_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Combined Gifts</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_30_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Combined Gifts</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Is it a cake dropped by the strange rabbit?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is not edible because it isn't really food.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">But it looks very strange so I asked them to keep it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you collect 10 of the cakes , we will exchange a box with an unknown item for them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I cannot just give it to you like that.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It may be a cheap recovery potion or a rare weapon. Bottomline is it's a magical box.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It looks like it's an item created especially for experiments.I am not sure.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Do you want to exchange this?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Swap New Year Cake for Box</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_31_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Resign</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's strange you suddenly ask some question regarding skills.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">In order to use skills you need to have some skill points.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Or upon completing a task , however this is only available at the beginning , it is a special case.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask How to Familiarize with the Skill</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_32_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask how to use the Skill</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_32_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Upon entering the Main Centre , you will see diferrent department trainers , press the "M" key to help you determine your position.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You may purchase skill scrolls there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Spheres obtained throught quests may be used to exchange for skill scrolls.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Click the right button of the mouse after selecting a skill scroll in order to learn the skill.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Pressing the "K" key will let you see the skills you may be able to learn in the future, skills which are already available will be brightly litted , it will be easy for you to differentiate skills which are available for you to use from those that aren't .</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Choose the skills that are already available from the skills window and move it to the 1-10 numbers on the left of your screen.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Select the skills from the numbers assigned to them and click on the right button of the mouse to use them according to the situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">However you must make sure you read carefully each skills function as every skill are different.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_34_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Go to the office.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Student Director directed me to inform the new students to go to the office, but it actually slipped my mind.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The office is at the room beside this. It's easy to find.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you are still unsure, you may press the "M" key to have a view of the game map.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Welcome to the new student's registration.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We have specially prepared gifts for the new batch of students.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Upon leaving the Main Centre you will receive bread prepared by us . Please do accept them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you do not know the entrance's location, press the "M" key to bring up the game map which will help you determine its position.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Other hotkeys may be identified by pressing on the "H" key.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Yes, it is a franchise managed by the Main Centre.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hygiene, quality, price, variety are all examined, and circulated throughout the whole country's colleges by a good company.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Staff training taught this, but it's certainly surprising that it's only being applied now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">But now the Main Centre has already cut off all resources and supply, therefore there's not a single here that's looking good...so sorry about this..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If it is items.. it means objects.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you defeat an enemy, you may rob him of his items, but the stronger the enemy, the more powerful weapons may be robbed, please do keep that in mind .</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you manage to obtain a good object and do not intend to use it, or if you need the money, do consider selling it to me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">However you may also choose to trade it with your friend.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만날 때 이르는 경지를 가리키는 말이라고 들었는데요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask questions about Maori</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask questions about Alloy</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_6_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I heard that upon achieving a certain level, enlightenment will bestow upon you and you may be free from masculinity boundaries.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Even though its just a rumour</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">but there's a book called Maori's Magical Manual which in its broken condition is circulating around outside.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I heard that upon achieving a certain level, enlightenment will bestow upon you and the boundaries of femininity may be broken.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Even though it's just a rumour</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">but there is a book called Alloy's Magical Manual which in its broken condition is floating around somewhere outside.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It isn't an ordinary ancient book isn't it?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">May I know what are you looking for?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask questions about Obtaining Tools</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_9_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Types of Tools</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
