  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_archer1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Main Gate of the campus building is straight ahead. The Welfare Society and the Lockers are over there. You should go there so you'll know where they are when you need them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, and you've got to visit the Student Director at the School Administration Office to register as a student. The office is next to the Welfare Society.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You can get your wounds treated at the First-Aid Room. You'd better know how to get there. Sooner or later, you're probably going to get injured!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_archer1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_archer1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What do you want to know?</VALUE>
