  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘나한의구슬’에 ‘아라치기서’ 까지 가지고 있다니...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">운이 좋은건지는 모르겠지만 하여튼 대단하구나!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘나한의구슬’은 30개를 ‘나한귀주’라는 목걸이로 합칠 수 있고</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘아라치기서’는 ‘나한기서’라는 고문서로 바꿀 수 있지.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">특히 ‘나한기서’는 서클 지도교사에게 가져가면 합당한 무기를 얻을 수 있는 증표이기도 한데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">자, 어쩔테냐</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'나한의 구슬' 들을 합친다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_2_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'아라치기서' 를 변환한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘마루치기서’ 에 ‘아라치기서’ 까지 가지고 있다니!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">운이 좋은건지는 모르겠지만 하여튼 대단하구나!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘마루치’와‘아라치기서’는 ‘나한기서’라는 고문서로 바꿀 수 있지.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">특히 ‘나한기서’는 서클 지도교사에게 가져가면 합당한 무기를 얻을 수 있는 증표이기도 한데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">자, 어쩔테냐</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_3_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'마루치기서' 를 변환한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_3_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'아라치기서' 를 변환한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">호오, ‘나한의 구슬’을 찾았구나!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘나한의구슬’은 30개를 ‘나한귀주’라는 목걸이로 합칠 수 있는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">어떠냐, 합쳐 볼 테냐</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_4_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'나한의 구슬' 들을 합친다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘마루치 기서’ 라...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">용케도 그런 걸 찾아냈구나</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘마루치기서’는 ‘나한기서’ 라는 고문서로 바꿀 수 있는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">이 ‘나한기서’ 라는 놈은 서클 지도교사에게 가져가면 합당한 무기를 얻을 수 있는 증표이기도 하지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">어떠냐, 바꿔 볼 테냐</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_5_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'마루치기서' 를 변환한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘아라치 기서’ 라...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">용케도 그런 걸 찾아냈구나</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘아라치 기서’는 ‘나한 기서’ 라는 고문서로 바꿀 수 있는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">이 ‘나한 기서’ 라는 놈은 서클 지도교사에게 가져가면 합당한 무기를 얻을 수 있는 증표이기도 하지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">어떠냐, 바꿔 볼 테냐</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_6_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'아라치기서' 를 변환한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you've got a broom, then you're going to be doing some sweeping, right? If you're not, then please put that broom away before coming into the Admin Office.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_7_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Clean the Dormitory</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_7_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand in the Garbage</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_7_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Returning the Broom</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">음?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">어디서 그런 걸 들었지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">'세인트 재단' 에 보관중인 뭔가를 얻기 위한 증표이긴 한데, 열쇠는 그렇다 쳐도 대체 '파견요원' 이 지금 어디에 있는지 알 수가 없으니...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_100_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hm? Haha! Is it even possible to even reach this place at your level?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I guess it won't be difficult for you to match 7 pieces, right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm just worried that since you're new, you might not be able to assemble the 7 pieces on time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_100_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_101_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Look at the part of this note that's torn.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">This might be a clue. If you find anything else like this, then please bring it to me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's been a long time since I've been this excited.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please bring these kinds of items here if ever you find anything similar, alright?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_101_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_102_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">이게 힌트가 될 수 있지만 여기서 또 하나의 문제가 함정처럼...응? 바로 가져 가려고?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_102_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_103_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">오랜만에 반가운 걸 가져왔는데 좀 아쉽군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">혹시라도 나중에 비슷한 걸 찾으면 또 가져오도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_103_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_104_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_105_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The students might not have the Brooms ready by now. There's one thing I need to explain first.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_105_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_106_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The strange phenomenon that happened a long time ago endangered the people's physical and mental well-being.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Most of the students and teachers that attempted to stop it were left inside the campus dormitory. This caused the accumulation of a lot of garbage.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_106_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_107_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It seems that the garbage is related to the negative effects of that strange phenomenon.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please investigate the garbage.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You might be able to find a way to stop this strange situation from spreading.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_107_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_108_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">앞뒤의 상황으로 볼 때 그 쓰레기들도 이변의 부산물일 가능성이 높다고 보고 있어</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_108_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_109_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">어쩌면 그 쓰레기를 조사해서 이변을 진정시킬 수 있는 해결책을 찾아낼 수 있을지도 모르겠지만... 어쩌면의 얘기일 뿐이지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_109_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">구슬 자체로는 그리 대단한 물건이 아니지만 30개를 합치면 꽤 쓸만한 목걸이를 만들 수 있지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_110_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_111_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We won't beat this phenomenon by just leveling up and curing illnesses. We need to look at this with a broader perspective to find the root of the problem.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The cost of experimenting and researching to achieve that end is quite high.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'll try to gather everyone to discuss this matter when I have the time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_111_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_112_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">아, 앞으로 시간나면 또 모아오도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">실험을 하려면 꽤 많이 소비될테니 말이야</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_112_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_113_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_114_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Leonair Campus might be producing all these Spores. The campus's underground water might be the source of all of this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_114_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_115_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, this matter is worth investigating.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'll give you a copy of the ID Card. You should go and make good use of it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_115_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_116_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">자, 여기 ID 카드 사본을 줄 테니까, 가져가 보도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_116_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_117_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_118_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I have a feeling that the 2nd floor basement is very dangerous. This ID Card can give you access to the 3rd Floor basement. Remember to use the dedicated elevators to access specific areas of the basement.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please be careful: it won't be easy to go through the basements.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Good Luck!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_118_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_119_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">그리고 3층까지는 이 카드로 갈 수 있겠지만 지하는 전용의 엘리베이터를 사용해야만 갈 수 있으니까</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">아마 쉽게 갈 수는 없을거다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_119_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's strange that the students sent to investigate Leonair Campus haven't arrived yet. The specialist from the Financial Group also doesn't have any idea what happened.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the College</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Health Room</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Chaotic Situation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Green</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Leonair Campus</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_120_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_121_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">In order to start a Gang, you need at least five (5) members that do not belong to any other Gang. The Gang Leader applicant should be at Character Level 30, and pay a processing fee of 1,000,000 Gold Coins.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Gang Upgrade Charges:</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">[Level D]: 2,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">[Level C]: 3,500,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">[Level B]: 5,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">[Level A]: 7,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_121_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_122_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Experience will be lost if you disband or terminate the Gang.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_122_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_123_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you quit a Gang or kicked out of one, then you temporarily won't be allowed to join another Gang. Please remember this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_123_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_124_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">지역마다의 유동 금액을 관리하기 위해서는 전산실을 관리해 줘야만 하지.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">프로그램을 지니고 인증을 받은 관리자에게만 그 권한이 주어지는데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">지금 같은 상황에서는 상당히 심한 경쟁이 있을 것 같군.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">어때 프로그램을 받아 가겠나?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_124_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">인증용 CD를 받는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_124_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_125_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">No wonder I don't see you nowadays. You went to that place!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_125_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_126_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I already know the situation there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please send this document to the Trading Hole Police Station.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_126_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_127_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Middle Hole and Root Hole have serious problems. You need to cool off and go further.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_127_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_129_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Lee Shi Zhang, the Director of the Financial Group, is one of the most sought after Feng Shui masters.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">He became able to foresee the future after that meteor shower 18 years ago...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_129_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now isn't a good time for students to be ignorant about the registration process. We didn't need such repetitive routines in the past, but now...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_130_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Teachers only know academics and administration. They don't know anything else.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Still, I never expected the Financial Group Area to be the worst.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_130_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_131_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Our universe exists side by side with parallel universes in other dimensions. There are theories that our world is merging with those other universes, and we'll eventually coexist with the inhabitants of those other worlds. We won't be able to physically see this once the worlds merge, even if a being from another world is right beside us. Now, if these theories are true, then wouldn't it be possible to travel to other dimensions? Hmm, but these theories still haven't been proven, though.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_131_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_132_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's already been proven.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If a single cell from another dimension manages to enter our universe and merge with an organism that is native to this world, then a completely new life form will be created. Those dangerous creatures that you see right now are a product of that process. Do you understand now?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_132_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_133_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Root Hole?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Financial Group's Building?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Yes, I met an old man there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I heard they're twins. Do you know what he's talking about?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_133_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_134_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">En...en..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Haha....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The old man seems to like you very much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_134_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_135_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Go to the Trading Hole and talk to AngBeeLan. You might be able to learn more.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_135_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_136_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This cannot be...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_136_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Talk about Sacred Financial Group</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_136_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Talk about Sacred Financial Group</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_137_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This looks like the student attendance list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Maybe it's more like the student record list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, there's nothing wrong with the list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Why are you so curious about it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_137_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Background of Students</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_138_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">How did you enter this school?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I did the same thing you did. Don't waste your time on that list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_138_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are still many students that haven't registered. Most of them don't even report to the school.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We wouldn't have these problems if the school schedules for this academic year were more organized.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I understand that it's tough to operate normally in all this chaos, but we can't completely ignore proper procedure.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We should do our best to survive through all of this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We need to remain calm and collected until this immense problem is resolved.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Student Director's Test</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Force Field Authentication</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Force Field Authentication</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Force Field Authentication</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Force Field Authentication</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You'll better understand that the world's balance has started to break down after you attend your classes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The students react as if they don't even care after they learn this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Your Registration and Exit Approval is already completed. Why do you look ill at ease?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Force Fields around the campus need to be activated in order to see their effect.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Main Entrance</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_19_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please acquire the Broom from the Locker Custodian, and dispose of the Rubbish inside the Dormitory before you return it to him. Please don't mess around, okay?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The students are doing good in terms of their training. Please be prepared to go outside for your training.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Really! These are two Cigarette Butts!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's not that I don't trust the students. I just worry about them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">So these are the notes from the Legend?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've been expecting these for a long time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">My associates will contact you again in case they need some more notes in the future.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We'll inform you of where we'll meet.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Let me remind you that we're not normal money isn't involved in this situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Issue Order Books</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_24_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">At last! The Order Books and information from the Financial Group Headquarters have arrived.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Guard outside the Main entrance is holding them now. Please help me get the documents from the Guard. Return here once you get them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Our campus also needs backup disks. If you want to recover the emergency facilities, there's no other way but to make a move and acquire these disks.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">So these are the notes from the Legend?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've been expecting these for a long time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Alright, thanks! With these, I can now use the facilities around here that I need. Hold on for a bit, this won't take long!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Just bring the documents over.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Do you want some instructions? Let me see? It's been awhile. I don't know if it's still good.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This place was built to gather outstanding students and educate them so that would grow to become strong individuals. If new students still haven't reached a commendable level by now, then that implies a lack of self discipline on their part.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please clean the Dormitory and gather all the garbage. We just happened to prepare the broom. Go and collect the garbage when you have the time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Wow! You collected a lot! This should be enough for now. Thank you very much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please come back again to help if you have the time to spare.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Brooms will help students sift through garbage to find possible clues that may help in the investigation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Prepare Broom</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_32_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Broom can be acquired from the Locker Room. Take it, and then I'll explain what to do next.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This money doesn't look counterfeit at all. These notes were forged pretty intricately. It's obviously that these were made for some purpose.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_34_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hm? The numbers on this money are flawless.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Let's see what we can do with these low quality notes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please don't forget to report any important discoveries you might find on the 3rd Floor to me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">ID Card Confirmation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_36_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What's in this cassette?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Could this contain the records of Leonair Campus?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Did you check the contents?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Have you made a request to the Specialist from the Financial Group?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Students, may I have your attention?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Everything has been predetermined from the very beginning.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Everything depends on the existence that controls them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">This process is inescapable.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There shouldn't be any more doubts about life, right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are the things that can be understood, and things that should never be known. You must learn to distinguish between the two.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_38_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You have to verify this first. It shouldn't be a problem. This means you can't predict what will happen next.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You wouldn't need to ask this question is you had been listening during class.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The surrounding chaos outside prevents students from maintaining a stable state of mind.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Yeah! This matter will demand much in terms of your time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_40_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am sure that there will be people that will be forced to play a role in starting chaos.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If that is your destiny, whether you like it or not, you'll have to do it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_41_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">In these troubled times, a Gang should display solidarity and do its best to serve its purpose.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Establish Gang Organization</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_42_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Increase the Gang's Status</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_42_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This situation was predicted a long time ago.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Sadly, it happened earlier than expected.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We must act swiftly to find all the details so that we can solve this as soon as possible.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There was a big fight among the students not very long ago. Since then, these strange events started to happen. Maybe we can figure something out by learning what happened in that fight. There have also been malicious rumors of some students joining Green's side.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Who could have spread these rumors?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Could it be that group from Sacred Gate Park?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_46_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Perhaps solving the mystery in Leonair Campus will improve the situation. It's especially troublesome that the teachers and students there have become our enemies, though. We need to be ready in case this situation gets worse.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_48_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">그곳의 학생과 교사들이 적으로 변해버렸다면 말처럼 쉽지 않겠지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_49_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Green? It sounds decent enough. Since the college was established, the area nearby became gangster territory run by criminal organizations.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">어쩌면 최악의 사태가 될지도 모르니 각오를 해 두는게 좋을거야.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Something like this has never happened before.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The procedures are getting more complicated</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">since the Computer Room isn't functioning</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If this isn't fixed soon, the students will be in</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">danger. Whoops! I s-said too much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_52_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_53_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'll help you process the application forms.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Take the original copy, and then go to the Society Room to submit your Exit Approval to the teacher.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Bring it here after you've got it filled out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_53_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_54_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm not questioning the capabilities of the students. It just means they aren't human anymore.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I have no idea what's wrong. Too many students are coming to the First-Aid Room, and I can't figure out a perfect solution to this problem. Please try to understand.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_54_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_55_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">최근엔 멋모르고 뛰쳐나갔다가 양호실로 직행하는 얼간이들이 많아져서 어쩔 수 없이 제한을 좀 하고 있는거니까 그리 알도록!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_55_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_56_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_57_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Something like this has never happened before.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The people on campus are getting restless.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you don't want to get injured,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">then I suggest that you concentrate</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">on your studies and training.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_57_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_58_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If this problem is not solved quickly, the college will be powerless to do anything. Whoops! I s-said too much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, following the Registration Procedures is a bit difficult.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_58_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_59_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">하여튼 이 등록신청서는... 보자...정상적인 절차를 거쳐 오지 않았군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">좀 곤란하겠는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_59_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The four colleges were set up Force Fields. The strange phenomenon on Leonair Campus spread to the Sacred Gate, Mystic Peak, and Phoenix campuses.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_60_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_61_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'll help you fill out the application form. Go to the Welfare Society and get another copy. The Welfare Society prepares the application forms.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_61_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_62_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please follow the procedures for processing the application form.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">These are the rules, not just meaningless writing on paper. Do you understand?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_62_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_63_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">규칙이란 건 지키라고 있는 거지 책 만드는 데에 페이지 채워주려고 만든 게 아니란 말이다 알아들었나?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_63_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_64_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_65_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Eh? The Exit Approval ends here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've already said this many times. It's up to you whether you want to hear it again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_65_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_66_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've already told you about the different locations on the map. I'm not repeating myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've already told you about how to fight monsters. I'm not repeating myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_66_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_67_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I won't repeat myself to the other students either.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now, what would it be?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_67_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_68_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">All I ask is for you students to be careful and not to die.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That's all I can tell you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_68_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_69_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What?! You still don't know the location of the Health Room? You can go straight across the Administration Office, and you'll probably see a room with the "Health Room" sign.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_70_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Our world is changing. Some students have started to develop special and uncanny aptitudes and capabilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Most of them don't even understand how to use their ability effectively. It's hard to stay safe right now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_70_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_71_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Our college has special Force Fields everywhere. It's unfortunate that these Force Fields are affected by the unusual phenomena at a certain level.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_71_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_72_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are also the strong mobs outside campus that cause destruction and chaos.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I believe that you'll be able to defeat them if you activate and learn the effects of the Force Fields.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_72_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_73_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">학원 바깥엔 더 강하고 괴상한 놈들이 진을 치고 있지만 이 결계들로부터 능력을 인정받고 힘을 얻을수 있다면 아마 꽤 강해질 수 있을 거다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_73_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_74_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_75_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Just by looking at them, I can tell some of the people in front of Headquarters are fools.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Nonetheless, I'm not worried by them because the exams that must be taken by all students will weed them out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_75_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_76_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are mobs of Little Hooligans running around. Please get two (2) Cigarette Butts from them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you do this, I will reward you with both experience and Skill Points.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_76_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_77_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">만약에 시험을 통과하면 경험치와 스킬포인트까지 주도록 하지!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_77_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_78_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_79_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You've completed the Force Field Activation?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That was fast!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You must be fairly strong!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_79_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">어디서 그런 위험한 약을...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">아니 어쩌면 좋은 일일지도 모르겠군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">'망각의약'... 지금까지 네가 배웠던 모든 것들을 순식간에 잊어버릴 수 있는 약인데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">그동안 조정했던 모든 능력 (스탯)과 기술 (스킬)을 처음 상태로 되돌리게 된다는 걸 명심하고</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">특히 스킬은 문서도 남아있지 않게 되니까 새로 구입하거나 찾아야 한다는 점을 잘 생각해서 선택하도록.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'망각의약'을 사용한다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_8_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_8_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">그동안 배웠던 모든 능력 (스탯)과 기술 (스킬)을 처음 상태로 되돌린다니</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">그런 위험한 약은 멀리 하라는 게 학원 방침이야!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">하지만 학생은 가지고 있지도 않은 것 같군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">게다가 10개는 있어야 효과가 생기거든</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_8_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_80_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The School Principal used a strange material to create the Force Field. It's almost unbelievable, but it really has amazing effects!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_80_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_81_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_82_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've already told this to you many times. The situation outside is beyond my comprehension. I never would have imagined anything like this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Some students who reached the Main Gate and attempted to pass through it were rushed to the First-Aid Room. Why weren't they able to go through?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_82_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_83_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is a test you must take before you can pass through the Main Gates.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Once the test procedure at the Terminal located near the Main Gate begins, you are required to finish the test within a specific amount of time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_83_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_84_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">그래서 간단한 능력 시험 프로그램을 준비했지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">정문의 단말기를 작동시키면 문제를 제시할테니, 제한시간 내에 통과할 수 있도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_84_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_85_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_86_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We can't just ignore this, not matter how bad it seems. Do you feel uneasy about this? Imagine how the other students would feel if they also found out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You've got to be tough!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_86_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_87_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_88_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">In order to acquire knowledge on the Suggestion Book, students need to bring the paper notes to the Student Director located at Mystic Peak.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The paper notes aren't normal money.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Be careful not to misplace it!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_88_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_89_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">혹시나 해서 주의 주겠는데, 이 지폐는 돈 나부랭이 같은게 아니니까 중간에 없어지지 않도록 주의해야 해!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_89_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">본래는 소승불교에서 모든 번뇌를 뚫고 이치를 깨달아 열반의 경지에 이른 성자를 가리키는 칭호인데 ‘나한’ 이라고도 하지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">'아라한' 의 자격을 인정받을 수 있다면 특별한 기운이 서린 무기를 받을 수 있어</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">그러려면 '마루치' 와 '아라한' 의 기서를 찾아야만 하지만 말이야...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'깨달음의 열쇠' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'나한의 구슬' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_90_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_91_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hm? So the people at Mystic Peak share my opinion?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is an experimental product of Counterfeited Anxiety Money.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It looks the same as normal notes, but it's kind of weird.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Just take a look at the copper coins.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_91_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_92_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_93_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah, no! It's not necessary to read it all right now. Just submit those documents to the Lecturer. Please go and find the mail sent by the Sacred Financial Group.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_93_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_94_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">가서 세인트 재단 본부가 발송자로 돼 있는 우편물을 찾아 가면 돼</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_94_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_95_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_96_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Students, may I have your attention?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Since the computers in our college are unable to operate properly, it'll be difficult to get authentication just by showing documents.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The documents should match the data in the system.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_96_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_97_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Let's just skip the documentation of the emergency procedures, and I'll inform you of any developments. In the meantime, I want you to go to Mystic Peak's Student Director and procure the Computer room Backup disk.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's urgent that we get it so that we can recover our information from the primary facilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_97_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_98_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">연락은 해 놓을테니까 현암학원의 학생주임님께 가서 전산실 복구용 백업디스크를 좀 받아오도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">급한대로 필요한 시설만 복구해서 자료를 찾아보도록 하지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_98_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_99_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you are not a Magician, there is nothing I can do for you.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Learning powerful magic is not easy! It requires a lot of efforts and practice. Now, what can I help you with?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 4th Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 5th Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_12">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 6th Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_13">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 7th Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_15">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 9th Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_16">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 10th Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_17">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 11th Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_18">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 12th Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_19">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 13th Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask the meaning of Dahlia.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_20">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 14th Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_21">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 15th Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_22">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 16th Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_23">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 17th Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_24">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 18th Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_25">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 21st Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_26">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 22nd Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_27">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 23rd Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_28">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 24th Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_29">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 25th Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Suggest ways on how to improve Magician Class.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask to learn combat of magic.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask what Damarians are.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask what should you do next.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 1st Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 2nd Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask 3rd Grade of Spirit Sphere.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you have Spirit Spheres, you are somehow qualified. Now, which skill do you want?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_10_0_1"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 瘀傷（27級／魔術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Bruise (Lv27, Class=49152, Item=380/70)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Bruise (Lv27, Class=49152, Item=380/70)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Bruise (Lv27, Class=49152, Item=380/70)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Bruise (Lv27, Class=49152, Item=380/70)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_10_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you have Spirit Spheres, you are somehow qualified. Now, which skill do you want?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_11_0_1"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 飛行玩具（27級／魔術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Flying Toy (Lv27, Class=49152, Item=380/3)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Flying Toy (Lv27, Class=49152, Item=380/3)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Flying Toy (Lv27, Class=49152, Item=380/3)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Flying Toy (Lv27, Class=49152, Item=380/3)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_11_0_2"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 開場號角（37級／魔術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Fanfare (Lv37, Class=49152, Item=380/4)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Fanfare (Lv37, Class=49152, Item=380/4)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Fanfare (Lv37, Class=49152, Item=380/4)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Fanfare (Lv37, Class=49152, Item=380/4)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_11_0_3"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 迴旋鞭（27級／魔術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Swirling Whip (Lv27, Class=49152, Item=380/24)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Swirling Whip (Lv27, Class=49152, Item=380/24)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Swirling Whip (Lv27, Class=49152, Item=380/24)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Swirling Whip (Lv27, Class=49152, Item=380/24)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_11_0_4"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 動物精通（37級／魔術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Animal Mastery (Lv37, Class=49152, Item=380/25)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Animal Mastery (Lv37, Class=49152, Item=380/25)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Animal Mastery (Lv37, Class=49152, Item=380/25)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Animal Mastery (Lv37, Class=49152, Item=380/25)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
