  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_locker.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">A Broom? Well, it's pretty inconvenient for me to carry this broom around while I'm trying to finish everything I need to do.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_locker.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Open the Locker</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_locker.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_locker.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The weather is getting cold and gloomy. I'm starting to feel aches and pains in my body.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_locker.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Open the Locker</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_locker.ntk_1_2_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Locker Usage</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_locker.ntk_1_2_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Campus</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_locker.ntk_1_2_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return Broom</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_locker.ntk_1_2_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Borrow Broom</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_locker.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_locker.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Of course! Just use these lockers whenever you want. Try to stick to using just one locker space for yourself, alright? Store items that you want to keep and use later inside your locker. You'll need to spend some more money if you want to expand your locker space.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_locker.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Open the Locker</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_locker.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_locker.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Sigh. How do I answer that question? As you probably know, there are 3 Campuses in the area, but there are rumors of a fourth campus. I've heard the teachers and the School Administration talking about the Force-- Force Fiel... Ah yes! The Force Field! I'm not one hundred percent sure, but I think there's something very important about that Force Field. Of all the campuses here, Leonair Campus is the probably the weirdest. I remember that I was just listening to some teachers talking when the sky suddenly change</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I really want to know more about what actually happened. If you guys find important information about that event, please don't forget to let me know, alright?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_locker.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Open the Locker</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_locker.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_locker.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Broom? Oh! That Broom! I really have no idea what's so special about these brooms. Well, if you really think you'll need one, feel free to take it. Please bring it back as soon as you're done using it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_locker.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_maingate1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This Terminal controls the entrance and exit to the Main Entrance.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_maingate1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Automatic Confirmation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_maingate1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Register for Exam to Pass through Main Entrance</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_maingate1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Test the Terminal</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_maingate1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Skill Testing System has been initiated!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The basic purpose of this program is to protect the students, and also serves as a temporary measure for determining when students develop their abilities beyond a certain level.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Good Luck, Students!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_maingate1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_maingate1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This Terminal's Force Field function is running properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is no other way to enter and exit through the school's Main Gate unless authentication is acquired.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_maingate1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Register for Exam to Pass through Main Entrance</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_maingate1.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_maingate1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Terminal is running properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_maingate1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_maingate1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_maingate1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">본 프로그램은 학원 외부에 존재하는 위험요소들로부터 학생들을 보호하기 위한 최소한의 제한대책이며, 능력이 확인된 일정 수준 이상의 학생들만을 선별하기 위한 임시방편입니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_maingate1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_maingate1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">시험의 내용은 20분 내에 씨름부원 10명을 쓰러트려 능력을 인정받는 것이며, 시험 진행중 사망하거나 포기할 경우 재시도할 수 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">씨름부원의 정보는 다음과 같습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_maingate1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_maingate1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">체력 : 1200</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">공격력 : 65~105</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">방어력 : 35</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">약점 : 공격력이 강하지만 속도가 느리므로 공격 동작 사이에 밀어내기가 가능한 스킬을 써서 견제한다면 유리하게 이끌 수 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_maingate1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Where are you injured?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Strange Person</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Strange Person's Identity</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Healing Treatment Situation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Nurse's Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Medicine</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the bad adults</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her what happened</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Change Save Point</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you very much. These medicines should last for some time. It's lucky that not too many people are getting injured.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Medicine can be acquired from the Nurse located at the Sacred Gate Ring. Are you willing to get those medicines for me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Although we could ask for help from the hospital in the neighboring city, I heard that it's not possible to go through the tunnel because there's something blocking the path inside.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We're all locked up in here!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah! There's one more thing you should know. It seems that the tunnel is block by some strange creatures and this toxic gas.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I heard that we would find it difficult to breathe inside that area, and that even wearing a gas mask is useless.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">A student named Zhen from the Combat Section claims he's got some other way of passing through that place.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">They are just a shameful adults.. You will be able to find Drunkards on the way to Rotary. They could not stop their old habits before the phenomenon. They are stealing rubbing alcohol and I cannot cure the students. I hope someone can stop them.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Don't blame yourself! If they had a little piece of human in them then might have tried to cure them but they already are no longer human beings.. Well, anyways, I would be able to sleep at night now. Thank you!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">They started appearing not too long ago. There was only one at first, but then they started multiplying and spread all over the Campus area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I don't think they're capable of masterminding or carrying out all of this chaos.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Just look at me. I don't have a choice but to sell and take care of the medicine here. My body has mutated too, just like everyone else. It's lucky that my mind has not been affected, though.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm sure you know the basics since you're already here, but there are still two things I want to teach you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Effects of Petrification</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_5_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Effects of Confusion</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm sorry that my memory still hasn't fully recovered yet. I might end up helping or harming you with my medical skills. I hope you understand the risks.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Petrification makes the body like stone: the victim is immobilized, but his Defense ironically increases.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This condition is characterized by the victim getting very dizzy. The Attack and Accuracy Rate of the victim is reduced by half, making him weak against his enemies. The moment SP (Stamina Point) is consumed, the victim will be in grave danger.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">All the medicine has just been used up. What am I going to do? There are people that still need treatment, so I'm glad that you came to help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_medic_1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Welcome!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Item Trading</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listen to the conversation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept the Order urgently</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept the Order urgently</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept the Order urgently</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept the Order urgently</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Request for Carter's Paper</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">희귀한 걸 정말 많이 모으셨네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘물리선생님’ 과 ‘학생주임님’, 그리고 ‘락커룸 관리인 아저씨’께 가져가면 처리해 주실 거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품 매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_10">
