    <VALUE Lang="th">‘물리선생님’ 과 ‘락커룸 관리인 아저씨’ 께 가져가면 처리해 주실 거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_14_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_15">
    <VALUE Lang="th">희귀한 걸 정말 많이 모으셨네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘물리선생님’ 과 ‘락커룸 관리인 아저씨’ 께 가져가면 처리해 주실 거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_15_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_16">
    <VALUE Lang="th">희귀한 걸 정말 많이 모으셨네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘세인트 재단’ 과 직접 관련있는 분이나 ‘락커룸 관리인 아저씨’께 가져가면 처리해 주실 거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_16_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_17">
    <VALUE Lang="th">희귀한 걸 정말 많이 모으셨네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘세인트 재단’ 과 직접 관련있는 분이나 ‘락커룸 관리인 아저씨’께 가져가면 처리해 주실 거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_17_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_18">
    <VALUE Lang="th">희귀한 걸 많이 모으셨네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘세인트 재단’과 직접 관련있는 분과 ‘학생주임’께 가져가면 처리해 주실 거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_18_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_19">
    <VALUE Lang="th">어머, 그 조각은 혹시...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">예전에 얘기들은 적이 있는데, 시내에 나가 계시는 ‘물리선생님’께 가져가 보세요.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">아마 7개를 맞춰서 뭔가를 만들어 낼 수 있을거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_19_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘세인트 재단’ 과 직접 관련있는 분이나 ‘학생주임님’, 그리고 ‘락커룸 관리인 아저씨’ 께 가져가면 처리해 주실 거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_20">
    <VALUE Lang="th">그렇군요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">조각 7개를 맞추면 열쇠가 된다니...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">저희 본사에서도 그런 비슷한 일을 봤는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘세인트 재단’ 에 의뢰해 보니 뭔가를 얻기 위한 증표하고 하던데요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘세인트 재단’ 과 직접적으로 관계가 있는 분에게 부탁하면 뭔가를 알 수 있을지도 몰라요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_20_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_21">
    <VALUE Lang="th">아, 그거 저도 본 적 있어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘나한의 구슬’ 이라는 거죠?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘학생주임’께서 말씀해 주셨는데, 30개를 모아서 가져오라고 하셨어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">뭐에 쓰는 걸까요?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_21_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_22">
    <VALUE Lang="th">파손상태가 너무 심해서 확실하지는 않지만</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">가지고 계신 건 분명히 ‘마루치 기서’의 조각인 것 같군요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">20조각을 모아 가면 아마 ‘락커룸 관리 아저씨’ 께서 도와주실 수 있을 거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_22_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_23">
    <VALUE Lang="th">파손상태가 너무 심해서 확실하지는 않지만</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">가지고 계신 건 분명히 ‘마루치 기서’의 조각인 것 같군요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">20조각을 모아 가면 아마 ‘락커룸 관리 아저씨’ 께서 도와주실 수 있을 거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_23_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_24">
    <VALUE Lang="th">드디어 그 조각들을 다 합치셨군요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">축하드려요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">음...그거라면 ‘학생주임님’께서 찾고 계신 책 같은데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">한번 ‘학생주임님’께 가져가 보세요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_24_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_25">
    <VALUE Lang="th">드디어 그 조각들을 다 합치셨군요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">축하드려요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">음...그거라면 ‘학생주임님’께서 찾고 계신 책 같은데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">한번 ‘학생주임님’께 가져가 보세요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_25_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">희귀한 걸 정말 많이 모으셨네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘물리선생님’ 과 ‘학생주임님’, 그리고 ‘락커룸 관리인 아저씨’ 께 가져가면 처리해 주실 거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_3_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">희귀한 걸 정말 많이 모으셨네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘세인트 재단’ 과 직접 관련있는 분이나 ‘학생주임님’, 그리고 ‘락커룸 관리인 아저씨’ 께 가져가면 처리해 주실 거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_4_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">희귀한 걸 정말 많이 모으셨네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘물리선생님’ 과 ‘학생주임님’, 그리고 ‘락커룸 관리인 아저씨’ 께 가져가면 처리해 주실 거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_5_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">희귀한 걸 정말 많이 모으셨네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘세인트 재단’ 과 직접 관련있는 분이나 ‘학생주임님’, 그리고 ‘락커룸 관리인 아저씨’ 께 가져가면 처리해 주실 거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_6_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">희귀한 걸 정말 많이 모으셨네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘물리선생님’ 과 ‘학생주임님’, 그리고 ‘락커룸 관리인 아저씨’ 께 가져가면 처리해 주실 거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_7_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">희귀한 걸 정말 많이 모으셨네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘세인트 재단’ 과 직접 관련있는 분이나 ‘학생주임님’, 그리고 ‘락커룸 관리인 아저씨’ 께 가져가면 처리해 주실 거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_8_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">희귀한 걸 정말 많이 모으셨네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘물리선생님’ 과 ‘학생주임님’, 그리고 ‘락커룸 관리인 아저씨’께 가져가면 처리해 주실 거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_1_9_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">어머~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">아직도 등록이 제대로 안되셨나 봐요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">여기, '외출신청서' 를 '교무실' 의 '학생주임' 께 제출하시면 등록이 마무리 될 수 있을거예요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">등록이 늦으셨네요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">예전에는 이런 용지는 그냥 형식상으로만 진열해 놓고 있을줄만 알았는데, 정말로 쓰게 줄은 몰랐어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It is not enough to just fill up the registration application form and bring it over right?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What, still on registration? Normally we go one by one, but this situation is different. So ... Perhaps coming directly would be better.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">이변이 일어나기 시작한 이후로는 함부로 바깥에 나가질 못해요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Is this the papers for the medical reports? These are sample of documents for medical reports. In any case, the Health Room is the only department that uses these. So, it cannot be wrong. What! The Health Room is very busy too? This is why everybody was asked to help the others.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are also items called Blessed Items. They are more special and quite hard to find. If you obtain these kind of items, could you please keep them properly?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">And... I have some items which I have never seen before, but they are really precious items. Look at the information records of our department, and you should be able to enquire and obtain it.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah, there is one type of item which cannot be used on your own will. I can't help you with these type of Items.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품 매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please use it only when you are on quest training.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Prior to the dispatch of all items to the various society, the items must be validated and approved first to ensure its quality, pricing and product classification.The education that the Society Members learned can now be utilized.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The resources available from our department has all been cut-off. I'm sorry for not having these items be readily available to students.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you have unwanted good items, you can come to me. I will exchange them for money.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You can also trade with your friends if you like.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">요즘같이 버튼 하나로 모든게 다 되는 세상에서 이런 구닥다리 같은 서류나 쓰고 있는게 참 안어울리지 않아요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">근데 이 용지를 그냥 이렇게 드리면 되는지 모르겠네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">무슨 절차를 밟아야 하는건 아닌지...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmm... First are the normal items. There are items which had been upgraded, with better performance. They are called rare items.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Student Director has made things to be done easily. You don뭪 have to repeat things all over again when you come back.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">During these critical times, it is now possible.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, just present the Exit Approval Form to the Student Director at the School Administration Office. The registration is almost done.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">여기 학생들이야 그만한 힘이 있으니까 나가볼 수 있겠지만, 저 같은 일반인은 나가는 건 꿈도 못 꾸죠</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_34_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">소문이지만 저 바깥에 있는 괴한들은 다들 이미 죽은 상태래요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">좀 이상하죠? 저도 믿지 못하고 있는데, 얘기들을 잘 들어보면 정말 그런 것 같기도 해요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">그렇잖아요- 똑같이 생긴 사람들이 우글우글 대지 않나... 옆에서 말을 걸어도 못 듣는 것 같고...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">뭐 저도 직접 보고 확인한 건 아니지만 정말 이상해요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">자, 외출신청서는 꼭 학생주임님께 제출하세요-</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Yes, we are the best shop to manage these type of items.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmm... are you asking about items? After defeating the enemy, you can get some items. Stronger enemies will drop better items.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만날 때 이르는 경지를 가리키는 말이라고 들었는데요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'마루치' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'아라치' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_6_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">득도의 경지에 이른 남성적 기운... 이래요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">소문이지만,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘마루치 기서’ 라는 책이 찢어진 채로 떠돌아 다닌다는 군요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">득도의 경지에 이른 여성적 기운... 이래요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">소문이지만,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘아라치 기서’ 라는 책이 찢어진 채로 떠돌아 다닌데요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">아무래도 그냥 오래된 책은 아니겠죠?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What are you looking for?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about how to get items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_9_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about categories of items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_9_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask information regarding the Welfare Society</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_9_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_archer1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is the Archery Training Room. Please go back to your own area unless you have something important to ask.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_archer1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
