  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! You have a Spiritual Sphere. Exchange it with desired Skill Scroll.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_29_0_1"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 赦免（137級／忍術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Exoneration (Lv137, Class=12288, Item=362/14)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Exoneration (Lv137, Class=12288, Item=362/14)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Exoneration (Lv137, Class=12288, Item=362/14)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Exoneration (Lv137, Class=12288, Item=362/14)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_29_0_2"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 殲滅（137級／忍術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Genocide (Lv137, Class=12288, Item=362/34)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Genocide (Lv137, Class=12288, Item=362/34)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Genocide (Lv137, Class=12288, Item=362/34)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Genocide (Lv137, Class=12288, Item=362/34)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_29_0_3"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 煙幕（127級／忍術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Smoke Screen (Lv127, Class=12288, Item=362/54)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Smoke Screen (Lv127, Class=12288, Item=362/54)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Smoke Screen (Lv127, Class=12288, Item=362/54)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Smoke Screen (Lv127, Class=12288, Item=362/54)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_29_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Learn Titan's Force</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_29_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Assassin is a club learning the skills to outreach the limit of human with the power of Solidified Stone and the ancient martial arts to win in a fight in any given condition!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_3_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are tons to learn so don't rush it! Come back after you take care of the things in the campus.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_3_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! You have a Spiritual Sphere. Exchange it with desired Skill Scroll.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_30_0_1"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 黑洞（147級／忍術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Blackhole (Lv147, Class=12288, Item=362/15)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Blackhole (Lv147, Class=12288, Item=362/15)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Blackhole (Lv147, Class=12288, Item=362/15)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Blackhole (Lv147, Class=12288, Item=362/15)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_30_0_2"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 迷醉（147級／忍術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Enrapture (Lv147, Class=12288, Item=362/35)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Enrapture (Lv147, Class=12288, Item=362/35)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Enrapture (Lv147, Class=12288, Item=362/35)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Enrapture (Lv147, Class=12288, Item=362/35)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_30_0_3"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 火焰傳送（137級／忍術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Fireport (Lv137, Class=12288, Item=362/55)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Fireport (Lv137, Class=12288, Item=362/55)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Fireport (Lv137, Class=12288, Item=362/55)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Fireport (Lv137, Class=12288, Item=362/55)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_30_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Learn Titan's Vigor</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_30_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Learn Scroll of Dragon Fire Ⅱ</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_30_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listen carefully!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'3' points are given at each level up. Depending on how you distribute them will decide your expertise.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_41_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you distribute into DEX then you will be the fast blade master using Dual Spear.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you distribute into POW then you will be the powerful and unstoppable Scythe master dealing great damages.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_43_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you distribute into INT then you will be the master of giant Shuriken using magic and toxic bombs.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The uniqueness and the advantage of Assassin is that we take out an opponent quick in no matter what kind of condition we are in. Therefore, it is essential that we reduce the unnecessary movement using skills. Remember, Assassin has be quick and precise in any given condition!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Why are you not registered..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You have not been getting ready as I have told you that is why…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You will find something suitable at the DB room Terminal, go get it!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We have just been created and it is hard to take care of everything. The chaos in and outside of school and the pile of works… Gee… I have no time to rest…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_52_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_53_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The creatures that wander around in and outside of school used to be the innocent teachers and citizens. Well, there also have been people who weren't innocent but anyways…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The point is that they have been mutated and turned into freaks so do not pity them! Surviving is our top priority until we can go back to our homes.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_53_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_54_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If it hadn't been the sudden phenomenon, I would not have become the instructor. However, since I have decided to do this, I am here to support you so don't hesitate to come to talk to me.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_54_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_55_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_56_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The phenomenon has much more effect outside of the school. All the people outside right now reports that they should never let their guard down for a second. Once you are out there, don't lose your tension. Remember, surviving is our top priority.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_56_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_57_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Once you submit the Exit Approval Form, you are swearing to take full responsibility of all the risk so be strong!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_57_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_58_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_59_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is just a portion about the Saint List. You will be surprised when you get closer to the truth. The current moment is important but I hope you could think deeper as you get closer to the truth.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_59_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Starting from '0', you will receive '1' skill point at each level up.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_60_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I know you must be confused!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Go to Trading Hole and meet Sia. She will give you extra information on Saint List.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_60_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_61_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! You have a Spiritual Sphere. Exchange it with desired Skill Scroll.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
