  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">음?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">어디서 그런 걸 들었지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">'세인트 재단' 에 보관중인 뭔가를 얻기 위한 증표이긴 한데, 열쇠는 그렇다 쳐도 대체 '파견요원' 이 지금 어디에 있는지 알 수가 없으니...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_100_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We won't beat this phenomenon by just leveling up and curing illnesses. We need to look at this with a broader perspective to find the root of the problem.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_100_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_101_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The cost of experimenting and researching to achieve that end is quite high.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'll try to gather everyone to discuss this matter when I have the time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_101_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_102_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....32q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_103_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The students might not have the Brooms ready by now. There's one thing I need to explain first. Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_103_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_104_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The strange phenomenon that happened a long time ago endangered the people's physical and mental well-being.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_104_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_105_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Most of the students and teachers that attempted to stop it were left inside the campus dormitory. This caused the accumulation of a lot of garbage.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_105_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_106_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It seems that the garbage is related to the negative effects of that strange phenomenon.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_106_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_107_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please investigate the garbage. You might be able to find a way to stop this strange situation from spreading.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_107_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_108_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....34</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_109_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You already have a Broom? Please go and collect the garbage and bring it here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_109_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">구슬 자체로는 그리 대단한 물건이 아니지만 30개를 합치면 꽤 쓸만한 목걸이를 만들 수 있지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_110_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please clean the Dormitory and gather as much garbage as you can.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_110_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_111_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......36</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_112_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Have you already made the request to the Specialist from the Sacred Financial Group?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Okay, please bring the cassette over here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_112_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_113_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....40q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_114_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">In order to start a Gang, you need at least five (5) members that do not belong to any other Gang. The Gang Leader applicant should be at Character Level 30, and pay a processing fee of 1,000,000 Gold Coins.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Gang Upgrade Charges:</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">[Level D]: 2,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">[Level C]: 3,500,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">[Level B]: 5,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">[Level A]: 7,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_114_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_115_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Experience will be lost if you disband or terminate the Gang.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you quit a Gang or kicked out of one, then you temporarily won't be allowed to join another Gang. Please remember this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_115_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_116_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmpf. I never expected the situation over there to be that bad.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please go there and check it out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_116_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_117_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">No information? Did you comb through the entire city?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Wei got this document from the Trading Hole Police.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You can try to advice him.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_117_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_118_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's nothing I need you to do now. Maybe you can check out the area between Middle Hole and Root Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_118_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_119_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This cannot be...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_119_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Talk about Sacred Financial Group</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_119_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Get Information about Generation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's strange that the students sent to investigate Leonair Campus haven't arrived yet.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The specialist from the Financial Group also doesn't have any idea what happened.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the College</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Health Room</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Chaotic Situation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Green</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Leonair College ID Card</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_120_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Lee Shi Zhang, the Director of the Financial Group, is one of the most sought after Feng Shui masters.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">He became able to foresee the future after that meteor shower 18 years ago...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_120_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_121_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Security at the Sacred Financial Group will be tight. The new recruits in their security force won't be too dangerous, but be careful. Their sheer numbers can very well overwhelm you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_121_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_122_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Our universe exists side by side with parallel universes in other dimensions. There are theories that our world is merging with those other universes, and we'll eventually coexist with the inhabitants of those other worlds. We won't be able to physically see this once the worlds merge, even if a being from another world is right beside us. Now, if these theories are true, then wouldn't it be possible to travel to other dimensions? Hmm, but these theories still haven't been proven, though.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_122_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_123_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I can't even imagine what kinds of things might live in other worlds and dimensions.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">And then there's that idea that, somehow, life native to our world can be combined with life from other worlds, resulting in the creation of a completely new life form. It all sounds so complicated.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_123_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_124_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Root Hole?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Have you heard of a building that belongs to the Sacred Financial Group?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've been there for the last few years...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_124_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_125_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Eh... Ehhhn...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Heh heh... Those guys only know how to praise students.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_125_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_126_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Go to the Trading Hole and talk to AngBeeLan. You might be able to learn more.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_126_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_127_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This looks like the student attendance list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Maybe it's more like the student record list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, there's nothing wrong with the list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Why are you so curious about it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_127_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Background of Students</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_128_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">How did you enter this school?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I did the same thing you did. Don't waste your time on that list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_128_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_129_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please send this document to a policeman.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now isn't a good time for students to be ignorant about the registration process. We didn't need such repetitive routines in the past, but now...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">아직까지 등록을 못한 학생이 있었군!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">학생은 들어온 지 꽤 오래된 것 같은데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">아깝게 됐어, 학사일정이 제대로 됐으면 학년도 올릴 수 있었을 텐데 말이야</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">아무리 정상업무 진행이 어려운 상황이라고는 해도 이렇게 절차를 무시하면 좀 곤란하지-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">어쩔 수 없는 노릇이군, 이 신청서는 대신 써 줄테니까 매점에 가서 외출신청서나 받아서 써 와</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">짾??</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We should do our best to survive through all of this. We need to remain calm and collected until this immense problem is resolved.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Principal's Examination</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Force Field Authentication</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Force Field Authentication</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Force Field Authentication</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Force Field Authentication</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You'll better understand that the world's balance has started to break down after you attend your classes. The students react as if they don't even care after they learn this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Your Registration and Exit Approval is already completed. Why do you look ill at ease?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Force Fields around the campus need to be activated in order to see their effect.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Main Gate</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_19_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please acquire the Broom from the Locker Custodian, and dispose of the Rubbish inside the Dormitory before you return it to him. Please don't mess around, okay?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The students are doing good in terms of their training.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please be prepared to go outside for your training.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Really!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">These are two Cigarette Butts!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's not that I don't trust the students. I just worry about them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">So these are the notes from the Legend?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've been expecting these for a long time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">My associates will contact you again in case they need some more notes in the future. We'll inform you of where we'll meet.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Let me remind you that we're not normal money isn't involved in this situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Issue Order Books</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_24_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">At last! The Order Books and information from the Financial Group Headquarters have arrived.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Guard outside the Main entrance is holding them now. Please help me get the documents from the Guard. Return here once you get them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Our campus also needs backup disks. If you want to recover the emergency facilities, there's no other way but to make a move and acquire these disks.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">So these are the notes from the Legend?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've been expecting these for a long time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Alright, thanks!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">With these, I can now use the facilities around here that I need. Hold on for a bit, this won't take long!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Just bring the documents over.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">지도를 맞춰달라고?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">어디 보자... 그런 일은 소시적 얘기인데 이제 와서 실력 발휘가 되려나 모르겠군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This place was built to gather outstanding students and educate them so that would grow to become strong individuals.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If new students still haven't reached a commendable level by now, then that implies a lack of self discipline on their part.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This money doesn't look counterfeit at all. These notes were forged pretty intricately. It's obviously that these were made for some purpose.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hm? The numbers on this money are flawless.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Let's see what we can do with these low quality notes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Brooms will help students sift through garbage to find possible clues that may help in the investigation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Prepare Broom</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_32_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Broom can be acquired from the Locker Room. Take it, and then I'll explain what to do next.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! It's great that you're here! I'm looking for someone that's willing to clean the dormitory.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_34_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Wow! You collected a lot! This should be enough for now. Thank you very much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please come back again to help if you have the time to spare.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What's in this cassette?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Could this contain the records of Leonair Campus?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Did you check the contents?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Have you made a request to the Specialist from the Financial Group?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Computer malfunction has caused tremendous problems around here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Are you suggesting that we get help from the Police Station?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That's weird. The Policemen should assist the Financial Group.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Yeah! This matter will demand much in terms of your time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_38_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am sure that there will be people that will be forced to play a role in starting chaos.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If that is your destiny, whether you like it or not, you'll have to do it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You wouldn't need to ask this question is you had been listening during class.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The surrounding chaos outside prevents students from maintaining a stable state of mind.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">In these troubled times, a Gang should display solidarity and do its best to serve its purpose.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_40_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Establish Gang Organization</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_40_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Increase the Gang's Status</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_40_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_41_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This situation was predicted a long time ago. Sadly, it happened earlier than expected.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We must act swiftly to find all the details so that we can solve this as soon as possible.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There was a big fight among the students not very long ago.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Since then, these strange events started to happen. Maybe we can figure something out by learning what happened in that fight.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There have also been malicious rumors of some students joining Green's side.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Who could have spread these rumors?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Could it be that group from Sacred Gate Park?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....6</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The weird phenomenon that started in Leonair Campus has spread to other areas.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_46_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Perhaps solving the mystery in Leonair Campus will improve the situation. It's especially troublesome that the teachers and students there have become our enemies, though. We need to be ready in case this situation gets worse.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_47_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......13</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Something like this has never happened before.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The procedures are getting more complicated</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">since the Computer Room isn't functioning</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_49_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Green? It sounds decent enough. Since the college was established, the area nearby became gangster territory run by criminal organizations.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If this isn't fixed soon, the students will be in danger. Whoops! I s-said too much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'll help you process the application forms. Take the original copy, and then go to the Society Room to submit your Exit Approval to the teacher.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Bring it here after you've got it filled out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_51_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm not questioning the capabilities of the students. It just means they aren't human anymore.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I have no idea what's wrong. Too many students are coming to the First-Aid Room, and I can't figure out a perfect solution to this problem. Please try to understand.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_52_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_53_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....14</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_54_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">어차피 지금은 예정에 없던 사건 때문에 우리 학원뿐만 아니라 다들 일정 정지 상태인 모양이니 손해본다는 생각은 하지 말고 열심히 자습이나 하도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_54_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">짾??</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_55_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">이 사건이 수습되지 않으면 학원 문제가 아니라 이 세상 자체가 없어질지도... 이런! 내가 너무 말이 많았군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_55_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_56_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">하여튼 이 등록신청서는... 보자...정상적인 절차를 거쳐 오지 않았군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">좀 곤란하겠는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_56_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">?쩊홁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_57_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......15</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_58_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">아마 그 신청서도 매점에 준비해 두고 있을게다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">하지만 다음부터는 제대로 정상적인 절차를 받아 오도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_58_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">짾??</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_59_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please follow the procedures for processing the application form.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">These are the rules. We didn't just frivolously decide on them, understand what I mean?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_59_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The four colleges were set up Force Fields. The strange phenomenon on Leonair Campus spread to the Sacred Gate, Mystic Peak, and Phoenix campuses.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_60_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......16</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_61_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Eh? The Exit Approval ends here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've already said this many times. It's up to you whether you want to hear it again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_61_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_62_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've already told you about the different locations on the map. I'm not repeating myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've already told you about how to fight monsters. I'm not repeating myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_62_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_63_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I won't repeat myself to the other students either.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now, what would it be?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">All I ask is for you students to be careful and not to die. That's all I can tell you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_63_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_64_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....17</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_65_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Our world is changing. Some students have started to develop special and uncanny aptitudes and capabilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_65_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_66_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Most of them don't even understand how to use their ability effectively. It's hard to stay safe right now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_66_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_67_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Our college has special Force Fields everywhere. It's unfortunate that these Force Fields are affected by the unusual phenomena at a certain level.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are also the strong mobs outside campus that cause destruction and chaos.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I believe that you'll be able to defeat them if you activate and learn the effects of the Force Fields.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_67_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_68_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......18</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_69_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Just by looking at them, I can tell some of the people in front of Headquarters are fools.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Nonetheless, I'm not worried by them because the exams that must be taken by all students will weed them out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_69_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What! You still don't know the location of the Health room?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You can go straight across the Administration Office and you'll probably see a room labeled as the "Health Room".</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_70_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are mobs of Little Hooligans running around. Please get two (2) Cigarette Butts from them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you do this, I will reward you with both experience and Skill Points.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_70_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_71_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......19q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_72_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You've completed the Force Field Activation?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That was fast!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You must be fairly strong!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_72_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_73_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The School Principal used a strange material to create the Force Field. It's almost unbelievable, but it really has amazing effects!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_73_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_74_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....21</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_75_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've already told this to you many times. The situation outside is beyond my comprehension. I never would have imagined anything like this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_75_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_76_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Some students who reached the Main Gate and attempted to pass through it were rushed to the First-Aid Room. Why weren't they able to go through?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is a test you must take before you can pass through the Main Gates.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_76_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_77_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Once the test procedure at the Terminal located near the Main Gate begins, you are required to finish the test within a specific amount of time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_77_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_78_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......22</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_79_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We can't just ignore this, not matter how bad it seems. Do you feel uneasy about this? Imagine how the other students would feel if they also found out. You've got to be tough!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_79_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">어디서 그런 위험한 약을...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">아니 어쩌면 좋은 일일지도 모르겠군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">'망각의약'... 지금까지 네가 배웠던 모든 것들을 순식간에 잊어버릴 수 있는 약인데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">그동안 조정했던 모든 능력 (스탯)과 기술 (스킬)을 처음 상태로 되돌리게 된다는 걸 명심하고</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">특히 스킬은 문서도 남아있지 않게 되니까 새로 구입하거나 찾아야 한다는 점을 잘 생각해서 선택하도록.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'망각의약'을 사용한다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_8_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_8_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">그동안 배웠던 모든 능력 (스탯)과 기술 (스킬)을 처음 상태로 되돌린다니</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">그런 위험한 약은 멀리 하라는 게 학원 방침이야!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">하지만 학생은 가지고 있지도 않은 것 같군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">게다가 10개는 있어야 효과가 생기거든</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_8_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_80_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....23</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_81_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">In order to acquire knowledge on the Suggestion Book, students need to bring the paper notes to the Student Director located at Mystic Peak.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_81_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_82_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The paper notes aren't normal money. Be careful not to misplace it!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_82_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_83_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...24q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_84_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hm? So the people at Mystic Peak share my opinion?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is an experimental product of Counterfeited Anxiety Money.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_84_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_85_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It looks the same as normal notes, but it's kind of weird. Just take a look at the copper coins.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_85_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_86_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......25</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_87_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah, no! It's not necessary to read it all right now. Just submit those documents to the Lecturer. Please go and find the mail sent by the Sacred Financial Group.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_87_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_88_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......27</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_89_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Students, may I have your attention?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Since the computers in our college are unable to operate properly, it'll be difficult to get authentication just by showing documents.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_89_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">본래는 소승불교에서 모든 번뇌를 뚫고 이치를 깨달아 열반의 경지에 이른 성자를 가리키는 칭호인데 ‘나한’ 이라고도 하지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">'아라한' 의 자격을 인정받을 수 있다면 특별한 기운이 서린 무기를 받을 수 있어</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">그러려면 '마루치' 와 '아라한' 의 기서를 찾아야만 하지만 말이야...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'깨달음의 열쇠' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'나한의 구슬' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_90_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The documents should match the data in the system.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Let's just skip the documentation of the emergency procedures, and I'll inform you of any developments.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_90_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_91_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">In the meantime, I want you to go to Mystic Peak's Student Director and procure the Computer room Backup disk.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_91_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_92_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's urgent that we get it so that we can recover our information from the primary facilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_92_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_93_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......28</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_94_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Considering your current level right now, it is not necessary to read the rest of the document.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Just bring the suggestion book over.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_94_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_95_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....29</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_96_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">음!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">흠, 허허, 이 정도로 여기까지 뛰어 온 건가?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">겨우 7 조각 맞추는 게 뭐 그리 힘들다고...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_96_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">짾??</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_97_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">하기야 문외한이 보면 7조각이라 해도 100 조각은 되는 것처럼 분간이 안될 수도 있긴 하겠지만,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">자 이 부분을 잘 보면 같은 방향으로 찢겨있는 무늬가 살아있지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_97_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">짾??</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_98_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">이게 힌트가 될 수 있지만 여기서 또 하나의 문제가 함정처럼...응? 바로 가져 가려고?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">오랜만에 반가운 걸 가져왔는데 좀 아쉽군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">혹시라도 나중에 비슷한 걸 찾으면 또 가져오도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_98_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">?쩊홁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_99_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....31</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
