  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cheyuk_1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">학습1관 내부에는 일부의 복사령들이 활동중입니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">이들이 지닌 구성자들이 주변의 요소들에게 불확실한 영향을 끼치고 있으니, 구성자들을 가능한한 제거해 주십시오</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">현재 우선시되는 체인가이의 정보는 아래와 같습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">체력 : 230</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">공격력 : 25~36</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">방어력 : 4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">약점 : 걷기만 하므로 공격과 이동을 적절히 사용하면 효과를 볼 수 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm not sure how the streets got to be this dangerous. I'm so lucky to have found a safe place to hide!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Sheesh! I really don't know what'll happen to me if I'm not careful.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What are you talking about?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listen to Cleaner's Advice</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Delivering Recycled Trash</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Recycled Trash</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You still have no idea regarding the situation after seeing it? Things suddenly got weird while I was cleaning the streets. Please be careful around this area. It's very dangerous!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ever since these events happened, we never had the chance to run away. No one is left to do the cleaning up till now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you very much! I'm so sorry for bothering you. We really have to treasure all kinds of resources. I'll ask for your help later in case you have any spare time to assist me. I will exchange any precious items you collect for any of my available items.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If this mess and resource shortage continues, then we'll suffer tremendous problems later on.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are other matters that you don't need to worry about for now. Just concentrate on helping me collect some Empty Bottles.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Terminal located in the Basic Science Classroom is not functioning properly. Please take note of this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Activate Authentication</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Retrieve Information</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Retrieve Information</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Retrieve Information</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Retrieve Information</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Retrieve Information</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Due to the errors found in the School's</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Information Center System,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">the Information Room has all the essential</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">information contained within these 2 files.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We will restore all necessary information</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">as soon as we resolve the situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Do you want to stay and read through these</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">documents?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Sword Section Student named Chi Ri Qing</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Archery Section Student named Cheng Xi Zhi</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Chi Ri Qing is a Sacred Gate Campus 2nd Year Student. He is a former Trainee of the Sword Section Class. His background is very interesting: both of his parents died in a chaotic incident.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Since then, he left the school carrying out his own investigation about the incident.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you have seen or have any information about this student, please contact the Administration Office immediately.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Cheng Xi Zhi is a 2nd Year student from the Sacred Gate Campus, and a former trainee of the Archery Section. Both of her parents died in the catastrophic phenomenon that caused the major problems in our world. She is now using her Evil Spirit to find her mutated older sister.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">This student has important information regarding the location of Leonair Campus. We must get in contact with her immediately.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are no means to keep this Terminal to function properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gisuk_1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This Terminal controls the entrance and exit to the Dormitory.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gisuk_1.ntk_1_0_1">
