  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Guard's 3rd Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Knives</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Get the Documents</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Make sure you stop and never pass through the crossroads in front.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are a lot of weird dogs loitering that area, and no one knows where they came from.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It would be safer to travel along the left or right corner streets. Honestly, I'm not very familiar with the other roads because I've never actually passed by them before.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만나서 이루는 경지를 말하는거 라더군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">아마도 '나한의 구슬' 과 '깨달음의 열쇠'도 관계가 있을거야</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'깨달음의 열쇠' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_11_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'나한의 구슬' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_11_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">예전에 재단에서 온 사람들이 그런 말을 하는 걸 들은 적이 있는데 열쇠가 지금은 조각 조각으로 나뉘어져 있다더군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">일단은 그 조각들을 합쳐야 할 텐데 말야...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">직접 본 적은 없으니까 녹색 구슬이라는 것 밖에는 알 수가 없군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">더 자세한 건 '학생주임'님께 여쭈 보면 알 수 있지 않을까</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">These mobs bring nothing but destruction to the environment.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask what is Happening</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_14_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Situation on the Streets</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_14_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask for Useful Information</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_14_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You mean the mail from the Finance Department Headquarters?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I actually had that document earlier, but I'm not sure where I placed it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Goodness! I almost forgot...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I should have told you at the very beginning. I was thinking of asking you to do something.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well… I'll be…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is the note! Thanks for finding it. Even though you found this note, there are still bigger problems that we've got to deal with.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Sigh...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_17_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Guard's 2nd Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please consider helping me out by delivering this medicine to the Health Advisor.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! You found them all! Thank you very much Student! Please take these medicines to the Health Advisor now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hm? Did the Health Advisor like it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! He did?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Sorry for troubling you like this, but I really appreciate your hard work, especially since it's making our campus much safer.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm really impressed by your performance.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'll be sure to commend you for all the good you've done for me if I ever meet your teachers again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! It's over here!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It might not seem very important, but the Student Direction personally requested this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Maybe he sets a limit on how much he trusts the students. What's important is that the document is still here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I wasn't aware of the full extent of the chaos caused by these weird mobs on the campus grounds and the surrounding area. That is why I'm staying here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Not so long ago, the note written by the Health Advisor that the Blood Drinker requested was stolen. I'm sorry for bothering you, but may I know if you've found the stolen note?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Health Advisor has ordered the recovery of the first-aid medicine several times. We need that medicine back as soon as possible.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Sigh... I don't even know where to begin.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">My situation is a bit complicated because I have to take care of the Health Advisor's request to search for first-aid medicine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I lost the list of medicines!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is a serious problem</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please accept my request for your help again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are these fellahs known as the Blood Drinkers that rob people who possess the medicine. It's pretty clear that these Blood Drinkers have the medicine. Please make sure they can't rob people of their medicine again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you very much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please take this medicine to the Health Advisor now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The people causing trouble on campus are preventing me from bringing this medicine to the Health Advisor.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Those mobs bring nothing but chaos to the streets!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Especially that group of mobsters known as the Gangsters!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">So you might see all sorts of folk carrying around daggers dripping with fresh blood, but you don't need to be that afraid of them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please help me out by taking the Knives away from those Gangsters.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's probably impossible to get all their daggers, but I think getting 10 Daggers from them shouldn't be a problem.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I hear that some strange kind of money has appeared.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">At least that's what I heard. You can learn more about the rumor at the campus's crossroads over there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_38_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I hear that item is very small and easy to lose.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Search for the people that came back from the dead on Leonair Campus and talk to them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You might learn some useful information.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is the first time in my life that I've encountered a problem that doesn't make any sense at all. I can't even go outside to assess the actual situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Where in the hell are these mobs coming from?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Not so long ago, those creatures almost killed me while I was rescuing a friend of mine. I barely died, and I tell ya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It was horrible!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_4_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Situation on the Streets</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I hear that item is very small and easy to lose.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Search for the people that came back from the dead on Leonair Campus and talk to them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You might learn some useful information.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_40_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">하도 정신이 없어서 누군지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">얼굴도 기억 나질 않는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">하여튼 그 친구가 자기 이름이</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">그렇다고 했던 것만 겨우 기억</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">나는군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmmmm... Let me see.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Let me see. Even though I had a tough time coming here, I don't think I have any other information to tell you. Wait! Hold on a minute.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's something called an Abrasive Potion that you can use to make better equipment.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_7_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask How to Use Abrasive Potions</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Open the Inventory Window and choose the Abrasive Potion. Drag it to the item you want to transform by clicking the top right position of the item, and the item will be upgraded.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">난리도 아니야~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">여기부터는 최소한 레벨이 35는 돼야 갈 수 있을걸세.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">그러니 그냥 얌전히 돌아가서 연습 좀 더 하고 나오게나.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This Terminal controls the entrance and exit to the Science Center.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Confirm Activation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Test the Terminal</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Test the Terminal</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Force Field Optimization</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Force Field Optimization</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Science Center Purification</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Confirm Purification</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The top priority targets for this area are the Street Junkies. Please help eliminate 22 of them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Terminal is running properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Force Field Mechanism of the Terminal running properly. You must gather Spiritual Spheres to optimize the Force Field.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You'll need 7 Spiritual Spheres in order to activate this Terminal's Force Field.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The optimization of this Force Field is completed!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please proceed to the next Terminal responsible for the next Force Field Optimization.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are evil spirits roaming the Science Center. The mobs of monsters possessed by these spirits are causing strange effects to their surroundings. Please try your best to eliminate them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The target amount of purification has been achieved and verified.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you for your efforts!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gwahak_1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gyobo_1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This Terminal controls the room access to the Auxiliary Supplies Room.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gyobo_1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Confirm Activation</VALUE>
