    <VALUE Lang="th">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_main_1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">키보드 'M' 키를 누르시면 볼 수 있는 전체지도의 '본관' 을 찾아 들어가시면 본관 내부로 가실 수 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_main_1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_main_1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Terminal is running properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_main_1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_main_1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Force Field Mechanism of the Terminal is running properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_main_1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_main_1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Force Field Optimization for the current Terminal is completed.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please proceed to the next Terminal to complete all the required Force Field Optimizations.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_main_1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_main_1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">학습2관 내부에는 일부의 복사령들이 활동중입니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_main_1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_main_1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">키보드의 'H' 키를 누르시면 단축키 등의 도움말을 볼 수 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_main_1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">ゐ???</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_main_1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">현재 서 계시는 곳은 학원 내의 옥외지역으로 전투지역으로 분류되어 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품 매매 등의 기타 행위를 위해서는 본관 안으로 들어가셔야 합니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_main_1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_main_1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_main_1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Force Field Mechanism of the Terminal is running properly. You'll need 2 Spiritual Spheres to optimize this Terminal's Force Field function.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please collect 2 Spiritual Spheres from the Little Hooligans.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_main_1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_maingate1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This Terminal controls the entrance and exit to the Main Entrance.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_maingate1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Automatic Confirmation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_maingate1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Register for Examination to pass through the Main Entrance</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_maingate1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Test the Terminal</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_maingate1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Skill Testing System has been initiated. The basic purpose of this program is to protect the students, and also serves as a temporary measure for determining when students develop their abilities beyond a certain level.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Good Luck, Students!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_maingate1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_maingate1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Force Field function of this Terminal is running properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is no other way to enter and exit through the school's Main Gate unless authentication is acquired.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_maingate1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Register for Examination to pass through the Main Entrance</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_maingate1.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_maingate1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Main Entrance Terminal is running properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_maingate1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_maingate1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_maingate1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">본 프로그램은 학원 외부에 존재하는 위험요소들로부터 학생들을 보호하기 위한 최소한의 제한대책이며, 능력이 확인된 일정 수준 이상의 학생들만을 선별하기 위한 임시방편입니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_maingate1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_maingate1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">시험의 내용은 20분 내에 씨름부원 10명을 쓰러트려 능력을 인정받는 것이며, 시험 진행중 사망하거나 포기할 경우 재시도할 수 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">씨름부원의 정보는 다음과 같습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_maingate1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_maingate1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">체력 : 1200</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">공격력 : 65~105</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">방어력 : 35</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">약점 : 공격력이 강하지만 속도가 느리므로 공격 동작 사이에 밀어내기가 가능한 스킬을 써서 견제한다면 유리하게 이끌 수 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_maingate1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Where are you injured?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Strange Person</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Strange Person's Identity</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Healing Treatment Situation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Nurse's Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Medicine</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the bad adults</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her what happened</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Change Save Point</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you very much. These medicines should last for some time. It's lucky that not too many people are getting injured.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Medicine can be acquired from the Nurse located at the Sacred Gate Ring. Are you willing to get those medicines for me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Although we could ask for help from the hospital in the neighboring city, I heard that it's not possible to go through the tunnel because there's something blocking the path inside.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_16_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's no wonder we're all locked up in here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah! There's one more thing you should know. It seems that the tunnel is block by some strange creatures and this toxic gas.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Traveling through the tunnel is going to be really difficult, even if you bring a gas mask.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">However, a Student from the Combat Section named Zhen claims to know some alternative methods to pass through the tunnel.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">They are just a shameful adults.. You will be able to find Drunkards on the way to Rotary. They could not stop their old habits before the phenomenon. They are stealing rubbing alcohol and I cannot cure the students. I hope someone can stop them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Don't blame yourself! If they had a little piece of human in them then might have tried to cure them but they already are no longer human beings.. Well, anyways, I would be able to sleep at night now. Thank you!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">They started appearing not too long ago. There was only one at first, but then they started multiplying and spread all over the Campus area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I don't think they're capable of masterminding or carrying out all of this chaos.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Just look at me. I don't have a choice but to sell and take care of the medicine here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">여기까지 올 수 있었으니 기본적인 것들은 알고 있을테죠</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">그러니 두 가지만 더 알려드리도록 할까요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'석화'에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_5_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'착란'에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm sorry that my memory still hasn't fully recovered yet. I might end up helping or harming you with my medical skills. I hope you understand the risks.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">몸을 돌처럼 단단하게 만들어서 거의 움직일 수 없게 된 상태죠</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">하지만 그만큼 방어력이 올라가 버립니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">어지러워지는 상태라고 설명할 수 있겠군요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">명중율과 공격력이 반감돼 버려서 공격이 어려워지는 경우인데, '스태미너' 가 적을 때에도 같은 상태가 됩니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">All the medicine has just been used up. What am I going to do? There are people that still need treatment, so I'm glad that you came to help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_medic_1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
