  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_1_7_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_1_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">희귀한 걸 정말 많이 모으셨네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘세인트 재단’ 과 직접 관련있는 분이나 ‘학생주임님’, 그리고 ‘락커룸 관리인 아저씨’ 께 가져가면 처리해 주실 거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_1_8_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_1_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">희귀한 걸 정말 많이 모으셨네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘물리선생님’ 과 ‘학생주임님’, 그리고 ‘락커룸 관리인 아저씨’께 가져가면 처리해 주실 거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_1_9_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">어머~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">아직도 등록이 제대로 안되셨나 봐요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">여기, '외출신청서' 를 '교무실' 의 '학생주임' 께 제출하시면 등록이 마무리 될 수 있을거예요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">등록이 늦으셨네요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It is not enough to just fill up the registration application form and bring it over, right?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What! You are still on registration? Normally we go one by one, but this situation is an exception. So... perhaps coming directly would be better... It should be...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Don't have any way to go outside at the abnormal time. The students can go outside because they have a little power but for a normal person like me, going out is just like a nightmare.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Paper for medical report usage? It뭩 the sample document for medical report. In any case, the Health Room only uses this, cannot be wrong. The Health Room is very busy too? Everybody is called to help people...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are also items called Blessed Items, which are more special and very well done and are therefore quite hard to find. If you obtain this kind of items, could you please keep them properly?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">And... I have some items which I have never seen before, but are really precious items. Look at the information record of our department and you should be able to inquire and obtain.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah, there is one type of item which cannot be used on your own will. I can't help you with these items, it will be a little bit difficult. Please use it only during a quest training.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">물품 매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please use it only when you are on quest training.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Prior to the dispatch of all items to the various societies, the items must be validated and approved to ensure quality, proper pricing and product type. The knowledge that the society members learned from there can now be finally used.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Although it said so, now that the available resources from our department were all cut off, I don't have the item that should have been available ... Sorry.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you have any unwanted items, come to me and I will exchange it with money.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">But if you could trade items with your friends, it is not necessary to look for me.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">예전에는 이런 용지는 그냥 형식상으로만 진열해 놓고 있을줄만 알았는데, 정말로 쓰게 줄은 몰랐어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">요즘같이 버튼 하나로 모든게 다 되는 세상에서 이런 구닥다리 같은 서류나 쓰고 있는게 참 안어울리지 않아요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmm... First is normal item. There are upgraded items with better performance, called rare items.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">근데 이 용지를 그냥 이렇게 드리면 되는지 모르겠네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">무슨 절차를 밟아야 하는건 아닌지...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It can be done easily because of the Student Director. Otherwise, you may have to repeat it again before you return. Anyway, since now is a critical time, it is possible. Anyway, just present the Egress Application Form to the Student Director at the School Administration Office, the registration is almost done.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Although it's only hearsay, the monsters out there are already dead.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_34_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">소문이지만 저 바깥에 있는 괴한들은 다들 이미 죽은 상태래요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">좀 이상하죠? 저도 믿지 못하고 있는데, 얘기들을 잘 들어보면 정말 그런 것 같기도 해요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Feel weird? I didn't believe it too, but you will after listening to them. Isn't it just like that? Human beings have no concern for one another... There are no responses even when you speak to them.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I didn't see it with my own eyes, but it just sounds very strange. So, you must hand the Exit Approval Form to the Student Director.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Yes, we are the best shop to manage the items flow...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmm... Are you asking about items? You can get some items after defeating an enemy. Stronger enemies drop better items.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만날 때 이르는 경지를 가리키는 말이라고 들었는데요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'마루치' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'아라치' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_6_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">득도의 경지에 이른 남성적 기운... 이래요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">소문이지만,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘마루치 기서’ 라는 책이 찢어진 채로 떠돌아 다닌다는 군요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">득도의 경지에 이른 여성적 기운... 이래요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">소문이지만,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘아라치 기서’ 라는 책이 찢어진 채로 떠돌아 다닌데요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">아무래도 그냥 오래된 책은 아니겠죠?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What are you looking for?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about how to get item/s.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_9_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the categories of item/s.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_9_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask information regarding the Welfare Society.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_9_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This Terminal controls the Access Permission to the Laboratory.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Confirm Activation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Test the Terminal</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Force Field Optimization</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Test the Terminal</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Test the Terminal</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Test the Terminal</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Force Field Optimization</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Force Field Optimization</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Force Field Optimization</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Laboratory Purification</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Confirm Purification</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The mobs of monsters possessed by these spirits are causing strange effects to their surroundings. Do your best to eliminate them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The primary targets in this area are the Slashers.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please do your best to eliminate 27 of them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Terminal is operating normally.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Terminal's Force Field function is operating properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Force Field function of this Terminal has been Optimized!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please proceed to the next Force Field Terminal to be optimized to complete the Force Field Optimization process.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are evil spirits roaming inside the Laboratory.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The required amount for purification has been achieved and authenticated.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you for your efforts.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You must gather 10 Spiritual Spheres to optimize this Terminal's Force Field function.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silhum_1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silsup_1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This Terminal controls the access to the Practice Center.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silsup_1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Confirm Activation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silsup_1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Test the Terminal</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silsup_1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Test the Terminal</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silsup_1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Force Field Optimization</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silsup_1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Force Field Optimization</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_silsup_1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Practice Center Purification</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
