    <VALUE Lang="th">Spiritual Spheres are earned by achieving certain character levels. You can use Spiritual Spheres to learn available skills of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_34_0_1"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 獵人陷阱（107級／弓箭部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Hunter's Snare (Lv107, Class=260, Item=173/27)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Hunter's Snare (Lv107, Class=260, Item=173/27)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Hunter's Snare (Lv107, Class=260, Item=173/27)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Hunter's Snare (Lv107, Class=260, Item=173/27)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_34_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Learn Gaia's Blessing</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_34_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Upgraded Short Bow [Electric]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_34_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Spiritual Spheres are earned by achieving certain character levels. You can use Spiritual Spheres to learn available skills of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_35_0_1"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 獵人陷阱（107級／弓箭部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Hunter's Snare (Lv107, Class=260, Item=173/27)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Hunter's Snare (Lv107, Class=260, Item=173/27)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Hunter's Snare (Lv107, Class=260, Item=173/27)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Hunter's Snare (Lv107, Class=260, Item=173/27)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_35_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Learn Gaia's Blessing</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_35_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Upgraded Short Bow [Electric]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_35_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">........3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Mastering the use of a bow is very difficult. There are many different archery styles, but you must start by learning the fundamental techniques.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The ability to attack a target from long range is the primary advantage of the Archery Section.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_38_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">힘과 민첩과 체력에 나누게 되면 보다 강한 공격을 할 수 있지만 발사속도가 떨어지는 강공형으로,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">ゐ???</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Concentration is the most important thing when using a bow.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">민첩과 기력과 지력에 나누게 되면 기를 이용한 공격과 기술을 지닐 수 있는 기공형으로 성장할 수 있으니 참고하도록 해라.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_40_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......4-1</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Don't invest too many Stat Points in physical strengths since characters also benefit from concentration and other attributes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now, it's not always possible, but it's ideal if an archer can always maintain a safe distance from his enemies.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Try to keep your distance from your target, especially when you suddenly find yourself in a close encounter.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_43_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You'll probably fare better if you form a group with other players since you have relatively weak defenses.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">........5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Nonetheless, try not to ignore your Strength stat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_46_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You are awarded 3 Stat Points each time your character levels up. Your character's build and growth is determined by how these Stat Points are allocated to your character's attributes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you concentrate on Dexterity, you will develop great Attack Speed and become a Fast Attack Type.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Distributing Stat Points evenly to Strength and Dexterity, and investing some into Vitality, will develop your character into a Power Attack Type.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Lastly, distributing the points evenly to Strength and Dexterity and some to Intelligence will build a Skill Type character.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_47_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......5-2</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">'K'키로 스킬창을 열고 가장 오른편의 '기공' 항목에서 '거절'을 선택한 뒤 열리는 왼편 윗편의 슬롯에 위치시키게 되면 그 순간부터 오른쪽 클릭으로 '거절' 기술을 쓸 수 있을거야.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">주변의 적들을 튕겨내는 기술이니 유용하게 쓰도록 해.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_49_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">?쩊홁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You need to use your skills more frequently if you want to master the art of instantly killing your enemies.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Students from the Archery Section need not to depend solely on strength. Consider upgrading your character's agility to increase the accuracy of hitting you targets.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......7</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">그 양 옆에 ‘매점’ 하고 ‘락커룸’이 있으니까 가 봐</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">그리고 학원생 등록에 대해서는 ‘매점’ 바로 옆에 ‘교무실’의 ‘학생주임’께 꼭 말씀드리고</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_51_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">짾??</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">‘양호실’에 가면 상처치료도 해 주니까 미리 가서 인사나 드리도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_52_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">?쩊홁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_53_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......9</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_54_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There aren't too many normal human beings around anymore. Most have already been transformed into evil monsters. Although it's a really bad situation, it's not like things can't be changed for the better.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please remember this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_54_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_55_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The teachers are doing all that they can to return things back the way they should be.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_55_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_56_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....10</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_57_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Like I said before, these violent monsters are wrecking our campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please get out there, and keep them from causing even more destruction.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_57_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_58_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Know that carelessness may result in you ending up in a really bad situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_58_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_59_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Remember that you'll be entering a world full of dangers once you submit the Exit Approval Form. Please be careful out there!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_59_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skill Points are set at 0 at the start. Each time your character's level increases, you will be awarded with 1 Skill Point. You can use these Skill Points to learn new skills or upgrade existing skills.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Most skills will require you to consume Skill Points in order to learn them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You should have more than enough Skill Points at the beginning since the starting skills won't require many Skill Points.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You'll find, however, that you might not have enough points to learn some of the later skills. Think and plan carefully, and choose the essential skills that you want to learn.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_60_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh... So you saw the List of Saints.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's true that there's nothing wrong with the list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah, but you're probably curious about what's behind it. Am I right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Why are there so many students with family problems?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's quite simple, actually.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Not too many loving parents would send their children to an experimental school.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Even if extraordinary benefits were offered, most parents would think that traditions set by normal schools are more important.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_60_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_61_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Many people raise this question...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">What is forgiveness, and does it work?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, but it's not like I have the right to teach you anything.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Why should I force what little I know upon you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You know that there are arenas in the Trading Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You can find teachers that can teach you more over there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_61_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_62_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Spiritual Spheres are earned by achieving certain character levels. You can use Spiritual Spheres to learn available skills of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_62_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange for Wild Shot</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
