  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It looks like you still haven't registered as a College Student yet! Even though the situation outside is complete chaos, I'll never allow a new student to skip the registration process.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You need to register first so we can confirm whether you are qualified to be a student of this college.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please finish the Registration process as soon as possible.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
