    <VALUE Lang="th">The students have accumulated many experiences in their training.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Completing the exams and tests will determine the extent of their capabilities!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
