    <VALUE Lang="th">Authenticate Call</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah! Thank you very much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">With this, we can start using the database to continue our investigation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Meanwhile, could you help me investigate this rumor? I heard that there is a giant dog wearing children's clothing nearby.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I was surprised!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Could it be that some kids transformed into dogs? It's possible, considering all the other weird stuff that's happening.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Volunteer to Help with Investigation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_11_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It seems that the Sacred Financial Group might be involved in this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We just need to undergo further investigation to prove that.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Similar things have already happened before, but people just ignored them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I just received confirmation that the Police Department in the other area also lacks manpower. This just causes more trouble for us.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">So the sender is Professor Chui Tai Gui...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I think Ang Bee Lan, who's in the Trading Hole Residential Area, knows him.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, I think you should talk to her.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....2</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Where did those spores come from? I believe that the disease that's spreading around was caused by that Spore Allergy.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I heard already that there are monsters blowing out the Spores from the Leonair Campus Basement.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....7</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I think you should get advice from some of the people in this area. Most of them know the "Special Language."</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Force Field function collapsed after that happened.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....8</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">A number of disappearances around this area were also reported not too long ago.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's so much happening… We are working as hard as we can, and it's never enough. We can't even perform our normal duties.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I don't even have a clue of where to start.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Excuse me, could you help me collect information regarding the lost children?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....9</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If we can access the Police Database, we can find important clues regarding this incident. This will be possible after we get more outlets to produce these resources.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Excuse me, could you help me acquire the Recovery Disk from the Mystic Peak Campus?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....10</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I just need to confirm all the information that I'm receiving.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Sure! I can let you borrow this equipment.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Did the Image Expert request this? I trust this stuff with you and that shopkeeper because he's a professional that knows how to handle this equipment. Please return it after you're done.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....11</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Are those dogs really wearing children's clothing? I think we should get their DNA samples from their saliva.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">One moment please...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I brought this simple checking machine to verify the information.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmmm....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This instrument isn't very precise, so we weren't able to learn anything from this sample.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Dog and kid's DNA are almost the same.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is very, very surprising. My guess was right.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....12</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, I'll use the Police Database to search for more information. I will try my best to solve this case.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...13</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This could have been caused by a large-scaled organization. My guess is that this was an experiment conducted by the Sacred Financial Group.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Although it's not clear if other organizations might be doing the same thing, I'm sure this is related to the Sacred Financial Group's hidden activities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_38_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......14</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Have you sent it to him?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That was nice! We lack manpower right now, which is why we may ask you to help us with some tasks. I'm sorry if we cause you too much trouble!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listen to Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Come! That Authentication Terminal can give you access in order to proceed with your investigation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_40_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....15</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Here's another reminder...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Make sure you bring some of your fellow students to help you. A very dangerous journey lies ahead of you. Good Luck!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_43_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, you mean that corpse?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I just received the info, and it's just a bit weird…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That corpse still has a pulse!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Usually, corpses don't cause too many problems in cases like these…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">But now we have to get the corpse before we have a specialist look at it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_45_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Last time I collected the same type of stone from one of my friends in the private jail.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It wasn't noticed since we weren't specialists, but...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Did someone else find this special ore within the past few years?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_46_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's something wrong in the private jail. We need to definitely make sure about the type of stone.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_47_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Agree</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_47_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Decline</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thanks.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I roughly know the location from looking at the map.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You need to pass 3 main gates, and you'll find the special ore around there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Just be careful to do a thorough search before confirming.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You got it from that place, right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We can't contact person in charge, and we don't know what the problem is now…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_49_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Some important mail was stolen, and we must get it back. We're short on hands, and there's no available officers on duty. I'm hoping some students would help us.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Is it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's someone staying in the jail… But it's nobody we arrested!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmm, it looks like I could use your help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now, I've just learned that some instructors have recently disappeared.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It seems that they were all sent to some private jail. Please rescue them if you can!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_51_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">When people get mutated, they often lose their sanity.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We need to take this situation more seriously if we hope to become able to handle it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_52_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_53_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Can you help me check how many criminals are in jail?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please go count them for me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_53_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_54_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The document wasn't complete, so we're not sure if we should double check or not.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_54_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_55_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I guess the names that aren't on that list must still be in the city.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_55_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_56_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It seems the jail is understaffed too, and now they're asking for help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_56_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_57_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's a good thing the list doesn't have the names of truly heinous criminals on it. I've heard of another list of special names, but I don't have enough information to check it out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_57_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_58_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, I still have someone collecting information related to the ore.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">He's the Weapon Shop Owner in Middle Hole. You want to visit him?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_58_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_59_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Sorry, just forget it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now I need your help again. A group of weird men just grabbed the Sacred Gate document.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_59_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you! That was fast!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ermmm....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The mail was torn into pieces. Could you help me find the other pieces?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_60_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hunt them down, and get that document back!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_60_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_61_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you so much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You didn't read it, did you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_61_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_62_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Actually, I'll open and read the content, even if I'm not supposed to.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I heard about the proposal just now, and I'm not sure whether it's a good idea.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_62_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_63_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, that's related to the Middle Hole story~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I also just heard about that…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Would you please help me confirm it again?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_63_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_64_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, I see.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If this is true, then Root Hole will be in grave danger.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Weird, did you just feel an earthquake?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The situation at Root Hole's really serious…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_64_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_65_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What's happening there?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">An earthquake in Root Hole?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We don't understand what's going on.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_65_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_66_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, something at the Middle Hole Entrance is burning.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please go and check it out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_66_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_67_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's too dangerous~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">What if the car explodes?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_67_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_68_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, it's a bomb!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">No one knows who planted it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Wait a minute, is this some terrorist warning? Was that really an earthquake?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_68_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_69_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">How can an earthquake only hit such an isolated area?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">This needs to be checked out before it gets even more dangerous.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_69_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is great!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You can restore the mail by reassembling its torn pieces. Try to see if you can put them all back together again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_70_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please take this walkie-talkie to the Image Expert to fix it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You can use this to contact me at anytime.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_70_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_71_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is really dangerous! What if the car explodes?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_71_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_72_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, it's a bomb.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">No one knows who planted it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Wait a minute, is this some terrorist warning? Was that really an earthquake?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_72_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_73_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Still receiving info, let's just keep in contact with each other.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_73_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_74_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please take the walkie-talkie to the Image Expert to fix it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_75_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The signal's on! The walkie-talkie is fixed…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now we can keep in contact with each other.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_75_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_76_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, I need some time to clean it up.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There aren't many good facilities here. It's good cause for worry since we've mostly got weird facilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_76_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_77_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I hear there's a room underground.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Nobody believed me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We'd better go and check.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_77_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_78_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is a complete report.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We need to give a warning, and the students also need to be careful.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_78_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_79_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">According to the police document, the prison is using too many resources like medicine and equipment.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">This information needs to be confirmed.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_79_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I know it's unusual for a Police Officer to beg for help from citizens like you. However, the lack of available manpower in the Station gives us no choice. I'm very thankful that students like you are willing to help us out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_80_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's pretty funny that this document is fake.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Even a machine can't tell the difference.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It seems like real experts were behind this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_80_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_81_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's no need to bother too much since the internet connection seems to be down.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thanks for your information.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_81_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_82_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The same thing also happened in this city last time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_82_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_83_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">No, it's the police's responsibility to investigate…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">But we still need help from the students.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_83_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_84_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The data came from campus?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If that's true, the situation in Root Hole is getting worse.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_84_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_85_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm not sure what the problem is now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please go to Root Hole and check on it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_85_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_86_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thanks. I know this item isn't anything special, but…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We better request help from the Sacred Financial Group.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_86_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_87_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, what is it called?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">A Doll?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_87_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_88_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please arrest RocknRoll.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_88_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_89_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I have one report that I receive every morning.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are lots of people that enter and leave the refrigeration warehouse at the main wharf. The operators are unable to maintain the warehouse's temperature.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We discovered that old employees with their ID Cards would come in and out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">But we are not sure how many there are… It's not hard to make copies, after all.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway... Will you help us by gathering ID Cards?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_89_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_89_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Reject</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Good work with the investigation! However, we still lack some clues and evidence.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_90_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are two kinds of security guards. The one with a gun is usually the tougher kind.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Higher level security guards have a better chance to holding ID Cards, but they're also more dangerous.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_90_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_91_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Yes. I received them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I appreciate your help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I believe it was not an easy task…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">But we still receive the report every morning. So I think there are still many ID Cards. If you have a time, Please help me to collect ID Cards more.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_91_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_92_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you very much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I will use as a reference.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Actually I was hoping to find this…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_92_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_93_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thanks for visiting us.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I don't know whether this formal procedure is effective or not, but it might be helpful for somebody.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_93_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_94_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_police_1.ntk_95_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hey.. I am the Scientist Student Representative..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Scientist Teacher is at school. If you need anything just tell me.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_1_1_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Time Capsule</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_1_1_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Instructions</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Say hello to senior student</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_1_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Saint List</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_1_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Saint List</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_1_1_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Saint List</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_1_1_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver the time capsule</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_1_1_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if she needs help with anything</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_1_1_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Attend Class</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_1_1_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Attend Class</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! You found it!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's been 18 years since I last saw this device by a specialist named Liu Cheng You.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you very much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Student! Please remember that consistent training will be part of your quest for victory. There will be times of disappointment ahead but you need not be sad. Just focus on your training and you'll definitely become a more powerful individual.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you don't know the importance of physical strength, then it will be very difficult for you to understand future lessons.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">By the way, I need to ask you to do something.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Instruction</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_12_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Did you see the Police Station nearby?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is a police officer waiting for you at the Main Door.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Just approach him and tell him that I instructed you to look for him. I believe he'll have something for you.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Broaden your horizons! It is great to look at things from different perspectives!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Imagine this is part of the lesson!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Someday, this may benefit you and the people you care about.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Did you see the Police Station nearby?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is a police officer waiting for you at the Main Door.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Just approach him and tell him that I instructed you to look for him. I believe he'll have something for you.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We, Scientists have found more facts and know more about the meteorite that happened 18 years ago.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Director must have found out the relationship between our world and Another World.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">He had said that the phenomena caused by the prior actions of both sides will affect our world.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Continue to listen to her story</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The Phenomenon that seemed like meteorite was actually..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">A life form from the Another World could not cross over to our side in one piece so it was divided into so many particles and came over. Saint List is contains the names of us, students. That is how only we have survived the phenomenon.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Continue to listen to her story</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">He must have planned to prepared the students like us for the time when the phenomenon occur..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I guess, he must have done things like that because it is the life or death of our world.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well, aren't all the adults like that?..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">According to the gym managers around here, people of Trading Hole had buried time capsules before the phenomenon.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">They just buried them a few days before it happened so it must help you understand what was going on before the phenomenon.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Great! You've got it!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">This will be a super help for me to investigate this area. Thank you!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Would you like to have some lessons?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's nothing more worthwhile than teaching you students!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The manager's not around, so I can teach you some lessons myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Is that fine with you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is nothing special about this device!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You should find the GPS first, and then an input device..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is a stolen GPS! It's great that you found it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah! I was just talking to myself. You're free to go.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm sorry for acting so strangely.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_s_science.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Welcome to the Trading Hole Area!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am the Archery Section Agent. How can I help you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please feel free to look around if you like.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm sorry the Manager isn't here right now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please come back again later.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">In the meantime, is there anything I can do for you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Request to Attend Class</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_1_1_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_1_1_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_1_1_14">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver the Time Capsule</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_1_1_15">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Gather Info before the Incident</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_1_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Attend Class</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_1_1_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Attend Class</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_1_1_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Time Capsule</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_1_1_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Instructions</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_1_1_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_1_1_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is nothing special about this device!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You should find the GPS first, and then an input device.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is a stolen GPS! It's great that you found it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah! I was just talking to myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Alright, you may go. I'm sorry for acting so strangely.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! You found it!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's been 18 years since I last saw this device by a specialist named Liu Cheng You.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you very much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Student! Please remember that consistent training will be part of your quest for victory. There will be times of disappointment ahead but you need not be sad. Just focus on your training and you'll definitely become a more powerful individual.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....6</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Broaden your horizons! It is great to look at things from different perspectives!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Imagine this is part of the lesson!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Someday, this may benefit you and the people you care about.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh. Ok.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well, even if he's not here, I can give you more information.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">After the meteor fell 18 years ago, the chairman realized the dangers posed by another world to our world. This included the threat of invasion by destructive monsters.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Continue</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It was later discovered that the meteor has made of living biological particles from another world. These transmitted power to organisms on our world. In most cases, this created monsters. In other cases, this resulted in people that became strong enough to survive the ensuing chaos: these are the people whose names are on the List of Saints.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Continue</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The people at SFG thought the best way to prevent this disaster from recurring was to gather the people that were strengthened by the meteor's power.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Unless this new potential was fully explored, and the power from the meteor was properly utilized, then the world would have no protection from otherworldly invaders.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That is why students were especially chosen to join this campus: the end goal is to fully cultivate and develop power that will hopefully be enough to protect our world.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That's what happened.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! You really want to learn, huh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's nothing more worthwhile than teaching you students!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The manager's not around, so I can teach you some lessons myself. Is that fine with you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Agree to Attend Class</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_2_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Do you know there is a private prison at the Sacred Financial Group?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are special minerals that only come from the mine near that prison. It used to be a working area for prisoners.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">A well-refined mixture of that mineral can enhance steel... Especially weapons and armor with special power...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The success rate is too low, however, and it requires a large amount of oil.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Are you still willing to try it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The easiest way to get oil is from the tuna near this area. You could easily find tuna boat workers at the wharf.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Make sure to check the quality of your tuna oil. Some of it is pretty useless.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please get 10 bottles of oil.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well done.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I will put that oil in this machine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I can't guarantee that it'll create something that will help you...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, good luck.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, you received the information that I requested, didn't you? I was so worried about my boss because I couldn't contact him for a long time. I also wasn't able to get any intel around here, so I really appreciate that you were able to deliver this information.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now I can relax just a little bit.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you very much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Wait... I just remembered something.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">A few days ago, I got another time capsule delivery from another student...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There were pictures of the Gangsters trading inside the capsule.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">What's weird is that the SFG Flag is on a ship that probably contains the gangsters' trading goods.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I don't know if this is some weird mistake.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well, I hope this information is worth the reward for your delivery.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Excuse me. I don't know everything, and I'm staying here instead of my teacher, but...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've got a story to tell you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">People used to regularly hold this festival. And then...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Some time ago, after one of these festivals, there was some kind of problem...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is nothing special about this device!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You should find the GPS first, and then an input device.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Would you like to have some lessons?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's nothing more worthwhile than teaching you students!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The manager's not around, so I can teach you some lessons myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Is that fine with you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you don't know the importance of physical strength, then it will be very difficult for you to understand future lessons.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">By the way, I need to ask you to do something.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Instruction</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_5_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Did you see the Police Station nearby?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is a police officer waiting for you at the Main Door.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Just approach him and tell him that I instructed you to look for him. I believe he'll have something for you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is a stolen GPS! It's great that you found it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah! I was just talking to myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Alright, you may go. I'm sorry for acting so strangely.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_archer1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Welcome to the Trading Hole Area!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am the Brawler Section Agent. How can I help you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please feel free to look around if you like.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm sorry the Manager isn't here right now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please come back again later.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
