    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! You found it!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's been 18 years since I last saw this device by a specialist named Liu Cheng You.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you very much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Student! Please remember that consistent training will be part of your quest for victory. There will be times of disappointment ahead but you need not be sad. Just focus on your training and you'll definitely become a more powerful individual.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....6</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Broaden your horizons! It is great to look at things from different perspectives!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Imagine this is part of the lesson!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Someday, this may benefit you and the people you care about.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh. Ok.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well, even if he's not here, I can give you more information.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">After the meteor fell 18 years ago, the chairman realized the dangers posed by another world to our world. This included the threat of horrendous monsters.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It was later discovered that the meteor has made of living biological particles from another world. These transmitted power to organisms on our world. In most cases, this created monsters. In other cases, this resulted in people that became strong enough to survive the ensuing chaos: these are the people whose names are on the List of Saints.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The people at SFG thought the best way to prevent this disaster from recurring was to gather the people that were strengthened by the meteor's power.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Unless this new potential was fully explored, and the power from the meteor was properly utilized, then the world would have no protection from otherworldly invaders.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That is why students were especially chosen to join this campus: the end goal is to fully cultivate and develop power that will hopefully be enough to protect our world.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That's what happened.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! You really want to learn, huh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's nothing more worthwhile than teaching you students!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The manager's not around, so I can teach you some lessons myself. Is that fine with you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Attend Class</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_2_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Do you know there is a private prison at the Sacred Financial Group?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are special minerals that only come from the mine near that prison. It used to be a working area for prisoners.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">A well-refined mixture of that mineral can enhance steel... Especially weapons and armor with special power...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The success rate is too low, however, and it requires a large amount of oil.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Are you still willing to try it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The easiest way to get oil is from the tuna near this area. You could easily find tuna boat workers at the wharf.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Make sure to check the quality of your tuna oil. Some of it is pretty useless.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please get 10 bottles of oil.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well done.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I will put that oil in this machine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I can't guarantee that it'll create something that will help you...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, good luck.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, you received the information that I requested, didn't you? I was so worried about my boss because I couldn't contact him for a long time. I also wasn't able to get any intel around here, so I really appreciate that you were able to deliver this information.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now I can relax just a little bit.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you very much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Wait... I just remembered something.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">A few days ago, I got another time capsule delivery from another student...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There were pictures of the Gangsters trading inside the capsule.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">What's weird is that the SFG Flag is on a ship that probably contains the gangsters' trading goods.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I don't know if this is some weird mistake.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well, I hope this information is worth the reward for your delivery.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Excuse me. I don't know everything, and I'm staying here instead of my teacher, but...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've got a story to tell you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">People used to regularly hold this festival. And then...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Some time ago, after one of these festivals, there was some kind of problem...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is nothing special about this device!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You should find the GPS first, and then an input device.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Would you like to have some lessons?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's nothing more worthwhile than teaching you students!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The manager's not around, so I can teach you some lessons myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Is that fine with you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you don't know the importance of physical strength, then it will be very difficult for you to understand future lessons.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">By the way, I need to ask you to do something.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Instruction</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_5_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Did you see the Police Station nearby?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is a police officer waiting for you at the Main Door.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Just approach him and tell him that I instructed you to look for him. I believe he'll have something for you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is a stolen GPS! It's great that you found it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah, I was just talking to myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You're free to go. I'm so for acting so weirdly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_fighter1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Welcome to the Trading Hole Area!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am the Sword Section Agent. How can I help you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please feel free to look around if you like.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if he has seen suspicious travelers</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm sorry the Manager isn't here right now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please come back again later.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Request to Attend Class</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_1_1_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_1_1_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_1_1_14">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver the Time Capsule</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_1_1_15">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Gather Info before the Incident</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_1_1_16">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if he has seen suspicious travelers</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_1_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Attend Class</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_1_1_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Attend Class</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_1_1_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Time Capsule</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_1_1_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Instructions</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_1_1_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_1_1_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is nothing special about this device!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You should find the GPS first, and then an input device.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is a stolen GPS! It's great that you found it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah! I was just talking to myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Alright, you may go. I'm sorry for acting so strangely.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! You found it!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's been 18 years since I last saw this device by a specialist named Liu Cheng You.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you very much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Student! Please remember that consistent training will be part of your quest for victory. There will be times of disappointment ahead but you need not be sad. Just focus on your training and you'll definitely become a more powerful individual.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....6</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Broaden your horizons! It is great to look at things from different perspectives!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Imagine this is part of the lesson!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Someday, this may benefit you and the people you care about.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh. Ok.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well, even if he's not here, I can give you more information.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">After the meteor fell 18 years ago, the chairman realized the dangers posed by another world to our world. This included the threat of horrendous monsters.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It was later discovered that the meteor has made of living biological particles from another world. These transmitted power to organisms on our world. In most cases, this created monsters. In other cases, this resulted in people that became strong enough to survive the ensuing chaos: these are the people whose names are on the List of Saints.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The people at SFG thought the best way to prevent this disaster from recurring was to gather the people that were strengthened by the meteor's power.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Unless this new potential was fully explored, and the power from the meteor was properly utilized, then the world would have no protection from otherworldly invaders.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That is why students were especially chosen to join this campus: the end goal is to fully cultivate and develop power that will hopefully be enough to protect our world.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That's what happened.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! You really want to learn, huh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's nothing more worthwhile than teaching you students!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The manager's not around, so I can teach you some lessons myself. Is that fine with you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Attend Class</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_2_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Do you know there is a private prison at the Sacred Financial Group?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are special minerals that only come from the mine near that prison. It used to be a working area for prisoners.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">A well-refined mixture of that mineral can enhance steel... Especially weapons and armor with special power...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The success rate is too low, however, and it requires a large amount of oil.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Are you still willing to try it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The easiest way to get oil is from the tuna near this area. You could easily find tuna boat workers at the wharf.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Make sure to check the quality of your tuna oil. Some of it is pretty useless.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please get 10 bottles of oil.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well done.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I will put that oil in this machine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I can't guarantee that it'll create something that will help you...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, good luck.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, you received the information that I requested, didn't you? I was so worried about my boss because I couldn't contact him for a long time. I also wasn't able to get any intel around here, so I really appreciate that you were able to deliver this information.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now I can relax just a little bit.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you very much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Wait... I just remembered something.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">A few days ago, I got another time capsule delivery from another student...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There were pictures of the Gangsters trading inside the capsule.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">What's weird is that the SFG Flag is on a ship that probably contains the gangsters' trading goods.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I don't know if this is some weird mistake.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well, I hope this information is worth the reward for your delivery.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Excuse me. I don't know everything, and I'm staying here instead of my teacher, but...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've got a story to tell you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">People used to regularly hold this festival. And then...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Some time ago, after one of these festivals, there was some kind of problem...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Guessing from their outfits and conversations, I believe that they are not the people from this world. Especially, those two guys did not seem like nice people. They were headed toward Trading Hole and I watched them go. In case, you have to fight them then you better watch out for the guy in the black outfit.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is nothing special about this device!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You should find the GPS first, and then an input device.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Would you like to have some lessons?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's nothing more worthwhile than teaching you students!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The manager's not around, so I can teach you some lessons myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Is that fine with you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you don't know the importance of physical strength, then it will be very difficult for you to understand future lessons.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">By the way, I need to ask you to do something.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Instruction</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_5_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Did you see the Police Station nearby?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is a police officer waiting for you at the Main Door.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Just approach him and tell him that I instructed you to look for him. I believe he'll have something for you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is a stolen GPS! It's great that you found it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah, I was just talking to myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You're free to go. I'm so for acting so weirdly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_knight1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Welcome to the Trading Hole Area!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am the Shaman Section Agent. How can I help you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please feel free to look around if you like.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm sorry the Manager isn't here right now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please come back again later.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Request to Attend Class</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_1_1_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_1_1_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_1_1_14">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver the Time Capsule</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_1_1_15">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Gather Info before the Incident</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_1_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Attend Class</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_1_1_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Attend Class</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_1_1_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Time Capsule</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_1_1_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Instructions</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_1_1_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_1_1_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is nothing special about this device!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You should find the GPS first, and then an input device.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is a stolen GPS! It's great that you found it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah! I was just talking to myself. You're free to go.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm sorry for acting so strangely.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! You found it!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's been 18 years since I last saw this device by a specialist named Liu Cheng You.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you very much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Student! Please remember that consistent training will be part of your quest for victory. There will be times of disappointment ahead but you need not be sad. Just focus on your training and you'll definitely become a more powerful individual.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....6</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Broaden your horizons! It is great to look at things from different perspectives!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Imagine this is part of the lesson!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Someday, this may benefit you and the people you care about.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh. Ok.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well, even if he's not here, I can give you more information.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">After the meteor fell 18 years ago, the chairman realized the dangers posed by another world to our world. This included the threat of horrendous monsters.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It was later discovered that the meteor has made of living biological particles from another world. These transmitted power to organisms on our world. In most cases, this created monsters. In other cases, this resulted in people that became strong enough to survive the ensuing chaos: these are the people whose names are on the List of Saints.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The people at SFG thought the best way to prevent this disaster from recurring was to gather the people that were strengthened by the meteor's power.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Unless this new potential was fully explored, and the power from the meteor was properly utilized, then the world would have no protection from otherworldly invaders.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That is why students were especially chosen to join this campus: the end goal is to fully cultivate and develop power that will hopefully be enough to protect our world.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That's what happened.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! You really want to learn, huh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's nothing more worthwhile than teaching you students!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The manager's not around, so I can teach you some lessons myself. Is that fine with you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Agree to Attend Class</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_2_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Do you know there is a private prison at the Sacred Financial Group?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are special minerals that only come from the mine near that prison. It used to be a working area for prisoners.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">A well-refined mixture of that mineral can enhance steel... Especially weapons and armor with special power...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The success rate is too low, however, and it requires a large amount of oil.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Are you still willing to try it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The easiest way to get oil is from the tuna near this area. You could easily find tuna boat workers at the wharf.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Make sure to check the quality of your tuna oil. Some of it is pretty useless.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please get 10 bottles of oil.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well done.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I will put that oil in this machine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I can't guarantee that it'll create something that will help you...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, good luck.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, you received the information that I requested, didn't you? I was so worried about my boss because I couldn't contact him for a long time. I also wasn't able to get any intel around here, so I really appreciate that you were able to deliver this information.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now I can relax just a little bit.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you very much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Wait... I just remembered something.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">A few days ago, I got another time capsule delivery from another student...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There were pictures of the Gangsters trading inside the capsule.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">What's weird is that the SFG Flag is on a ship that probably contains the gangsters' trading goods.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I don't know if this is some weird mistake.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well, I hope this information is worth the reward for your delivery.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Excuse me. I don't know everything, and I'm staying here instead of my teacher, but...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've got a story to tell you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">People used to regularly hold this festival. And then...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Some time ago, after one of these festivals, there was some kind of problem...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is nothing special about this device!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You should find the GPS first, and then an input device.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Would you like to have some lessons?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's nothing more worthwhile than teaching you students!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The manager's not around, so I can teach you some lessons myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Is that fine with you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you don't know the importance of physical strength, then it will be very difficult for you to understand future lessons.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">By the way, I need to ask you to do something.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Instruction</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_5_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Did you see the Police Station nearby?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There is a police officer waiting for you at the Main Door.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Just approach him and tell him that I instructed you to look for him. I believe he'll have something for you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is a stolen GPS! It's great that you found it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah, I was just talking to myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You're free to go. I'm sorry for acting so strangely.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_spirit1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_trick.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What's the matter?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_trick.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_trick.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It seems like a big problem. Anyone experiencing must be in distress.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_trick.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask what you can do.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_trick.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We don’t know how we are ever going to face you… We were thoughtless… We should have listened to you… As you know, the Daramains have their eye upon the Large Hadron Collider. However, we are not able to hide it by magic… If you take this job, we will be formally recognizing the use of magic to combat.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_trick.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell him you are to take this.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_t_trick.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you. I wish you well.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_video_1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm sorry! The video rental store is closed!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">All the ruckus in this area is forcing most businesses to quit.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, what can I do for you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_video_1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Request for Cassette Recovery Again</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_video_1.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Request for Cassette recovery</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_video_1.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Cassette</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_video_1.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Materials for Recovery</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_video_1.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask for Walkie-Talkie Repair</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_video_1.ntk_1_0_14">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give Walkie-talkie's Accessory</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_video_1.ntk_1_0_15">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask to Make Voice-change Device</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_video_1.ntk_1_0_16">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask to Assemble the Eight Signs of Divine</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_video_1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Request for Cassette Recovery Again</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_video_1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Request for Cassette Recovery Again</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_video_1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Equipment</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_video_1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Equipment</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_video_1.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Equipment</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_video_1.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Lost Child</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_video_1.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah! My daughter is missing! I hope you're here to help me. I'm so worried about her!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">What can I do for you now?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_video_1.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Request for Cassette Recovery</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
