  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ugh...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">How am I to live now...?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listen to Conversation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Show Curving Key</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Show Curving Key</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask what happened on the day of phenomenon</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Practically, the students were considered as outsiders and I had to call the cops. Suddenly, there was blasts heard from the 3rd floor and all the glasses were shattered then people started to change into monsters one by one.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What an old man could do in that situation.. No place to hide and I was just shivering with the fright. Then, a few have forced out the big iron door and little bit later two men came out helping a wounded man. He was soaked in blood.. It was a horrible experience.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I have made eye contact with some of them but I couldn't dare talk to them.. After the first group had gone away, another group of suspicious people came out and two were sent to pursuit the first group and rest of them have went separate ways. Some went to the wharf and some went to storages.. As I recall now, all of them were wearing weird clothes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if he hasn't seen them since</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I haven't seen them since.. I mean the people who did not lose themselves. I saw the pursuers a few times since the incident but they would just disappear soon or looked crazy so I haven't had a chance to talk to anyone.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This building is still under surveillance, and we have no other choice than to work ourselves to the bone. What else can I do?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Yes...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now there's still something left to do.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Let's combine the keys, make them complete.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Although the people from "Green" seem mean and fierce, they're actually quite kind and polite.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's unfortunate that this group is losing their sanity, maybe even their humanity, too.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Alright, come on. Let's try this…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's… It's not too hard.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Though, I was much better at this when I was younger.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Alright, here we go!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Done!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The weather that day was wonderful. I was on my way to work, saying hello to all the laborers and sailors. Except, a group of students were barging into a building, it was such a great day. They were just.. did not have any respect for this old storage manager.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_helper.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">May I ask what you're looking for?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_helper.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Item</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Nice to meet you. Can you please fulfill my simple request?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Receive Suspicious Folk's Request.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The smell of the sea is the only thing that makes me feel at peace here. Those nasty gangsters have seized control of the facilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Scripture</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Whoa! What a sturdy looking student you are!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmm, what is wrong with your clothes though?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">A student must wear something proper.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's your lucky day!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I have just prepared something, why don't you go get it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Consider it as a present from an old man!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listen to his story</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
