    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Cassette</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_7_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Recovered Cassette</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It looks like it's been placed in a humid environment for a long time. Please go to the Trading Hole and ask the Image Expert to recover it. He's a good friend of mine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Wow! Thanks! Is there any news from my friend who fixed this?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Okay! Forget about the cassette for a moment.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">This might be good to know: a few days ago there was a kid who was kidnapped and disappeared,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Who could have done that?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The last thing I heard was something about the No. 4 Wharf. I think you can just ignore it. Maybe.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You might not have any help, but it won't be hard to search for it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's much more you'll need to do in the future.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Somehow, I believe you'll be able to accomplish your goals.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">My duty here was to safeguard the docks and prevent illegal activity here. I'm sad to say that the illegal traders are just ignoring me, and this area is really under the control of evil gangsters.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listen to the Old Man's Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_16_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Although this is just an old book, it's pretty important to me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Take care…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm grateful for what you've done.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hm? The item I gave you came back to me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Get Scroll of Dance of the Warrior</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_10"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 火柱（127級／氣功部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Fire Pillar (Lv127, Class=520, Item=176/32)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Fire Pillar (Lv127, Class=520, Item=176/32)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Fire Pillar (Lv127, Class=520, Item=176/32)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Fire Pillar (Lv127, Class=520, Item=176/32)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_11"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 麻痺（147級／氣功部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Paralyzed (Lv147, Class=520, Item=176/53)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Paralyzed (Lv147, Class=520, Item=176/53)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Paralyzed (Lv147, Class=520, Item=176/53)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Paralyzed (Lv147, Class=520, Item=176/53)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Get Scroll of Illusion</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Get Scroll of Bacteria</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_14">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Get Scroll of Pain</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_15"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 獵魔者（107級／忍術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Demon Hunter (Lv107, Class=12288, Item=362/11)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Demon Hunter (Lv107, Class=12288, Item=362/11)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Demon Hunter (Lv107, Class=12288, Item=362/11)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Demon Hunter (Lv107, Class=12288, Item=362/11)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_16"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 隱蔽（127級／忍術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Cloaking (Lv127, Class=12288, Item=362/33)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Cloaking (Lv127, Class=12288, Item=362/33)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Cloaking (Lv127, Class=12288, Item=362/33)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Cloaking (Lv127, Class=12288, Item=362/33)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_17"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 心靈感應（107級／忍術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Telepathy (Lv107, Class=12288, Item=362/52)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Telepathy (Lv107, Class=12288, Item=362/52)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Telepathy (Lv107, Class=12288, Item=362/52)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Telepathy (Lv107, Class=12288, Item=362/52)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_18"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 火環（127級／劍道部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Fire Rings (Lv127, Class=130, Item=175/50)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Fire Rings (Lv127, Class=130, Item=175/50)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Fire Rings (Lv127, Class=130, Item=175/50)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Fire Rings (Lv127, Class=130, Item=175/50)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_19">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Get Scroll of Upper Jab</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Get Scroll of Force Push</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_4"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 能量爆發（127級／劍道部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Energy Burst (Lv127, Class=130, Item=175/10)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Energy Burst (Lv127, Class=130, Item=175/10)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Energy Burst (Lv127, Class=130, Item=175/10)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Energy Burst (Lv127, Class=130, Item=175/10)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_5"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 迅捷斬（127級／劍道部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Swift Slash (Lv127, Class=130, Item=175/30)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Swift Slash (Lv127, Class=130, Item=175/30)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Swift Slash (Lv127, Class=130, Item=175/30)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Swift Slash (Lv127, Class=130, Item=175/30)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Get Scroll of Death's Dance</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Get Scroll of Phoenix's Wrath</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Get Scroll of Heaven's Judgment</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_9"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 長槍之舞（127級／氣功部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Spear Dance (Lv127, Class=520, Item=176/11)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Spear Dance (Lv127, Class=520, Item=176/11)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Spear Dance (Lv127, Class=520, Item=176/11)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Spear Dance (Lv127, Class=520, Item=176/11)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, we meet again…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">So. You want to enter the Head office this time?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You know students aren't allowed to enter this building. Not only it is the center of a place where time is stopped, but it's also full of dangers.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Still want to go?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Okay. Anyway, my friend also expected this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Bring the code!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You… Do you know what this means?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Actually, this is not just a code. Although the code number is the simplified access code, you cannot escape from this school. Everything that my friend predicted turned out to be true.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are so many Fisherman at there. Please try to eliminate some of them.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Why, hello there!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've never seen you before. I'm not sure, though. You came here looking for me? Do you want to talk about the Sacred Financial Group?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Why? What's wrong? Walking to this area must be tiring, right? I bet you're tired. Take a rest first.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Did you see the Freezing Warehouse over there? There is also a Water Purification Center before in that area. I heard that it performed basic water purification processes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Can you go there and check if the Purification activities are still operational?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Too late!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">How could you spend so much time looking for just one bottle? You already look so tired. There's still a long, long way to go!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Something seems to be wrong with the Water Purification Center's facilities. The generator is unable to function properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Go and get the spare parts for the generator that you can find at the No.2 Wharf. Also, go and find another empty bottle to replace the one you just gave me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">How am I going to deal with your carelessness?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Nevertheless, I have to pay you since you did some work for me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Something strange is going to happen soon!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The series of events that occurred in the Management Office of the Green Gangster Headquarters will lead us to disaster. I heard that these vile individuals have an evil plan. This makes me feel so worried.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The cassette tape recording of the situation that occurred in that office can be acquired in the Management Offices. Please help me steal it so we can further investigate their dastardly deeds.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">That's the video cassette! I hope we can get something substantial in the video for our investigation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_9_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! Students are finally able to access this area! How was your journey? It's dangerous to be in the streets during these times.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I hope you're here to help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listen to Conversation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! Students are finally able to access this area! How was your journey? It's dangerous to be in the streets during these times.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I hope you're here to help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listen to Conversation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! Students are finally able to access this area! How was your journey? It's dangerous to be in the streets during these times.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I hope you're here to help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listen to Conversation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! Students are finally able to access this area! How was your journey? It's dangerous to be in the streets during these times.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I hope you're here to help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_1_3_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listen to Conversation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">My dear student, please accept my request.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I need your help on this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_1_4_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask What's the Problem</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_1_4_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Night Sticks</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_1_4_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Night Sticks</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_1_4_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Night Sticks</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_1_4_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Night Sticks</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_1_4_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Night Sticks</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_1_4_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask What's the Problem</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_1_4_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Guard Rods</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Originally I was doing some clerical work for Leonair Campus Laboratory. Sadly, not long ago, a war broke out here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I came here to offer some support.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">As soon as I arrived here, I saw this super strong light beam shooting out at me, and then I fainted. I woke up a few days after, looked down at my hands</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I had no clue who the hell I killed. I can't remember. And now, I started seeing these mobsters that look exactly like me!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I hear from passersby that a bunch of clones patrol the Sacred Hole area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Look at me! Do I look like a violent individual?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'd never do anything like that. It did feel like something weird happened… Like, maybe I was possessed or something.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Sometimes I go into a sudden trance!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm worried that I might kill another person against my will again...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....6</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Are there any other students who came here to help?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! Please, please help me take care of the mobsters that look exactly like me!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">By taking away whatever weapons you find from them, you can help eliminate crime from the streets.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_3_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_3_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_3_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_3_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_3_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_3_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am very sorry for causing you so much trouble. I just want to clean up the image of the Police Department, give it the respect it deserves. Those mobsters dressed like us to bring disgrace to the police.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you very much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I feel better now. Once again, the good image of the Police Department was restored.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">These vile mobsters dressed like Police Department Officers are causing havoc in the streets.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">People tend to think that the Police Department has become part of the evil Green Organization.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Am I confusing you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am sorry, this stuff… I doubt you're interested in it. Anyway, I'm very thankful that students like you are here to help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_7_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am a Guard destined to patrol the Sacred Financial Group facilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">My designation here still remains the same.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_pguard1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This building is currently under supervision.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's great to see students like you that are here to help!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Change Save Point</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Document</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Building</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Clue</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Entering Building</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about "Green" Secret Hideout</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Show the Key</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about 3rd Floor of "Green" Command Center</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Show the Key</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about "Green"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This building is currently under supervision.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's great to see students like you that are here to help!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Change Save Point</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_1_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about 3rd Floor of "Green" Command Center</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_1_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Show the Key</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_1_12">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about "Green"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_1_13">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Document</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_1_14">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Mail</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_1_15">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if he is in a trouble</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_1_16">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell him what happened</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Smuggling</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Smuggler's Trace</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Building</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_1_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Clue</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_1_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Entering Building</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_1_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about "Green" Secret Hideout</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_1_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Key</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_1_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Show the Key</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This building is currently under supervision.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's great to see students like you that are here to help!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Change Save Point</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_2_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask What's the Matter</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_1_2_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the smuggled goods</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Try to look around and investigate the building carefully.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">See whether you can find any clues.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thanks!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You solved these cases easily! I think you are better in doing these types of tasks compared to the Police Department.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ow! Where did you find this?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">This money is shining and looks a little weird. It's like there's something special about these notes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">With these paper notes, we already have enough reason to arrest them without a warrant. However, you need to acquire Terminal Approval before you can get inside the building.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That is a problem!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Furthermore, we need to have the key to get through the 2nd and 3rd Floors.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Could you help me acquire these keys?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_13_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please be careful!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Those mobsters will attack no matter who you are! On the 1st Floor, there is a freezer supervisor. Please don't simply fight your way through…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's very dangerous in that area. Sometimes, you'll need to resort to running.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is the key!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Why is it broken?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm not sure if we can restore this key to its original form.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I think we'll be alright with this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There should be no more problems getting to the 2nd Floor.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">To go to the 3rd Floor, we must get the key first.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Although the key was bent out of shape, you can ask for help from the Warehouse Supervisor.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">So don't worry!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You will face similar dangers on the 2nd Floor, just like in the Control Center.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please be careful!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_17_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are people who dress like Ninjas in that area. Although they might not have all the genuine ninja skills, they're still more dangerous than normal people.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I think this is okay.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We should have no more problems getting to the 2nd Floor of that building.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This building is currently under supervision.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's great to see students like you that are here to help!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Can you help us completely investigate that building in order to clarify the issues and rumors spreading around?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_20_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The 3rd Floor is composed of a Ball Room and the Top Management Room. I think we can find the clues we need in that area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">However, there are some strong mobsters that await you. Be careful!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Furthermore, those that stay in the Top Management Room are international criminals. Don't approach them! They're too dangerous.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Just run away if you feel overwhelmed.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Don't force yourself to fight them!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Look at all this torn up mail.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Don't you have to put it all back together?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Try to put it back together now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmm... It's really a mailed letter.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The sender is Professor ChuiQingGui.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hold on, this man is the founder of the Sacred Financial Group!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The letter was intended for HongMeiLan. I've heard that name before....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, you can return the evidence now!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Excuse me! Please hand this evidence to the Police Station located in the Trading Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We need to continue with our investigation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I heard that there was a report of a fight in this area. The patrol car was here, and it took all the smuggled goods. This building is now under supervision and investigation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....6</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This looks like normal garbage, but did you happen to see the White Drug Powder and Golden Coin?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It seems that someone was planning to use a fake coin in some exchange. We also need to confirm whether the power is a narcotic.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It cannot be verified as a drug just by looking at it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....7</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah! You're the student sent by the Sacred Financial Group, right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Can you help us with our investigation?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_3_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, please arrest him after you confirm that these are illegal drugs.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....9</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Since the establishment of the Sacred Financial Group, the "Green" gangsters started to be active in the area near the Trading Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That territory has become their hideout.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">From the outside, it looks like a legal Docking operation. These docks actually welcome illegal transport of international goods from different areas.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I wanted to investigate that building on my own, but I can't get into the building after the abnormal phenomenon.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now, I must have sufficient evidence and an arrest permit to perform a search.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_34_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....12</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Two days ago, we hired hacker to break into the Terminal.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It should be done and tested by now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Go and explain the situation at the Police Station at the Trading Hole to obtain the program.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....13</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We are aware of that building's structure!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The 1st Floor is a warehouse, and the 2nd Floor contains several offices.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The 3rd Floor is composed of the Ball Room and the Management Office.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_38_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">During the controversial fight, it was certain that all the supervisors weren't around.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are reports stating that there are smuggling activities at Wharf No. 4.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Although we need to double check this, we are unable to do it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Will you help me investigate and acquire the smuggled goods at Wharf No.4?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Although the situation out there looks the same, those areas are still pretty dangerous.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_40_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......20</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Like what I said before, the gangsters are pretty active in this area. Their numbers grew right after the Sacred Financial Group was established.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Legend says that the power of students has diminished. They can, however, regain their lost power through continuous training and competing amongst themselves.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_43_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We should be able to learn something after investigating this Warehouse.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Part of our objective is to search for the source of the abnormal phenomenon.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The security of the Wharf Passage is getting worse every minute. The storage guards, gas technicians, vicious sailors and security guards have turned into monsters and they wander around in groups destroying the goods stacked in the Wharf.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">People have been fighting over the lacking goods and if this keeps up then more horrible things will occur. I know you must be busy but please defeat them and help me save the goods here.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_45_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thanks to you, I wil be safe for a while!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_46_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You found it!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thanks!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm sure that this is enough evidence.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Is there anyone else who would like to help me arrest those smugglers?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_6_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The smuggler was known to be a member of the "Green" gangster group who rented this building.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">He doesn't plan on running away, which is unexpected. He stays in his room most of the time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Did the suspect fight back?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, thanks a lot!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That Green Gangsters seems to be the source of all the crimes here in this area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I heard that there are students who have special abilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Could you help me investigate this issue?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_9_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_police1.ntk_9_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It used to be so easy to repair a car.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Change Save Point</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Current Status</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah! There you are!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">What were you doing for the past few days?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Me? I'm trying to fix this antique truck!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's really difficult! Can you help me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Change Save Point</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about What Happened</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_1_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Key</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_1_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Truck</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_1_1_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Diesel</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_1_1_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the Truck</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_1_1_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Give the Spare Parts</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_1_1_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Situation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">These supplies can also be used on the ships.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I think the neighborhood also keeps a supply of diesel.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The No.1 Wharf is a short walk from here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! You aqcuired the supplies faster than I expected! Thank you very much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Now, I can start to fix this wreck.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This area suddenly changed and became like this</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">..........3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, people suddenly disappeared.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The trucks and buses stopped moving too!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It was like total chaos here!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.....6</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This vehicle is all out of fuel.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I think we can acquire some supplies nearby.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I heard there are some supplies at the Trading Hole. Please help me!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....10</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are also some spare parts, gasoline, and oil for lubrication in that area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please help me by bringing some of those supplies.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">......12</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Things at the Trading Hole are starting to get messy. I heard that prisoners are trying very hard to escape. There's also the issue of the Management Office staff having a big fight with the students and gangsters.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please go to the Freezing Warehouse and try to find something that we might need for our investigation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next Page</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There was an old man asking me to let students enter that area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The old man wearing white clothes… He looked very peculiar.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I have to take a good look at the office first before I can figure what's going on.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Errr... I was interrupted while fixing this wreck! Just now, a giant dog took away my Key.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I can't do anything now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Help the Truck Driver Recover the Key</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you very much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You look real strong, so I'm sure you can take care of those nasty hounds for me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You seem brave enough...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Do you want to accept my request?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh! You really found it!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It doesn't look the same anymore.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ah! Have you heard about the heroes?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">These are the students who possess exceptional capabilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Yes, I've just heard rumors that they're more than just normal students.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway, thank you very much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">My friends usually provide me with the Diesel supplies I need. Right now, I have no means to acquire Diesel for this truck.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Would you please help me get some Diesel fuel?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please hurry!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's dangerous out there!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I think you can negotiate to acquire the diesel supplies that we need. Please be vigilant!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's really impossible to get this truck to move. I've tried my best to get this thing to work!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I feel so hopeless now....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Could you help me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_truckdriver1.ntk_9_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2007p.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh dear..It's already too late.. So stupid that I lost that..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2007p.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask what's happening</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2007p.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange ill luck package</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2007p.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">ill luck packages have been stolen by Alienated zina which I've collected for a year..I have no idea what she will do with it.. thoroughly understand her.. She eagerly hoped to be in the 12 Earth's Branches..she would have a grudge..but already the matter has decided.. My goodness.. I have no time ! Will you find that packages for me?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2007p.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back to the beginning</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2007p.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">you really have gathered these so many? So thank you.. It's still many packages out there, but I am happy..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I should repay your kindness.. Here.. Choose one you like</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2007p.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to good luck package</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2007p.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to lucky party costume(7days)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2007p.ntk_3_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to lucky party costume(7days)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008_dragonboat.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hi,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">can help me defeat 100[Changgie soldier]?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008_dragonboat.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell the result</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008_dragonboat.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Do you finish to defeat Changgie Soldier??</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008_dragonboat.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Start 'Catch The Chonggie'</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008_dragonboat.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Good luck!!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008_dragonboat.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008_dragonboat.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you so much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You have very special skill.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008_dragonboat.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008m.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">oh~ Isn’t it good luck packages?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">How come you are holding them?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I see... There was like that happening ..I am good that you want to bring ill luck packages instead..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyway thanks to take hard work in charge in stead of my friend</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Nothing big..but hope to be blessed by this lucky necklace..Happy new year~</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008m.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to lucky necklace(7days)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008m.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Already late..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Never seems to come..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">When can I start my work for this year?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008m.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listen to the conversation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008m.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's new year..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I must work hard for this year..but Tired pig never seems to come</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">too loiter on the way here..even though Tired pig should bring good luck packages not only ill luck packages !</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008valentine.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I was lost my love arrow.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Can you help me?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008valentine.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Can I ask a favour of you?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008valentine.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to Valentine Event item</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008valentine.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I heard to birds.I was while a bit sleeps in a grove, cyclops steal my arrow of love</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Can I have my arrow of love please?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you help to me, I'll offer power of love to you.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008valentine.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">To begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008valentine.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you, Kindly student.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You can using power of love while 15days</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008valentine.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to power of Love(M)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2008valentine.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to power of Love(F)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2012xmas_jack.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Snow is the symbol of Christmas but since we are short on Snow Flakes this year so don't expect a white Christmas. Bring me snow flakes then I will exchange it for a gift.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh and this is a secret.. Please don't tell sally that I am here. I am not here to see Genie!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2012xmas_jack.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please exchange it for Snow Bike!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2012xmas_jack.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please exchange it for Rudolph Costume!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2012xmas_jack.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is a Love Letter for you!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2012xmas_jack.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">(After reading the love letter..)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh MY GOODNESS! She knows! This can't be true! Please tell me this is not happening to me!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am going to drink this Christmas away.. Yeah.. Booze is the only friend of man.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2012xmas_jack.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Right? Solo is the best!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2012xmas_selly.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I must get ready for a big Christmas party but all the ornaments for the Christmas tree are missing. Find me the ornaments then I will exchange it for a gift.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I was looking for the ornaments and Jack disappeared. Have you seen Jack?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2012xmas_selly.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please exchange it for Reform Card!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2012xmas_selly.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please exchange it for 1P Card!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2012xmas_selly.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I saw Jack with a girl named Genie!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2012xmas_selly.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What happened? It is almost the Christmas and how can he..? If this is true then would you please deliver this letter to him?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_2012xmas_selly.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Okay, leave it to me!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Welcome back Hero!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Attain your fame and presence once again in Ran World.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I will help you! It won't be hard to acheive with my support.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">* Please make sure to check your class and skill before receiving the item pack. Item pack cannot be exchanged once received.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Submit Hero Inviation for 'Hero Pack'</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Not interested.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange invitation for 'Hero Support Box'</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hero’s weapon will only be provided to heroes who has not shown up</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">over 100 days.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Such heroes will be furnished with Hero Invitations which they can</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">exchange for the weapon.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hero’s weapon are the little welcome back gift for the returning</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">heroes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
    <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Open Shop</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please keep up the good work for our school.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Hero Invitation for Hero's Sword Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Hero Invitation for Hero's Spear Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Hero Invitation for Hero's Staff Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Hero Invitation for Hero's Gun Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Hero Invitation for Hero's Railgun Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_14">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Hero Invitation for Hero's Portal Gun Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_15">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Hero Invitation for Hero's Blade Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Hero Invitation for Hero's Vital Sword Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Hero Invitation for Hero's Bow Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Hero Invitation for Hero's Power Bow Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Hero Invitation for Hero's Vital Bow Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Hero Invitation for Hero's Cestus Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Hero Invitation for Hero's Heavy Cestus Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Hero Invitation for Hero's Vital Cestus Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Good Luck !!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_azi.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please continuously show your Love and Support for Ran Online in 2012!!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_azi.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is the Bus Terminal.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Once have your Bus Ticket ready, you can use the Bus Service to move to another area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ride the Bus</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">OpenShop</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Document Scan is now complete.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Do you want to send?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Send Out Skill Document</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Processing...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Document has been sent.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Begin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Dry ice is very important for storing ice cream, but the dry ice kept in the warehouse has been stolen. It's now your job to find the stolen dry ice.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are some places where the emergency action guide hasn't been delivered yet. Get the guide books near the book stores and distribute them.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You should obtain the security monitor videotape to report about the dead policeman in the prison.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">The prisoners already transferred that videotape somewhere, so try to retrieve the security monitor videotape from the prisoners.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Many students were injured from the spell attacks, and especially large number of students were injured in Root Hole. Retrieve the spell skill document from the Elemental Sorcerer to make defensive mechanism work against the spell attacks.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Completed.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Um . What should I do now?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">For god sake!! Rogue Ruloph stole all my Christmas present that I was going to give away on this Christmas</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Christmas present for those children out there…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Could you help me to take it back?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Did you really take it back?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you so much my dear.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Fortunately I got some items here that Rogue Rudolph did not steal.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you are okay, I would like to give you this for present. How’s that?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to X_Mas RandomBox[7D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to Christmas Box [M] [3D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to Christmas Themed Gift Box [F] [15D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to XMas Special Hat[M][15D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_1_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to XMas Special Hat[F][15D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Did you really take it back?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you so much my dear.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Fortunately I got some items here that Rogue Rudolph did not steal.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you are okay, I would like to give you this for present. How’s that?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to X_Mas RandomBox[7D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_2_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to Christmas Box [M] [3D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_2_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to Christmas Themed Gift Box [F] [15D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_2_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to XMas Special Hat[M][15D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_2_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to XMas Special Hat[F][15D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Did you really take it back?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you so much my dear.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Fortunately I got some items here that Rogue Rudolph did not steal.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you are okay, I would like to give you this for present. How’s that?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_3_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to X_Mas RandomBox[7D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_3_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to Christmas Box [M] [3D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_3_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to Christmas Themed Gift Box [F] [15D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_3_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to XMas Special Hat[M][15D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_3_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to XMas Special Hat[F][15D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Have you ever heard about the Feather of Firebird?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the feather of Firebird.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Say, you want to exchange the Feather of Firebird to 'Firebird Hat'!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Say, you want to upgrade your 'Firebird Hat'</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Feather of Firebird? Firebird seldom reveals itself in this world! Do you know? When, it does appear, it means that something serious is going down somewhere in this world. It is not just considered holy for nothing. Even its feather also contains the mystical power. If you can eliminate monsters and collect some feathers for me then I will make you a hat with power of Firebird.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Did you get the feathers? Let me make you a hat filled with the power of Firebird.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange 1 Feather of Firebird to Firebird Hat (I).</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_3_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Did you get the feathers? More feathers for better hat! So collect them as many as you can!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Receive Firebird Hat (II) [Feather of Firebird(10)+Firebird Hat(I)]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Receive Firebird Hat (III) [Feather of Firebird(30)+Firebird Hat(II)]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_4_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Receive Firebird Hat (IV) [Feather of Firebird(100)+Firebird Hat(III)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_4_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Receive Firebird Hat (V) [Feather of Firebird(300)+FirebirdHat(IV)]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_4_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Receive Firebird Hat (VI) [Feather of Firebird(300)+Firebird Hat(V)]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_4_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Receive Firebird Hat (VII) [Feather of Firebird(300)+FirebirdHat(VI)]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_4_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Receive Firebird Hat (VIII) [Feather of Firebird(300)+FirebirdHat(VII)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_4_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gentlegirl.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Do you have plates from the event ?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Eliminate mobs from your level to collect event plates then bring it to me. I have some nice items to exchange. You want hunt weak mobs and come to me to brag, right? Don't expect any compensation if you do such an action.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gentlegirl.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Oblivion Potion.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gentlegirl.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to E Class Random Box (1~50Lv)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gentlegirl.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to D Class Random Box (51~100Lv)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gentlegirl.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to C Class Random Box (101~150Lv)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gentlegirl.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to B Class Random Box (151~200Lv)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gentlegirl.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to E Class Random Box (201Lv~)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gentlegirl.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's already summer so let's forget all the bad memories in the past. Of course I'm not giving away Oblivion Potion for free because I'm afraid it will get rotten.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gentlegirl.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Receives Oblivion Potion.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gsworldcup.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gsworldcup.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">OpenShop</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gsworldcup.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ride the bus</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Halloween is over already! Why are you summoning me now? What, make jewels?... Geez, that is why people don't play on this server much.. Hey, yeah you over there? Don't you agree?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What can you do with the jewels?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">… Please just exchange the jewel.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh.. You don't know.. Ha Ha.. Of course, because you wouldn't have seen it before. It's alright! Don't be ashamed of your ignorance.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Mounting a jewel on a ring will add extra abilities to the ring. Ruby for HP and Attack Power, Sapphire for MP and SP, Jade for SP and Moving Speed. I am the mastermind who can make such jewels.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">… Please just exchange the jewel.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Okay, get me 15 of each Chipped Ruby, Sapphire and Jade for each normal jewels and 35 of them each for each of deluxe jewels.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Here is chipped ruby.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Here is chipped Sapphire.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_3_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Here is chipped Jade.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">15 Chipped Rubies can be exchanged for a Ruby and 35 Chipped Rubies for a Deluxe Ruby, what do you wish to get?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange 15 Chipped Rubies for a Ruby</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange 35 Chipped Rubies for a Deluxe Ruby</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_4_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange it for a different jewel.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">15 Chipped Sapphires can be exchanged for a Sapphire and 35 Chipped Sapphires for a Deluxe Sapphire, what do you wish to get?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange 15 Chipped Sapphires for a Sapphire</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange 35 Chipped Sapphires for a Deluxe Sapphire</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_5_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange it for a different jewel.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">15 Chipped Jades can be exchanged for a Jade and 35 Chipped Jades for a Deluxe Jade, what do you wish to get?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange 15 Chipped Jades for a Jade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange 35 Chipped Jades for a Deluxe Jade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_6_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to a different Jewel</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_july.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is an Item Assembler distributed and installed by the great robot scientist 'Tony Stark'.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_july.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I would like to assemble my items.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_july.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_juneevent.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It's been a while! Hey, have you heard about the power of Starlight and Moonlight? People at Another World have managed to create a crystal condensed with new type of power using the pureness of the Moon and the stars. However, they've got them stolen to an unknown group, even before they have ever had a chance to use it. Would you please go and retrieve these crystals? If you can get them back then there will be great rewards waiting... Hmm, Hmm.. Anyways, remember that 6 Moonlight Crystals for a Moonlight Casket and 6 Moonlight Crystal and 1 Starlight Crystal can be exchanged for a Starlight Casket.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_juneevent.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">(EVENT) I've got the Moonlight Crystals.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_juneevent.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You remember that 6 Moonlight Crystals can be exchanged for 1 Moonlight Casket and 6 Moonlight Crystals and 1 Starlight Crystal can be exchanged for 1 Starlight Casket, right? Now, what would you like to choose?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_juneevent.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange 6 Moonlight Crystals to a Moonlight Casket.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_juneevent.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange 6 Moonlight Crystals and 1 Starlight Crystal to a Starlight Casket.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_juneevent.ntk_2_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_optimus_seller.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You wouldn't know, how scary my boss 'Veno' is!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You know what? Actually, I am a peace lover!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">This Bike is what 'Veno' used to ride.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I am selling it just to make enough gold to get away to somewhere in the outer space!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hey this is almost Free!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Will you hurry up and just buy this bike?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_optimus_seller.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There was an anonymous intel saying that a Gang called 'Chung' is planning to produce illegal weapons. They are eager collecting massive amount of gemstones to produce illegal weapons.. If you could just take the gemstones headed to 'Chung' while delivered then Saint Foundation will compensate you with a corresponding reward. Only, if you get me an Item which I need get from Saint Foundation. Hey, nothing is free in this world</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please exchange this for Newbie Pack.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please exchange this for Tough Hanger Pack.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please exchange this for Master Pack.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">How can I get the Gemstone?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">How can I get the Pendant?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">All the hostile beings which exist in this world has some connectivity with 'Chung'. Rather weak ones which lower level students can face carry rubies, ones which average level students can face carries Aquas and the ones which are fairly stronger carries Tsavolight to supply them to 'Chung'.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You will be able to acquire gemstones which they carry by defeating them. Of course, its only possible when they do carry such stones.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">How can I get the Pendant?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Pandents are used to produce exclusive ornaments. Therefore, Saint Foundation also has classified it as a 1st grade item and spends lots of time reserving it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Currently, pendants are known to be possessed by only a few people. The Guard in front of Mystick Peak School, Archery Agent at Trading Hole and Jail Warden(Prison) at Prison Entrance who bought Ruby, Aqua and Tsavolight pandents panicly in the past, might be able to make quite a fortune now. Go talk to them, you might find a way to acquire them!.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Well, I don't even need to mention but who would have thought those useless items in the past could be come a Gold Mine now?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">How can I get the Gemstone?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_summon.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This stone is created to pay a tributes to the honourable</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">hero of Ran GS.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Be the hero of this event and make this an event prepared</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">only for you in Ran Global Service.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">We hope you could enjoy such an honorable benefit which is only</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">possible because Ran GS is a service provided by the developer</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">directly.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_summon.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Who will be the first Hero to reach the level cap of Ran GS?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
