  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_director.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Who are you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_director.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Problem</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_director.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Looking Amaruoyin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_director.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Since you're already here, you should know about the Human Segregator. I helped the professor set up the machine, and the world is starting to change. I'm not sure what will happen in the future.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_director.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_director.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I escaped with other researchers, but after a while I met a student who looked almost exactly like you. I heard he knew about the Segregator's issues, and he said he wanted to fix it. I gave my weapon to him, but it seems like this situation isn't quite over yet.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_director.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_director.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">After that, I heard one of the students, called Zhao Chen, took it and ran away. He seemed to have lost his sanity when it happened. Now I want my weapon back.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_director.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_director.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What do you think about knowing that Amaruonuoryin is still alive?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">No matter how, I want to get back the Human Segregator, and I think we need to get the Clone Sphere Accessory.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_director.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Next</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_director.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">When I tested the machine, it recorded that one of the students already made a few Clone Spheres, and that an Amanuoruoyin Clone Sphere was also made. The place in question would be the Head Office.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_director.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Question End</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_director.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Is it over? I'm not sure if Amanuoruoyin knows, but his name is on the list. I don't know why his name is recorded on it, but please leave now if you're not here to help!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_director.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Can you help me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Do you still remember a person named Hong Ji Yoon that helped you recover your memories by giving you an item? I have prepared a hair pin and letter, so would you please send them to Hong Ji Yoon for me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Can you help me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_10_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Reject</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I need to be alone and think about who I am and what I can do?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What are you holding?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Delivery</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I've heard Hong Ji Yoon's name… I think maybe I need her help to get my memories back too. Would you ask her for me please?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_3_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh... You weren't able to get it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_4_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell the Results</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh... You weren't able to get it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_5_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell the Results</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh... You weren't able to get it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_6_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell the Results</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If it's not the Sacred Gate or Phoenix School, then it should be Mystic Peak School. So sorry for troubling to you, but can you help me with this again? Please?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_7_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Assist</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If the Sacred Gate School doesn't have any records… Maybe the Phoenix School has…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_8_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Assist</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I don't know why I can't remember anything… I mean, it's just not right having all these holes in my memories.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_1_9_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Assist</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Still no clue. I can't remember anything.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I think I was registered as a student… Somewhere. Can you go to the Sacred Gate Student Information Room to check if there's any information on me? You only can search by name, and you won't get detailed information if the name is not accurate.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What to do if I wasn't a student? Only schools can get the name list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">That is... Thank you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I think you can get it from the rest of the schools.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You got it? Oh, so I was a Mystic Peak Student!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thanks so much! I hope we can continue to help each other out in the future: you helping me uncover more of my past, and me doing whatever it is you might need help with.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you, I seem to remember something. Not everything, but a little bit more…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hong Ji Yoon gave it to me? She should know me, I can't remember it now</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you, and… Sorry, me? If I can help you out, I suppose I'll let you know.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leedaeuk.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm sorry, but the other students need me now. And there're so many problems to take care of.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What's the matter?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What's the matter?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anything you want to talk to me about?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Wondering the purpose of approaching me?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It might be messy and troublesome to collect so many accessories, but you might find it useful in the future. &lt;/TEXT&gt;</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_10_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Accessory</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">In future, I will tell you the reason for collecting all these accessories. Now, you just try the best to collect as many as you can.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_11_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Accessory</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_12">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Look, would you please deliver this letter for me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_12_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Agreed</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_13">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Letter? What kind of letter did Chui Yin Xi send?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_13_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept the Letter</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_14">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You're finally back. Did anyone notice you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_14_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Camera</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_15">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Why are you here? You're wasting time!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_15_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Inform Delivery Complete</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_16">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Nice to meet you. I can't give you all the details, but please give this letter to one of the teachers. It's very urgent.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_16_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please accept the letter.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_17">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Why are you here? You're wasting time!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_17_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Inform Delivery Complete</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_18">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Why are you here? You're wasting time!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_18_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Inform Delivery Complete</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_19">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Nice to meet you. I can't give you all the details, but please give this letter to one of the teachers. It's very urgent.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_19_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please accept the letter.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I saw students training, and it seems so familiar to me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Here's a camera. If anyone suspicious comes mentioning training skills, take a picture of him for me, will you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept the Camera</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_20">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Nice to meet you. I can't give you all the details, but please give this letter to one of the teachers. It's very urgent.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_20_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please accept the letter.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_21">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm sorry, but the other students need me now. And there're so many problems to take care of.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_21_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Problem?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_22">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I only can become stronger to stabilize the current situation. From now on I will concentrate to train students.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_22_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Confirmation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_22_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Proposal</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_22_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Confirmation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_22_12">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Confirmation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_22_13">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell the Truth</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_22_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Confirmation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_22_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Confirmation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_22_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Confirmation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_22_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Confirmation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_22_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell the Results</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_22_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Confirmation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_22_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell the Truth</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_22_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Proposal</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Is that the design layout that you're holding?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_3_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Accessory</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What are you holding?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_4_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Accessory</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It might be messy and troublesome to collect so many accessories, but you might find it useful in the future.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_5_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Accessory</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Quick! Show me the letter.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_6_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver letter</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Seem like you have to go through Semester Test. Perhaps, it won't be too difficult.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_7_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Accept Semester Test Confirmation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It might be messy and troublesome to collect so many accessories, but you might find it useful in the future. &lt;/TEXT&gt;.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_8_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Accessory</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It might be messy and troublesome to collect so many accessories, but you might find it useful in the future. &lt;/TEXT&gt;</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_1_9_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Deliver Accessory</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Erm… Please collect the parts when you're free, and please do not tell anyone, but I'm collecting accessories.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Erm... Wharf Passage... The Green Group was missing last time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I know I need to do my very best. I need to push myself a little more…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Even though things might not seem so hard, just know that stronger opponents are always waiting just around the corner. Don't give up, and never lose focus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Can you please repeat again that? Are you saying "Amanuoruoyin?" How come…? Please wait for a while.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please give this letter, and say "Amanuoruoyin.".</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What luck! It's really "Amanuoruoyin."</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about who is "Amanuoruoyin"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I told you before, I've lost some friends because of something that happened. "Amanuoruoyin" is one of my friends, and I'm thanking Amanuoruoyin is still giving us help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">This is… Information from Amaruoyin? Amaruoyin is still alive… Professor Chui's Research really did cause the world's chaos? This is the only way to stop it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask Who is Amaruoyin</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Amaruoyin is Amanuoruoyin's that came with us to stop the chaotic situation. Amaruoyin slowly lost her mind and memories from what we know. It seems that Amaruoyin was the target of Professor Chui's Experiment.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Continue</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I thought that monster was Amaruoyin. I believe Amanuoruoyin would also agree, caring for his sister.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">That is why he blames himself, and wants to spread the truth about Amanuoruoyin as soon as possible.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I need to concentrate on collecting accessories, but I've heard about this design layout</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Like the other students, we all want to stop this chaotic situation and find a way to move that place. We found Professor Chui's experiment in hopes of discovering the answer. We followed instructions to chase something, and ended up getting separated, and then suddenly... Well, the tragedy happened. Some of them became Clone Spheres, but I don't have time to say much more. I'll give you the details later if I get the chance.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Erm... After Chui Yin Xi read the proposal, he didn't know about the design layout! Weird…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The rumor is true. Although we might need a few parts, it's possible to create a… Human Segregator Machine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Human Segregator</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Human Segregator... Me and my friends don't really understand. We can only guess it's a counter to the Clone Sphere.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Why are you so curious? I'll tell you more about what I know later. I've come here to help my friend, so let me try to do that.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you, and be careful.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You met Ruoyin? Where?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Erm....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ruoyin found Yin Xi's scent... That's surprising.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You must inform Yin Xi about this....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I have many things I need to say, but now I can't... I need help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'll give you more details later, but now there's no time. Please deliver as quickly as you can.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Is it true? Thank you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Sorry, I immediately asked for your help because this was so urgent.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about Problem.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I can't tell you the reason right now, but please be careful.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">If I'm not wrong, Chui Yin Xi, Head Office Chief Professor Chui's Grandson, was kidnapped by Green's Group before and lost contact. Why is he here? I've heard Professor Chui's Experiment caused all the weird things that are happening today. Yin Xi has to know something.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listen to the Story</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I saw him in training. Chui Yin Xi is the best of the best among all the students.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Learning and training is good work and helpful for students. But he never slowed down, and never trusted anyone else very much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">(Erm.... It might happen.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">It will be hard to stay safe, my friend. Be careful.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">This unbelievable situation cannot be handled alone. Help and teamwork will be necessary.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I hope you can give this letter to Chui Yin Xi in the future if you have the chance.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">That is the truth about power, and it's as true now as it was in the past. Your skills and teamwork are useless unless you work hard. Put more effort into your training.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_leejin.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_a.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hello~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm Ami.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_a.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listen to Story</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_a.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Help with her Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_a.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's a citizen who needs you to save her from some suspicious men.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I can't help her, but I know you have the power to save her.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_a.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I told you before that there's a good citizen who needs your help. I know, you can do this!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_a.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Agree</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_a.ntk_3_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Reject</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_a.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are lots of shady characters involved in the kidnapping. Prepare yourself well otherwise you will be in great danger.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please take care.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_a.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_a.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Really?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I was so worried... What load off, to see you.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_a.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_b.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hello~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm Ami.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_b.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Listen to Story</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_b.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Help with her Request</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_b.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There's a citizen who needs you to save her from some suspicious men.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I can't help her, but I know you have the power to save her.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_b.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm sorry, but I don't think you can help her.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">You need to train more, become stronger.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please help us after you've gained some more power.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_b.ntk_3_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I told you before that there's a good citizen who needs your help. I know, you can do this!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_b.ntk_3_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Agree</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_b.ntk_3_1_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Reject</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_b.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are lots of shady characters involved in the kidnapping. Prepare yourself well otherwise you will be in great danger.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Please take care.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_b.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
