  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Becoming one of the best master of a humanity is the destiny of a fighter by taining one's body. Which weapon would like to take? Dex or Power type would be good for an Extreme Class.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
