  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Watching the target and becoming one with it is the basics of Archery and handling a 'Practice Bow' skillfully is the start of it.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
