  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skillhelper_1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Your character's Skill Points may not be enough to learn Grade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skillhelper_1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skillhelper_1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I will offer quests for you to earn more Skill Points</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Some of these quests might be a little difficult.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Good luck!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skillhelper_1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skillhelper_1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I will notice the strength of the abilities</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skillhelper_1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Are you ready? I cannot keep retain this power!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Yes, I'm ready</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Item</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ruturn</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You just became more powerful now! You must be the person chosen by fate. Do you know that you can earn additional opportunity to strengthen yourself?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Asking about the opportunity.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Item</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm not interested</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Have you thought about it enough?.. Are you ready to receive the one last present?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ready to receive the power</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_2_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_2_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hu Hu.. What did I tell you? We meet again.. Hmm, you seem ready to receive this power.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_3_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I will comply at the last summon.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_3_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Maybe, later…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_3_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Have you thought about it enough?.. Are you ready to receive the power?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_4_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ready to receive the power</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_4_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">We meet at last. You might think that we are just another people we meet along the way but our meeting had been preordained. I have waited long years to give you this power.. So, how about it?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_5_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the power</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_5_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Not interested..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_5_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_5_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Machinator's Call</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_5_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Machinator's Test</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_1_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You are not yet ready to be here. Come back later when you are better than this..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I want to check your ability first, so please eliminate Crazy Bomber in Prison Test Zone.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Okay, think about it and find me when you are ready.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What can I do?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_11_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I don't know</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Even though the power enhancement was helpful last time, it will not be easy this time. You must maintain your consciousness until you fully accept my power again.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I have confident</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_12_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I will come back next time</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_12_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Okay, think about it and find me when you are ready.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Good luck! You now are powerful enough to maintain the balance of this world… please… help save this world!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmmm… I must have overestimated your ability…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Have you ever heard about the 7 Absolute Points? There, 7 of the Solidified Stone lies. I am not really sure what those 7 Solidified Stones are but you must balance them to end this chaos.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What can I do?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Not sure</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Not yet! However, if you keep up your training and become strong enough to sustain the power of darkness than you will be able to straighten the lost balance of Solidified Stone. Will you be able to handle it?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I can do this..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Maybe, later..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_3_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmm, I guess I have an eye to seek a person after all. Ok, think about it one last time and come back when you think you are ready.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hmm, you seems to have got stronger than last time. I am always ready so come back whenever you are.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Congrats! Now, you will be able to acquire a stronger power.. Come back when you get stronger.. I have one last present for you..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Good Luck! I miss the old days when everything was in peace.. Please.. Bring the peace to this place..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">My mistake, I thought you were someone better.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm glad you are coming. I just want to help you earn new power. Pass my exam and you'll get new sphere to learn the power.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_skpoint_17_18.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sp_blueevil.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Wow! That Carl is fearless!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hm, but as soon as you see the dark terror...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">If you don't want to see that, then you can escape back to your world now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'll wait for you to make your choice. Hahaha~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sp_blueevil.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Open Shop</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sp_evil.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Welcome.... Welcome....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Do you have any business with me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Just remember that the reward needs to be worth my work, okay?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sp_evil.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Restore Lost EXP</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_square_nin_teacher.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_square_nin_teacher.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask what you can do.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_square_nin_teacher.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The result of the investigation says that the Daramais have their own stories. The good Lagians pushed them back into the darkness. Despite being kept in the dark, these Daramais can still see through the unique senses they posses.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_square_nin_teacher.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell him you are to take this.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_square_nin_teacher.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Receive Daramai's Document Information</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_square_nin_teacher.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hope this report will help.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_square_teacher.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_square_teacher.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">trade.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_srp_seojia.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">What had happened? I cannot remember anything. I think I have lost consciousness by a strong power, unknown… I keep seeing a vision of weird looking monster.. I am not sure what happened but since you have saved my life, let me show you some rare object. These are bit expensive but they are really hard to find.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_srp_seojia.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_srp_seojia.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_srp_seojia.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Anyways, thank you very much! We will meet again, if we are meant to be!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">May the guardian of Daian be with you..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade Items</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand over the letter</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hear her Story</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand over the letter of introduction</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Talk about So Sung Il</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_14">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about unidentified assailant</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_15">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Talk about So Sung Il</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_16">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask her what she found out about this world</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_17">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand over the specimen</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_18">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Use the ring of another world</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_19">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand over the parchment</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her Tarsan has sent you here</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_20">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hope you use the spell</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_21">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Respond to her call</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_22">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hope you use the spell</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_23">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Ring of Saintroll (C) with new ring</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_24">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Ring of Saintroll (B) with new ring</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_25">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange Ring of Saintroll (A) with new ring</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="th">For now, tell him you have eliminated them</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand over the Urgent Message</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand over the Lucian's Memo</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask her to introduce herself</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if she needs help with anything</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her the message you brought</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Hand over the piece of Magic Flame</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">All our members wanted our home to be a better place to live and that is why we are here.. War was no good to either side. We needed very strong power to make the world better..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask about the strong energy</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">There are some people who came to this world from our side, a long time ago. What they have brought has very strong power. I can sense such power from you. That's weird.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her you would like to know more</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The power of saintroll can only be held by those chosen ones. I am not sure how to explain it to you in this world's language.. I will soon know how if I talk with you more.. Hope you can come by here often..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">When we first came to this world, one of us got injured. There was another member who left behind with that wounded member.. Would you please go find him? One is Veno and the other is called Evilplate Monk..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_13_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask if she knows where it is</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I remember the ocean near by.. Not really sure though.. If it is hard to get there then I will send you there myself.. One more thing.. When you find Veno tell him that Suah is well so he shouldn't worry..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her you will do it for her</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell me when you are ready. It might cause you headache or dizziness so be careful.. Ready?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her you are ready</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Oh, that's good to hear.. But I don't have enough medicine to supply them. There will be a monster called Magic Flame inside the tunnel, you will be able to acquire, required materials so please go get me some.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ok, now I have made enough medicine. Please take this to Evilplate Monk.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Also.. Would you please deliver a letter to Evilplate Monk for me.. It is a personal matter but.. Please do this for me..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her you will deliver it</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Mr.No-Name.. Who we helped.. Oh, you brought what I have lost.. Thank you and welcome.. Shh.. Quite..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask her what is going on</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Adoniechus.. Must have found one in this world.. Thank you.. I should tell my friends about it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">It is hard to acquire information from outside since I am at an isolated place like this. I just hear stories from the people like you who come visit me. I would like to investigate more, would you please help me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Thank you! I will study the difference between my world and this world through this specimen. I am not sure how accurate the data will be but it would be better than doing nothing. This is a mysterious Ring with power of Saintroll. This will be helpful.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You've gotten stronger. If you get to where So Sung Il is then you will be able to find Multilock who has parchment. Take parchment from Multilock. Then, I will make the ring which I have given you more stronger.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The parchment you have got me has ancient spell written on it. I am not sure how it has got to this world but I can use this spell and make you a stronger ring.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Take the ring off from your finger. I cannot use the spell while you are wearing the ring. Tell me when you are ready</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her you are ready</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_26_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The reason for my urgent call is that I have figured out how to bring out the power of saintroll ring at once. I have found a passcode from the parchment. Tell me when you are ready.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Take the ring off from your finger. I cannot use the spell while you are wearing the ring. Tell me when you are ready</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her you are ready</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_28_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">One of my party member is surveiling me.. Would you make him go away for a while.. I need to tell you so many things but I cannot right now..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her you will help</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">he is strong.. be carful..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">The opponent is Gorusi and he will be a difficult one to defeat. He is a bit odd and can't talk him through. A person who ordered Gorusi to watch me is called Lucian, go find him. He went towards the end of the tunnel so move towards there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Tell her you will find Lucian</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Gorusi might chase you at anytime, so be very careful.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">You did great. How can he order something like this to Gorusi, I guess he cannot trust other members of the party. Would you go back to the end of the tunnel again and gather more information? Please!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I see. How can he do this to.. the same members of his party.. Thank you for everything.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I'm Suah. I am not from this world, I am from the place what your kind call "Another World".</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sua.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Ask her for what and why she came here</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sword_sdchange.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sword_sdchange.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Trade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_sword_sdchange.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Exchange to 10th Grade of Spirit Sphere</VALUE>
