<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Fierce battles keep occurring in Lost Island.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">They are having a hard time recently as Mutant Citizens suddenly appears too much. So can you help them to overcome this situation?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I have been investigating this area for a few days and I found out this place was hit by meteoric shower. Plus, I have an intel saying that there is a meteorite outputing powerful energy had fell here but could not be able to find it. I still need more clues.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I found confidential documents about Research Complex and Power Plant. According to the documents, Dr. TK has constructed power plant to source the power for research complex. It may be a obvious info but please do convey it to 'Student Director (Dispatched)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">I found confidential documents about Research Complex and Power Plant. According to the documents, Dr. TK has constructed power plant to source the power for research complex. It may be a obvious info but please do convey it to 'Student Counselor</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Creatures mutated by virus are getting out of hands. It would cause a catastrophe if they manage to get out from Power Plant. Please take care of them before they get out. It would make the research of teachers and students here whole lot easier.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Discovered very powerful human type creatures near Solar Power Facility. You must defeat them first in order to find a very important clue. I expect very strong resistance... I am worried because the student who went out to do this mission is not still back yet.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Long time ago, Dr. TK has forced an experiment on live bodies of the workers and people here soley for his ambition. Many people showed side effects but some had managed to escape and went back to their formal lives... Who is Nurse Trainee (Dispatched)??</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Back</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Creepy sound is coming from the top of the Forbidden Tower.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Due to the sound, many students can’t sleep well and suffer from nightmare.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">Can you find what happens there?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Assassins dispatched to Lost City and Industry Complex have a passionate discussion about deadly venom which it put on enemy’s weapon.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="th">I can’t understand why they are so obsessed about it, but can you collect venom samples for them?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="th">Return</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>

